/8ac52495b195023cc99019ec744cef84b91d1b3f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/git/commits/c09da659f2d6f4fe8e7f007cf96e536cd9bc0d61","verification":{"payload":"tree 8ac52495b195023cc99019ec744cef84b91d1b3f\nparent 59e63fc7c529551ee4352b12a6f62285f31c0b54\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791238148 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791238148 +0000\n\nGive the insights quadrant chart a measured box in tests\n\njsdom measures every element as 0x0, so the chart''s responsive container\nwarned on each mount that it had no size to draw in. The cost-vs-risk\ntests now give the chart''s container the box a card column gives it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WbZgdghHXLJt3MHgdA9mei\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQCtlr6NI\n5TU/epIWMoBfcII4qC3m1fw0/cSdyHLZE6bFQyt9Ruf6XI7HJBUlakpWIwM/2T49cwSfl6FfTFGY\nWQU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T22:28:13Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commit/c09da659f2d6f4fe8e7f007cf96e536cd9bc0d61","node_id":"C_kwDOUfsJGdoAKGMwOWRhNjU5ZjJkNmY0ZmU4ZTdmMDA3Y2Y5NmU1MzZjZDliYzBkNjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commit/59e63fc7c529551ee4352b12a6f62285f31c0b54","sha":"59e63fc7c529551ee4352b12a6f62285f31c0b54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commits/59e63fc7c529551ee4352b12a6f62285f31c0b54"}],"sha":"c09da659f2d6f4fe8e7f007cf96e536cd9bc0d61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commits/c09da659f2d6f4fe8e7f007cf96e536cd9bc0d61"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commits/59e63fc7c529551ee4352b12a6f62285f31c0b54/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T22:08:17Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T22:08:17Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Run each React''s updates inside its own act in tests\n\nThe docs tabs test drove React with its own act but never declared an\nact environment, so React warned on every update. The two-React interop\ntest let the 19.2 container''s updates happen inside the test React''s act\nonly; the container now exports its React''s act and the test renders and\nclicks inside both.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WbZgdghHXLJt3MHgdA9mei","tree":{"sha":"1c22bb60b3bd44001a7c118c88dcd99769106b0a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/git/trees/1c22bb60b3bd44001a7c118c88dcd99769106b0a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/git/commits/59e63fc7c529551ee4352b12a6f62285f31c0b54","verification":{"payload":"tree 1c22bb60b3bd44001a7c118c88dcd99769106b0a\nparent fa12d885c1ec9634be5c79cfa8bb415f1f6a9e41\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791238097 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791238097 +0000\n\nRun each React''s updates inside its own act in tests\n\nThe docs tabs test drove React with its own act but never declared an\nact environment, so React warned on every update. The two-React interop\ntest let the 19.2 container''s updates happen inside the test React''s act\nonly; the container now exports its React''s act and the test renders and\nclicks inside both.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WbZgdghHXLJt3MHgdA9mei\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOyUKAFy\nu2EPVsBCua34CE6JiNP/8WD8vvrad0D0KrTf1au5YzbPZdQWm767w1l97CKuzarWY89ouU+TMZm6\nRgw=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T22:28:13Z"}},"committer":{