ODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commits/fa12d885c1ec9634be5c79cfa8bb415f1f6a9e41/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T22:03:34Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T22:03:34Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Stop jsdom scrollTo and Angular ID-collision noise in tests\n\njsdom implements no scrolling and reports every scrollTo the router makes\nafter a navigation; the setup files now give it the no-op a page that fits\nwould see. The Angular host test declared the same test-shell component in\ntwo tests, which Angular flags as an ID collision; it is declared once.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WbZgdghHXLJt3MHgdA9mei","tree":{"sha":"979fea265d8ba6875e187aaf3db5dd3c35f0e6da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/git/trees/979fea265d8ba6875e187aaf3db5dd3c35f0e6da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/git/commits/fa12d885c1ec9634be5c79cfa8bb415f1f6a9e41","verification":{"payload":"tree 979fea265d8ba6875e187aaf3db5dd3c35f0e6da\nparent 820da2e4a9b13820c0eade7e175d03c68863e108\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791237814 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791237814 +0000\n\nStop jsdom scrollTo and Angular ID-collision noise in tests\n\njsdom implements no scrolling and reports every scrollTo the router makes\nafter a navigation; the setup files now give it the no-op a page that fits\nwould see. The Angular host test declared the same test-shell component in\ntwo tests, which Angular flags as an ID collision; it is declared once.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WbZgdghHXLJt3MHgdA9mei\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQK4Hkyxp\nccjSduBPloq/9peukgAXjvli4iG7XiL/Dpfp+uzeDgsh6VrSVn7GV55EipC534OsFZwlwQP9eu3O\n+AI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T22:28:13Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commit/fa12d885c1ec9634be5c79cfa8bb415f1f6a9e41","node_id":"C_kwDOUfsJGdoAKGZhMTJkODg1YzFlYzk2MzRiZTVjNzljZmE4YmI0MTVmMWY2YTllNDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commit/820da2e4a9b13820c0eade7e175d03c68863e108","sha":"820da2e4a9b13820c0eade7e175