on: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WbZgdghHXLJt3MHgdA9mei","tree":{"sha":"639c6e8a848b2809942f832633e743dfb078e5d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/git/trees/639c6e8a848b2809942f832633e743dfb078e5d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/git/commits/820da2e4a9b13820c0eade7e175d03c68863e108","verification":{"payload":"tree 639c6e8a848b2809942f832633e743dfb078e5d7\nparent 997fac889f4d985b9d199f57d09f404d42ce5d37\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791237710 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791237710 +0000\n\nResolve single-copy test packages through their exports\n\nThe test aliases pointed @tanstack/react-router and the other single-copy\npackages at their directories, which Vite resolves through `main`: the\nCommonJS build, whose router-core warns of a circular require in every\nworker. A pre plugin now resolves the bare specifier from the shell instead.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WbZgdghHXLJt3MHgdA9mei\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOAtDZCc\naQuxbYpFgdI1RvbiZ2rpyB9hSjuAu8KkAP7S9bYMWuk6A0kZVtn7y8TKtctN/R8V9mMwwzksFyrc\nPg0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-05T22:28:13Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/c