ude/git/trees/b9d873211c4bf64bf9b0e89cf7b236fcf85bda11"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/git/commits/39608d4ffd44d1fab9e24bd38656854e5f26ab18","verification":{"payload":"tree b9d873211c4bf64bf9b0e89cf7b236fcf85bda11\nparent 668c816392d1357a5580022dedf3c46f4dad772a\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791152612 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791152612 +0000\n\nSwitch the theme from the profile menu on click again\n\nThe runtime''s transition pause already removes the restyle work that made the\nmenu stutter, so the deferred switch was not worth its extra plumbing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EsMajMRL6X4p5emnmXXZvK\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQAxAVZbL\nqdkzKV08358JNo5amOFyxgcfqsyZ5W70ET2kWhKLdCxFhDMGvyyDQSGcbEGqOUZjP/KE9lpJSJ6w\nggQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T22:23:34Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commit/39608d4ffd44d1fab9e24bd38656854e5f26ab18","node_id":"C_kwDOUfsJGdoAKDM5NjA4ZDRmZmQ0NGQxZmFiOWUyNGJkMzg2NTY4NTRlNWYyNmFiMTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commit/668c816392d1357a5580022dedf3c46f4dad772a","sha":"668c816392d1357a5580022dedf3c46f4dad772a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commits/668c816392d1357a5580022dedf3c46f4dad772a"}],"sha":"39608d4ffd44d1fab9e24bd38656854e5f26ab18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commits/39608d4ffd44d1fab9e24bd38656854e5f26ab18"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commits/39a563a25c75d4d4593fe9b1ce37f4d910af3e6a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T21:09:07Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T21:09:07Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Fix the #54 review findings and drop telemetry code nothing ships calls\n\n- Request spans report a provider failure to the shell''s diagnostics instead of dropping it,\n  and a timed-out request ends as an error rather than abandoned.\n- Docs: a request span names the container that sent it, the abandoned-runs query leaves out\n  cancelled requests, and the runtime README and changeset say each API must allow\n  `traceparent` in CORS. The changeset no longer claims the adapters dropped the span types.\n- `Span.end()` takes no end time; nothing passed one.\n- The mount telemetry handle keeps only `dispose()`; its test-only members, the tracing switch,\n  framework records and the write-only counters are gone, and spans and workflows share one\n  attribute filter. The runtime is now about 250 bytes larger than on dev instead of 1.9 KB.\n- The public API check reads untyped functions'' results and function types'' signatures.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017JGGRbPCDVdbxpXVoEdtX8","tree":{"sha":"3eb12c9f37490bd71b588d85044ac7d178dd5b5e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/git/trees/3eb12c9f37490bd71b588d85044ac7d178dd5b5e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/git/commits/39a563a25c75d4d4593fe9b1ce37f4d910af3e6a","verification":{"payload":"tree 3eb12c9f37490bd71b588d85044ac7d178dd5b5e\nparent 442f33c109cf551db2ab4db80f192161a82da5e5\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791148147 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791148147 +0000\n\nFix the #54 review findings and drop telemetry code nothing ships calls\n\n- Request spans report a provider failure to the shell''s diagnostics instead of dropping it,\n  and a timed-out request ends as an error rather than abandoned.\n- Docs: a request span names the container that sent it, the abandoned-runs query leaves out\n  cancelled requests, and the runtime README and changeset say each API must allow\n  `traceparent` in CORS. The changeset no longer claims the adapters dropped the span types.\n- `Span.end()` takes no end time; nothing passed one.\n- The mount telemetry handle keeps only `dispose()`; its test-only members, the tracing switch,\n  framework records and the write-only counters are gone, and spans and workflows share one\n  attribute filter. The runtime is now about 250 bytes larger than on dev instead of 1.9 KB.\n- The public API check reads untyped functions'' results and function types'' signatures.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017JGGRbPCDVdbxpXVoEdtX8\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQLcMXWrQ\nulw4azxNAptkNW77slJ6t8g+isS2oWp9tzJbNWaMnqLTwycI0VgupbsvEiAQwXxs8XrLjVlacDtj\nAw8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T21:09:10Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commit/39a563a25c75d4d4593fe9b1ce37f4d910af3e6a","node_id":"C_kwDOUfsJGdoAKDM5YTU2M2EyNWM3NWQ0ZDQ1OTNmZTliMWNlMzdmNGQ5MTBhZjNlNmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commit/442f33c109cf551db2ab4db80f192161a82da5e5","sha":"442f33c109cf551db2ab4db80f192161a82da5e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commits/442f33c109cf551db2ab4db80f192161a82da5e5"}],"sha":"39a563a25c75d4d4593fe9b1ce37f4d910af3e6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commits/39a563a25c75d4d4593fe9b1ce37f4d910af3e6a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commits/668c816392d1357a5580022dedf3c46f4dad772a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T20:49:30Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T20:49:30Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Make theme switches instant and keep the profile menu smooth\n\nSettings no longer shows a \"Saving preference…\" line or disables the\ntoggles while a save runs, so choosing a theme does not shift the layout.\nThe runtime pauses CSS transitions for the restyle a switch causes, and the\nprofile menu''s theme item switches only after the menu finishes closing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EsMajMRL6X4p5emnmXXZvK","tree":{"sha":"e05609deffe96df92509610cf40379eac6c7f7c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/git/trees/e05609deffe96df92509610cf40379eac6c7f7c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/git/commits/668c816392d1357a5580022dedf3c46f4dad772a","verification":{"payload":"tree e05609deffe96df92509610cf40379eac6c7f7c3\nparent ccab6901153a9b67e371cfcad198cc6036b70788\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791146970 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791146970 +0000\n\nMake theme switches instant and keep the profile menu smooth\n\nSettings no longer shows a \"Saving preference…\" line or disables the\ntoggles while a save runs, so choosing a theme does not shift the layout.\nThe runtime pauses CSS transitions for the restyle a switch causes, and the\nprofile menu''s theme item switches only after the menu finishes closing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EsMajMRL6X4p5emnmXXZvK\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQN0bzZys\nNwlopQqBvh5LFQHE3Rm9o6x0xF2TSvA/SmWQBbXGGuTe35Vf0U/FbAp3VILkyDfK1T2hAtty+eTQ\n6AA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T20:49:32Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.