:"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commits/442f33c109cf551db2ab4db80f192161a82da5e5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T20:47:01Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T20:47:44Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Read inferred export types in the public API check\n\nA field, method or constant whose type the source leaves to inference, such as an Angular host\ncomponent''s `state` signal, now has its inferred type checked too, as the emitted declaration\nwould spell it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017JGGRbPCDVdbxpXVoEdtX8","tree":{"sha":"413129b9576aa8711f2b55d1fdf61c2f3f02fb5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/git/trees/413129b9576aa8711f2b55d1fdf61c2f3f02fb5c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/git/commits/442f33c109cf551db2ab4db80f192161a82da5e5","verification":{"payload":"tree 413129b9576aa8711f2b55d1fdf61c2f3f02fb5c\nparent 5eb9815896ea1233db3eea3f652d0b27a99b109f\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791146821 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791146864 +0000\n\nRead inferred export types in the public API check\n\nA field, method or constant whose type the source leaves to inference, such as an Angular host\ncomponent''s `state` signal, now has its inferred type checked too, as the emitted declaration\nwould spell it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017JGGRbPCDVdbxpXVoEdtX8\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAA