"https://github.com/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commit/45f10b364059aa82876cfade8ac49a67dc0fe090","sha":"45f10b364059aa82876cfade8ac49a67dc0fe090","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commits/45f10b364059aa82876cfade8ac49a67dc0fe090"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commit/fe30a05a5098e2b3cd920e5c182814faf005254f","sha":"fe30a05a5098e2b3cd920e5c182814faf005254f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commits/fe30a05a5098e2b3cd920e5c182814faf005254f"}],"sha":"5eb9815896ea1233db3eea3f652d0b27a99b109f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commits/5eb9815896ea1233db3eea3f652d0b27a99b109f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commits/fe30a05a5098e2b3cd920e5c182814faf005254f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T20:17:05Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T20:17:05Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Keep core values shared and export the agent actions'' full type closure\n\n`@company/mfe-core/public` re-exports from `@company/mfe-core` itself rather than `./index.ts`, so\nthe adapters and the runtime import core values from the shared module again instead of bundling\na private copy. `pnpm api:check` now treats runtime types like core types (no consumer imports\nthe runtime), and `@company/mfe-agent/actions` exports every type its actions API names.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017JGGRbPCDVdbxpXVoEdtX8","tree":{"sha":"6bf6dd46fbaa8be72f43e2cb32ffcc909daeca24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/git/trees/6bf6dd46fbaa8be72f43e2cb32ffcc909daeca24"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/git/commits/fe30a05a5098e2b3cd920e5c182814faf005254f","verification":{"payload":"tree 6bf6dd46fbaa8be72f43e2cb32ffcc909daeca24\nparent 13718a3e33823b17525d31a3cd920266a6303368\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791145025 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791145025 +0000\n\nKeep core values shared and export the agent actions'' full type closure\n\n`@company/mfe-core/public` re-exports from `@company/mfe-core` itself rather than `./index.ts`, so\nthe adapters and the runtime import core values from the shared module again instead of bundling\na private copy. `pnpm api:check` now treats runtime types like core types (no consumer imports\nthe runtime), and `@company/mfe-agent/actions` exports every type its actions API names.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017JGGRbPCDVdbxpXVoEdtX8\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQIgF2a5W\nLe1pCFkUVvt5zsL+grz6lhWD+Ls+T9o3MhXFvUyp0b/Ke18rJKwsYm3PF/55xRbcRnKj5yYV+9gQ\n3wA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T20:17:08Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commit/fe30a05a5098e2b3cd920e5c182814faf005254f","node_id":"C_kwDOUfsJGdoAKGZlMzBhMDVhNTA5OGUyYjNjZDkyMGU1YzE4MjgxNGZhZjAwNTI1NGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commit/13718a3e33823b17525d31a3cd920266a6303368","sha":"13718a3e33823b17525d31a3cd920266a6303368","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commits/13718a3e33823b17525d31a3cd920266a6303368"}],"sha":"fe30a05a5098e2b3cd920e5c182814faf005254f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commits/fe30a05a5098e2b3cd920e5c182814faf005254f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commits/13718a3e33823b17525d31a3cd920266a6303368/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T19:57:26Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T19:57:26Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Give the core one public API that the adapters and the runtime re-export whole\n\nThe React adapter, the Angular adapter and the runtime each kept their own list\nof core re-exports, nearly the same and free to drift. The new\n@company/mfe-core/public entry is that list, once, and each of them now does\nexport * from it. api:check fails when a name an entry declares shadows one the\nstar brings, since TypeScript drops the starred one silently.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017JGGRbPCDVdbxpXVoEdtX8","tree":{"sha":"9de32f9764658b5ef7025b8a12d492238cbb911d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/git/trees/9de32f9764658b5ef7025b8a12d492238cbb911d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/git/commits/13718a3e33823b17525d31a3cd920266a6303368","verification":{"payload":"tree 9de32f9764658b5ef7025b8a12d492238cbb911d\nparent 2b974f3bb05d1804a93cdeca6764fabf9fdb13b1\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791143846 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791143846 +0000\n\nGive the core one public API that the adapters and the runtime re-export whole\n\nThe React adapter, the Angular adapter and the runtime each kept their own list\nof core re-exports, nearly the same and free to drift. The new\n@company/mfe-core/public entry is that list, once, and each of them now does\nexport * from it. api:check fails when a name an entry declares shadows one the\nstar brings, since TypeScript drops the starred one silently.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017JGGRbPCDVdbxpXVoEdtX8\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQGUjAo1P\nlzdsRtpOn3Nx7StTKH/YJNgdNCfXNLHmAE3VKRUQI44X/mMlci2UaOvS+sU6R2GboJ8Dtzm7pg2i\nOgc=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T19:57:29Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commit/13718a3e33823b17525d31a3cd920266a6303368","node_