shell with two\ncopies of core and runtime whose types do not match. A changesets fixed group\nkeeps them on one version. mfe-core''s description now says not to import it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017JGGRbPCDVdbxpXVoEdtX8","tree":{"sha":"d4f812796180c429dd5d6c5ad8b7c75bf5c5fcf6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/git/trees/d4f812796180c429dd5d6c5ad8b7c75bf5c5fcf6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/git/commits/2b974f3bb05d1804a93cdeca6764fabf9fdb13b1","verification":{"payload":"tree d4f812796180c429dd5d6c5ad8b7c75bf5c5fcf6\nparent dce3b506e118ba7dbb999cd795cd24c6ef2bbabe\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791143418 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791143418 +0000\n\nRelease the framework packages together and mark mfe-core internal\n\nCore, runtime and the packages that depend on them are pinned to each other''s\nexact versions, so releasing them separately could leave a shell with two\ncopies of core and runtime whose types do not match. A changesets fixed group\nkeeps them on one version. mfe-core''s description now says not to import it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017JGGRbPCDVdbxpXVoEdtX8\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOzVw7xk\nsJ0kMowboZgVAhRCMR+L+Pk5XHHCpNi0CR/XETEmGPbFOZ14JPxwe33Uk1KIYJDc5pWRhTKZI/Vo\nbAo=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T19:50:21Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cl