rs/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commits/93c433bc6548bb99a798bb0719ec15719bd1d969/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T19:12:36Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T19:12:36Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Export every type a public signature names from its own package\n\nA consumer depends on an adapter, never on mfe-core, so a type an export names\nmust be importable from the package that exports it. api:check now requires\nthat: a type counts only when its own package exports it, and a package that\nre-exports a core type owns what that type names. The runtime, the adapters,\nmfe-build, mfe-agent and mfe-rspack re-export the types it found missing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017JGGRbPCDVdbxpXVoEdtX8","tree":{"sha":"6bfafb944d5dde7d5ab514568901e8eb8b295a97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/git/trees/6bfafb944d5dde7d5ab514568901e8eb8b295a97"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/git/commits/93c433bc6548bb99a798bb0719ec15719bd1d969","verification":{"payload":"tree 6bfafb944d5dde7d5ab514568901e8eb8b295a97\nparent 45f10b364059aa82876cfade8ac49a67dc0fe090\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791141156 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791141156 +0000\n\nExport every type a public signature names from its own package\n\nA consumer depends on an adapter, never on mfe-core, so a type an export names\nmust be importable from the package that exports it. api:check now requires\nthat: a type counts only when its own package exports it, and a package that\nre-exports a core type owns what that type names. The runtime, the adapters,\nmfe-build, mfe-agent and mfe-rspack re-export the types it found missing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017JGGRbPCDVdbxpXVoEdtX8\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQC0b7e1o\nePaeTZ5buzco18kvhxllIQf8rmy5O1muej8wMy5NMxmz0TaO8iHkzAbvqADvv3KDawgmcf96bNTV\nXQg=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T19:12:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","t