s findings of the final review\n\n- Keep each workflow procedure in its recipe and the full Workflow API in the\n  hooks reference; telemetry.mdx now introduces workflows and links the recipes.\n- Fold extra sections into the recipe template and use prefixed workflow names.\n- Document installShellAuth''s options, including telemetry, in the runtime\n  README, and say request tracing needs that provider.\n- Say a cancelled request ends as abandoned, and correct §59, §55 and design.md\n  about where the active span used to live.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017JGGRbPCDVdbxpXVoEdtX8","tree":{"sha":"f4eece9481c12b9e5ed623c5200dc70928c459e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/git/trees/f4eece9481c12b9e5ed623c5200dc70928c459e3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/git/commits/45f10b364059aa82876cfade8ac49a67dc0fe090","verification":{"payload":"tree f4eece9481c12b9e5ed623c5200dc70928c459e3\nparent ed8638ac29319f3b7542885a90b74b90556889ec\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791136380 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791136380 +0000\n\nFix the docs findings of the final review\n\n- Keep each workflow procedure in its recipe and the full Workflow API in the\n  hooks reference; telemetry.mdx now introduces workflows and links the recipes.\n- Fold extra sections into the recipe template and use prefixed workflow names.\n- Document installShellAuth''s options, including telemetry, in the runtime\n  README, and say request tracing needs that provider.\n- Say a cancelled request ends as abandoned, and correct §59, §55 and design.md\n  about where the active span used to live.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017JGGRbPCDVdbxpXVoEdtX8\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q