1a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T07:12:21Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T07:12:21Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Remove the span surface no caller uses since the tracer went away\n\nWith no author holding a span, the framework is the only caller of a\nprovider''s Span, and it calls setAttributes, setStatus, recordException\nand end. Remove what only the author-facing tracer needed: Span''s\nsetAttribute, addEvent and isRecording, recordException''s attributes,\nSpanStatus.message, SpanOptions.startTime, SpanRecord.exceptions (the\nFaro adapter stopped reading it), MountSpan.isRecording and its unused\nname, and the after-end guard with its mutationsAfterEnd counter, which\nnothing can reach now that every span is the framework''s.\n\nStop exporting what neither the shell nor an App uses: SpanOptions and\nSpanStatus from the core; Span and SpanStatus from the runtime; and from\nthe telemetry index nonRecordingSpan, createMountTelemetry,\nRESERVED_ATTRIBUTE_KEYS, isReservedAttributeKey and their types.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017JGGRbPCDVdbxpXVoEdtX8","tree":{"sha":"767f29f6c875f2d4fb024f761eff60fc436f82b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/git/trees/767f29f6c875f2d4fb024f761eff60fc436f82b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/git/commits/190541b42299c6d1cb057b342f5a6da0df2e2c1a","verification":{"payload":"tree 767f29f6c875f2d4fb024f761eff60fc436f82b8\nparent 332e21dad9dd869e03b7829df5463d19cfdc1daa\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791097941 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791097941 +0000\n\nRemove the span surface no caller uses since the tracer went away\n\nWith no author holding a span, the framework is the only caller of a\nprovider''s Span, and it calls setAttributes, setStatus, recordException\nand end. Remove what only the author-facing tracer needed: Span''s\nsetAttribute, addEvent and isRecording, recordException''s attributes,\nSpanStatus.message, SpanOptions.startTime, SpanRecord.exceptions (the\nFaro adapter stopped reading it), MountSpan.isRecording and its unused\nname, and the after-end guard with its mutationsAfterEnd counter, which\nnothing can reach now that every span is the framework''s.\n\nStop exporting what neither the shell nor an App uses: SpanOptions and\nSpanStatus from the core; Span and SpanStatus from the runtime; and from\nthe telemetry index nonRecordingSpan, createMountTelemetry,\nRESERVED_ATTRIBUTE_KEYS, isReservedAttributeKey and their types.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017JGGRbPCDVdbxpXVoEdtX8\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQEjRDUMB\nzklvp44D8ZcjdCE/KQbm2DWMeEpeHuyl8FVXiYWEOodKnJMS21aufk1LjyxXXzZ6/mjumElG9Kgg\n8Aw=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T07:18:58Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commit/190541b42299c6d1cb057b342f5a6da0df2e2c1a","node_id":"C_kwDOUfsJGdoAKDE5MDU0MWI0MjI5OWM2ZDFjYjA1N2IzNDJmNWE2ZGEwZGYyZTJjMWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commit/332e21dad9dd869e03b7829df5463d19cfdc1daa","sha":"332e21dad9dd869e03b7829df5463d19cfdc1daa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commits/332e21dad9dd869e03b7829df5463d19cfdc1daa"}],"sha":"190541b42299c6d1cb057b342f5a6da0df2e2c1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commits/190541b42299c6d1cb057b342f5a6da0df2e2c1a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commits/332e21dad9dd869e03b7829df5463d19cfdc1daa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T07:07:16Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T07:07:16Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Say what a caller''s traceparent does on a request to a declared API\n\nThe request recipe said a traceparent spread in by the caller goes out as\nwritten, which holds only for an undeclared origin or an invalid header:\nto a declared API a valid one becomes the client span''s parent and is\nreplaced. The hooks reference now names the key and the record methods.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017JGGRbPCDVdbxpXVoEdtX8","tree":{"sha":"5e2cbb5644a996c0f79e1c4cada97b9f27276609","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/git/trees/5e2cbb5644a996c0f79e1c4cada97b9f27276609"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/git/commits/332e21dad9dd869e03b7829df5463d19cfdc1daa","verification":{"payload":"tree 5e2cbb5644a996c0f79e1c4cada97b9f27276609\nparent 068b09001fab0288d40372eeee9a2947db8c04f5\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791097636 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791097636 +0000\n\nSay what a caller''s traceparent does on a request to a declared API\n\nThe request recipe said a traceparent spread in by the caller goes out as\nwritten, which holds only for an undeclared origin or an invalid header:\nto a declared API a valid one becomes the client span''s parent and is\nreplaced. The hooks reference now names the key and the record methods.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017JGGRbPCDVdbxpXVoEdtX8\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQCEkuD73\ncj5AYrrzDYeLyqbWxqOqA5zmjeI7DcgXu8duN0LtFgNRSaCvoY2O9Rqg7KdghWdEzcDWPO+H3aJL\nQgA=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T07:18:58Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avat