"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commits/068b09001fab0288d40372eeee9a2947db8c04f5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T07:06:51Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T07:06:51Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Report a mount''s telemetry diagnostics to the runtime''s diagnostics\n\nThe mount context created its telemetry without an onDiagnostic sink, so\nevery development diagnostic a workflow gives (a step or end while not\nopen, an unprefixed name shared by two definitions, a provider that threw)\nwas counted and dropped, though the docs and section 59 say it is shown.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017JGGRbPCDVdbxpXVoEdtX8","tree":{"sha":"f759ba098bac8cd2b6336319186f621af74073a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/git/trees/f759ba098bac8cd2b6336319186f621af74073a5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/git/commits/068b09001fab0288d40372eeee9a2947db8c04f5","verification":{"payload":"tree f759ba098bac8cd2b6336319186f621af74073a5\nparent b0e3f0c6df92112f012eb90bd64a807041a32405\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791097611 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791097611 +0000\n\nReport a mount''s telemetry diagnostics to the runtime''s diagnostics\n\nThe mount context created its telemetry without an onDiagnostic sink, so\nevery development diagnostic a workflow gives (a step or end while not\nopen, an unprefixed name shared by two definitions, a provider that threw)\nwas counted and dropped, though the docs and section 59 say it is shown.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017JGGRbPCDVdbxpXVoEdtX8\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQALbsxMK\nPZxpCJwwwfggTTrZLsWQxkCYJqMSE7l6qObC2JfVl5S9CCDl6pISsFmOv6NMAV9zZMtg9CHOjnAl\nMgc=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T07:18:58Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commit/068b09001fab0288d40372eeee9a2947db8c04f5","node_id":"C_kwDOUfsJGdoAKDA2OGIwOTAwMWZhYjAyODhkNDAzNzJlZWVlOWEyOTQ3ZGI4YzA0ZjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commit/b0e3f0c6df92112f012eb90bd64a807041a32405","sha":"b0e3f0c6df92112f012eb90bd64a807041a32405","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commits/b0e3f0c6df92112f012eb90bd64a807041a32405"}],"sha":"068b09001fab0288d40372eeee9a2947db8c04f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commits/068b09001fab0288d40372eeee9a2947db8c04f5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commits/b0e3f0c6df92112f012eb90bd64a807041a32405/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T06:50:48Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T06:50:48Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Warn about unprefixed shared workflow names, not separate builds\n\nSeparately built bundles sharing a run is the intended case, and mounts\ncarry no build hash in a real shell, so the old check never fired. A run\nwith an unprefixed name joined by a second App or Widget is reported\nonce instead; a prefixed name is taken as shared on purpose.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017JGGRbPCDVdbxpXVoEdtX8","tree":{"sha":"590b41fbc61db0468a39cf9844716227b598223c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/git/trees/590b41fbc61db0468a39cf9844716227b598223c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/git/commits/b0e3f0c6df92112f012eb90bd64a807041a32405","verification":{"payload":"tree 590b41fbc61db0468a39cf9844716227b598223c\nparent d042f243f639d193f2495143d23eda544f1e4ece\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791096648 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791096648 +0000\n\nWarn about unprefixed shared workflow names, not separate builds\n\nSeparately built bundles sharing a run is the intended case, and mounts\ncarry no build hash in a real shell, so the old check never fired. A run\nwith an unprefixed name joined by a second App or Widget is reported\nonce instead; a prefixed name is taken as shared on purpose.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017JGGRbPCDVdbxpXVoEdtX8\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQB/oalW+\nmESAQfW0rVuOmiHCJOxVB3VKe0lmP0U6ZPkecD7JmFyaIfBH3fw6xN9Z98aXPxrAaPr/M+bNOyGr\nlQ4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T06:50:51Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commit/b0e3f0c6df92112f012eb90bd64a807041a32405","node_id":"C_kwDOUfsJGdoAKGIwZTNmMGM2ZGY5MjExMmYwMTJlYjkwYmQ2NGE4MDcwNDFhMzI0MDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commit/d042f243f639d193f2495143d23eda544f1e4ece","sha":"d042f243f639d193f2495143d23eda544f1e4ece","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commits/d042f243f639d193f2495143d23eda544f1e4ece"}],"sha":"b0e3f0c6df92112f012eb90bd64a807041a32405","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commits/b0e3f0c6df92112f012eb90bd64a807041a32405"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commits/d042f243f639d193f2495143d23eda544f1e4ece/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T06:48:43Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T06:48:43Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Share workflow runs across the page by name\n\nA workflow''s run is now the page''s rather than the mount''s: every App\nand Widget that calls workflow(name, key?) acts on the same run, kept in\na page-global registry under a registered symbol as plain data and\nfunctions (§55). start() begins the run or joins the open one, any\nparticipant may step, read headers, record, succeed or fail, and the run\nends as abandoned only when every participating mount is disposed. A\nmount leaving while others remain hands its spans over to the run\ninstead of finalizing them. In development, participants from different\nbuilds are reported once per run.\n\nAdds the \"Share a workflow between widgets\" page and updates the\ntelemetry pages, §59 and the changeset.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017JGGRbPCDVdbxpXVoEdtX8","tree":{"sha":"4106dffeca8255e80dc55d63faeccd7d784a936c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/git/trees/4106dffeca8255e80dc55d63faeccd7d784a936c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/git/commits/d042f243f639d193f2495143d23eda544f1e4ece","verification":{"payload":"tree 4106dffeca8255e80dc55d63faeccd7d784a936c\nparent c495daae9e517fd0d11ce36844c55ba739491470\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791096523 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791096523 +0000\n\nShare workflow runs across the page by name\n\nA workflow''s run is now the page''s rather than the mount''s: every App\nand Widget that calls workflow(name, key?) acts on the same run, kept in\na page-global registry under a registered symbol as plain data and\nfunctions (§55). start() begins the run or joins the open one, any\nparticipant may step, read headers, record, succeed or fail, and the run\nends as abandoned only when every participating mount is disposed. A\nmount leaving while others remain hands its spans over to the run\ninstead of finalizing them. In development, participants from different\nbuilds are reported once per run.\n\nAdds the \"Share a workflow between widgets\" page and updates the\ntelemetry pages, §59 and the changeset.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017JGGRbPCDVdbxpXVoEdtX8\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQFnjtowp\nZTvXhHFE37IOE0SoTu+ga7FUSgO8WiROkQDNMAQS1U36/rm3fKWRQf6xbM8PKAUOIsN7NyLxwyPP\nNgs=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T06:50:51Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commit/d042f243f639d193f2495143d23eda544f1e4ece","node_id":"C_kwDOUfsJGdoAKGQwNDJmMjQzZjYzOWQxOTNmMjQ5NT