"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commits/7fea752a5441e5f325c11bf509e0c712a6b74ba0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T06:05:52Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T06:05:52Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Trace every request to a declared API through #mfe/fetch\n\nEach request to a declared API origin gets a CLIENT span (method, host,\nport, status, resend count; never the path or query) and sends a\ntraceparent naming it. A valid caller traceparent, as from a workflow''s\nheaders(), makes the span its child and is replaced; an invalid one and\nundeclared origins go out untouched. The shell passes its provider to\ninstallShellAuth({ telemetry }), and each container''s transport builds a\ntracer attributed to the container''s id and kind, which the generated\n#mfe/fetch now emits.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017JGGRbPCDVdbxpXVoEdtX8","tree":{"sha":"3ddc8bb67a04496444eb1d0103dbb8a401222e5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/git/trees/3ddc8bb67a04496444eb1d0103dbb8a401222e5d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/git/commits/7fea752a5441e5f325c11bf509e0c712a6b74ba0","verification":{"payload":"tree 3ddc8bb67a04496444eb1d0103dbb8a401222e5d\nparent 6fccca3b84dc721535080760cfab386b9d2b24e9\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791093952 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791093952 +0000\n\nTrace every request to a declared API through #mfe/fetch\n\nEach request to a declared API origin gets a CLIENT span (method, host,\nport, status, resend count; never the path or query) and sends a\ntraceparent naming it. A valid caller traceparent, as from a workflow''s\nheaders(), makes the span its child and is replaced; an invalid one and\nundeclared origins go out untouched. The shell passes its provider to\ninstallShellAuth({ telemetry }), and each container''s transport builds a\ntracer attributed to the container''s id and kind, which the generated\n#mfe/fetch now emits.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017JGGRbPCDVdbxpXVoEdtX8\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQFBxHiZD\nktEcU5QKBPVKgizJ0pv8SnfGXxryXCvwbNJpqn9q+uEpaO7o2+aZnToFaThl8GTkGLEOWQkRZPHE\nYw4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T06:06:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commit/7fea752a5441e5