"name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T05:25:16Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Report a workflow failure even when the workflow was not started\n\nfail() on a workflow that is not open still records the error, without a\ntrace, so a failure is never lost for want of a start().\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017JGGRbPCDVdbxpXVoEdtX8","tree":{"sha":"9f907d5bf5799e476cf6434a3d48e1a0d263d118","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/git/trees/9f907d5bf5799e476cf6434a3d48e1a0d263d118"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/git/commits/4e9d62e9b1b0451973998c8d2a89fbedbe445859","verification":{"payload":"tree 9f907d5bf5799e476cf6434a3d48e1a0d263d118\nparent b416fe984d0fcff5f09d925ae320862edcaf3c87\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791091516 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791091516 +0000\n\nReport a workflow failure even when the workflow was not started\n\nfail() on a workflow that is not open still records the error, without a\ntrace, so a failure is never lost for want of a start().\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017JGGRbPCDVdbxpXVoEdtX8\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQCuFCsRf\nCpa/y9W+mdSSV1Ud52eBd+7O9hFtXt3o4wHPnqxRMvjpNHhSpEtq9Puszz1v5qi/g5NnAIDVBIMm\nWQg=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T05:25:19Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commit/4e9d62e9b1b0451973998c8d2a89fbedbe445859","node_id":"C_kwDOUfsJGdoAKDRlOWQ2MmU5YjFiMDQ1MTk3Mzk5OGM4ZDJhODlmYmVkYmU0NDU4NTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commit/b416fe984d0fcff5f09d925ae320862edcaf3c87","sha":"b416fe984d0fcff5f09d925ae320862edcaf3c87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commits/b416fe984d0fcff5f09d925ae320862edcaf3c87"}],"sha":"4e9d62e9b1b0451973998c8d2a89fbedbe445859","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commits/4e9d62e9b1b0451973998c8d2a89fbedbe445859"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commits/b416fe984d0fcff5f09d925ae320862edcaf3c87/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T05:24:02Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T05:24:02Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Replace the author-facing tracer with named workflows\n\nMfeTelemetry loses `tracer` and gains `workflow(name)`: one object per name\nper mount with start, step, headers, succeed and fail. A workflow is one\ntrace, a root span with a child span per step; fail records the error on\nboth and reports it as an error record linked to the workflow''s span.\n\nNothing is ambient any more: the page-global active-span slot, record\nstamping and the automatic client span and traceparent on #mfe/fetch are\ngone. A request joins a workflow only through headers(), so background\nrequests never land in one, and a caller''s traceparent passes through\nunchanged. The provider seam keeps a Tracer with startSpan only.\n\nRecorded as decision 59; the lab and the telemetry guide show the checkout.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017JGGRbPCDVdbxpXVoEdtX8","tree":{"sha":"5ac966ba6a25e33818427f636a8ae631022ad187","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/git/trees/5ac966ba6a25e33818427f636a8ae631022ad187"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/git/commits/b416fe984d0fcff5f09d925ae320862edcaf3c87","verification":{"payload":"tree 5ac966ba6a25e33818427f636a8ae631022ad187\nparent 9f407a4f08a374e6763f25105ae6ce1289eda68e\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791091442 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791091442 +0000\n\nReplace the author-facing tracer with named workflows\n\nMfeTelemetry loses `tracer` and gains `workflow(name)`: one object per name\nper mount with start, step, headers, succeed and fail. A workflow is one\ntrace, a root span with a child span per step; fail records the error on\nboth and reports it as an error record linked to the workflow''s span.\n\nNothing is ambient any more: the page-global active-span slot, record\nstamping and the automatic client span and traceparent on #mfe/fetch are\ngone. A request joins a workflow only through headers(), so background\nrequests never land in one, and a caller''s traceparent passes through\nunchanged. The provider seam keeps a Tracer with startSpan only.\n\nRecorded as decision 59; the lab and the telemetry guide show the checkout.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017JGGRbPCDVdbxpXVoEdtX8\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQNjpKYo5\nUM5gyaeRsusp/tiez9syuh3tIImlxVgu6TWnM8KH6MX8KNskLHj+Na3PM7DlC1nVV7vHi8/9XC6p\nbwE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T05:25:19Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commit/b416fe984d0fcff5f09d925ae320862edcaf3c87","node_id":"C_kwDOUfsJGdoAKGI0MTZmZTk4NGQwZmNmZjVmMDlkOTI1YWUzMjA4NjJlZGNhZjNjODc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commit/9f407a4f08a374e6763f25105ae6ce1289eda68e","sha":"9f407a4f08a374e6763f25105ae6ce1289eda68e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commits/9f407a4f08a374e6763f25105ae6ce1289eda68e"}],"sha":"b416fe984d0fcff5f09d925ae320862edcaf3c87","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commits/b416fe984d0fcff5f09d925ae320862edcaf3c87"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commits/b8db25dfc952a459e755265ce69ec09ec706f5bf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T05:22:38Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T05:22:38Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add agent guardrails: definition of done, public API check, changeset and review gates\n\nAGENTS.md gains a definition of done (checks, docs, changeset, nothing half-done, no dead\ncode, reviewed), and CLAUDE.md imports it. REVIEW.md is the one review guide for authors and\nCI, and a PR template repeats the definition of done as boxes.\n\npnpm api:check fails when a runtime export has no caller that ships (shell, docs site code or\nanother package) and is not listed as authoring API with its docs page and an example caller,\nand when a reference heading names an API that no longer exists. The 112 exports nothing calls\ntoday are recorded under pendingDecision so the check only blocks new ones.\n\nCI now requires a changeset for changed published packages and runs a Claude review of every\nPR against REVIEW.md that fails on blocking findings. TODO and FIXME comments fail lint.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Wj53GauN17oJPfcFLH2YFt","tree":{"sha":"f34a0e27be9a918360f935dd4e4d60f9f3de3bc0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/git/trees/f34a0e27be9a918360f935dd4e4d60f9f3de3bc0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/git/commits/b8db25dfc952a459e755265ce69ec09ec706f5bf","verification":{"payload":"tree f34a0e27be9a918360f935dd4e4d60f9f3de3bc0\nparent 9f407a4f08a374e6763f25105ae6ce1289eda68e\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791091358 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791091358 +0000\n\nAdd agent guardrails: definition of done, public API check, changeset and review gates\n\nAGENTS.md gains a definition of done (checks, docs, changeset, nothing half-done, no dead\ncode, reviewed), and CLAUDE.md imports it. REVIEW.md is the one review guide for authors and\nCI, and a PR template repeats the definition of done as boxes.\n\npnpm api:check fails when a runtime export has no caller that ships (shell, docs site code or\nanother package) and is not listed as authoring API with its docs page and an example caller,\nand when a reference heading names an API that no longer exists. The 112 exports nothing calls\ntoday are recorded under pendingDecision so the check only blocks new ones.\n\nCI now requires a changeset for changed published packages and runs a Claude review of every\nPR against REVIEW.md that fails on blocking findings. TODO and FIXME comments fail lint.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Wj53GauN17oJPfcFLH2YFt\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQCDJ2aah\n4TctXiM0l5u+CEQPIr7cBNnnLhVJUqpGePbDFTnVOBy28lgV/yohV4Mqzryj9ukGCNiZ+X7KLrP8\nwwo=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T05:22:41Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"}