"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/commits/72458d5d2f443c490abe4cc9b393177ea2931b72/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T04:13:16Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T04:13:16Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Review pass: fix a false after-end diagnostic and remove dead telemetry exports\n\n- A request still out when its mount was disposed set attributes on a\n  client span the disposal had already closed, which counted and reported\n  it as the author changing a span after end(). The request span now\n  leaves a span that no longer records alone.\n- bindTelemetryContext is removed: withSpan does the same job explicitly,\n  and nothing in the shell or the Apps called it. Its tests now cover\n  withSpan.\n- getActiveSpanContext, ActiveSpanContext and createNonRecordingTracer\n  are no longer exported from the runtime; only the runtime itself and\n  tests used them.\n- Provider tracers (the span emitter and the non-recording tracer) no\n  longer carry a withSpan nothing called; their type is the provider\n  tracer, without it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017JGGRbPCDVdbxpXVoEdtX8","tree":{"sha":"c3b0427d9bc7074a8a5e7e9db2818d8700660c18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/git/trees/c3b0427d9bc7074a8a5e7e9db2818d8700660c18"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/mfe-framework-claude/git/commits/72458d5d2f443c490abe4cc9b393177ea2931b72","verification":{"payload":"tree c3b0427d9bc7074a8a5e7e9db2818d8700660c18\nparent 9f4323079c3480ec6e4d993dcf8ac68308ad98d1\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791087196 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1791087196 +0000\n\nReview pass: fix a false after-end diagnostic and remove dead telemetry exports\n\n- A request still out when its mount was disposed set attributes on a\n  client span the disposal had already closed, which counted and reported\n  it as the author changing a span after end(). The request span now\n  leaves a span that no longer records alone.\n- bindTelemetryContext is removed: withSpan does the same job explicitly,\n  and nothing in the shell or the Apps called it. Its tests now cover\n  withSpan.\n- getActiveSpanContext, ActiveSpanContext and createNonRecordingTracer\n  are no longer exported from the runtime; only the runtime itself and\n  tests used them.\n- Provider tracers (the span emitter and the non-recording tracer) no\n  longer carry a withSpan nothing called; their type is the provider\n  tracer, without it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017JGGRbPCDVdbxpXVoEdtX8\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQGnv54v3\ndJ3XTl9CykJmu3Kcf4h9IbDZj3hYroDYsQ4Q5UO2bdO8ZPF+k5LxWPwDwk1A8Hr6WB/jpmE7kBM1\nSwk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T04:13:19Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.