"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T09:39:22Z","email":"z@container","name":"Z User"},"message":"fix: make home 应用领域 cards directly editable in PageManager\n\nThe solution-cards block auto-pulled cards from L1 categories, so the card\nimages lived on the Category model (only editable in CategoryManager) —\nthe admin couldn''t change card images where they see the block (PageManager)\n=> ''换不了图片''.\n\nMade solution-cards SELF-CONTAINED: the block''s contentEn now holds a JSON\narray of cards [{nameEn,nameCn,descEn,descCn,image,linkCategoryId?}].\nSolutionCardsBlock parses it (falls back to auto-pulling L1 categories when\nempty, for backward-compat). PageManager BlockDialog gets a SolutionCardsEditor\n(repeatable rows: bilingual name/desc + ImageUploader per card + optional\nlink-category dropdown). Seeded the 4 cards as JSON.\n\nVerified: block has 4 cards (image+desc each); PUT a card''s image/nameCn ->\n200 + stored; lint 0. The admin can now change each card''s image directly\nin PageManager.","tree":{"sha":"08c21e7ed1c0800f49d45f704dfbe5885c37262d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/git/trees/08c21e7ed1c0800f49d45f704dfbe5885c37262d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/git/commits/1e3c56725cd2eb294f8a1fa35f106c8cf62b8cc3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commit/1e3c56725cd2eb294f8a1fa35f106c8cf62b8cc3","node_id":"C_kwDOUfviM9oAKDFlM2M1NjcyNWNkMmViMjk0ZjhhMWZhMzVmMTA2YzhjZjYyYjhjYzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commit/fe46d4eb97cd052772c327f038fcf3fe062aa251","sha":"fe46d4eb97cd052772c327f038fcf3fe062aa251","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commits/fe46d4eb97cd052772c327f038fcf3fe062aa251"}],"sha":"1e3c56725cd2eb294f8a1fa35f106c8cf62b8cc3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commits/1e3c56725cd2eb294f8a1fa35f106c8cf62b8cc3"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commits/fe46d4eb97cd052772c327f038fcf3fe062aa251/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T07:02:52Z","email":"z@container","name":"Z User"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T07:02:52Z","email":"z@container","name":"Z User"},"message":"fix: new-block-not-showing bug + application-area card images\n\nBug: after adding a content block in the admin, the public page didn''t\nshow it. Root cause: the public fetchJson had no cache control, so the\nbrowser HTTP-cached GET /api/pages and served stale data (without the new\nblock). Fixed by adding cache:''no-store'' to the public fetchJson. Added a\nsafety net in AdminApp.onViewSite: invalidate pages/products/categories/\nsettings when switching admin->public so the public refetches on remount.\n\nApplication-area cards: added an image field to Category (schema + types +\nAPI). SolutionCardsBlock now renders the category image as the card\nbackground (with a dark scrim for white-text legibility) + name + desc +\nLearn-more; falls back to the brand red card when no image. CategoryManager\ngot a Category Image uploader. Seeded images for the 4 L1 categories.","tree":{"sha":"f0b4b20f9084932f307a81b1154c5d2e82d97748","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/git/trees/f0b4b20f9084932f307a81b1154c5d2e82d97748"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/git/commits/fe46d4eb97cd052772c327f038fcf3fe062aa251","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commit/fe46d4eb97cd052772c327f038fcf3fe062aa251","node_id":"C_kwDOUfviM9oAKGZlNDZkNGViOTdjZDA1Mjc3MmMzMjdmMDM4ZmNmM2ZlMDYyYWEyNTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commit/5c1b1c107ed2b018968f87e84dcf3d9071a52574","sha":"5c1b1c107ed2b018968f87e84dcf3d9071a52574","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commits/5c1b1c107ed2b018968f87e84dcf3d9071a52574"}],"sha":"fe46d4eb97cd052772c327f038fcf3fe062aa251","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commits/fe46d4eb97cd052772c327f038fcf3fe062aa251"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commits/5c1b1c107ed2b018968f87e84dcf3d9071a52574/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T05:30:42Z","email":"z@container","name":"Z User"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T05:30:42Z","email":"z@container","name":"Z User"},"message":"feat: make News page admin-editable (news-list content block)\n\nLast admin-editability gap: the News page rendered news cards from a\nhardcoded NEWS array (not editable). Added a ''news-list'' content block type\n— NewsListBlock parses contentEn JSON (title/excerpt/date/tag/image, bilingual)\nand renders the same card layout; falls back to DEFAULT_NEWS. The BlockDialog\ngets a NewsListEditor (repeatable bilingual rows + image uploader). Seeded\nthe 3 sample news items as a news-list block on the news page. NewsPage now\nrenders content blocks (incl. news-list) instead of the hardcoded array.\n\nEvery page is now fully admin-editable: banner + content blocks (incl.\nfeatures/stats/featured/solution-cards/cta/news-list) + data-driven lists\n(products/categories) + settings (contact info).","tree":{"sha":"3f7fc9fb9981c9250d897cc8717ef452929be4f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/git/trees/3f7fc9fb9981c9250d897cc8717ef452929be4f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/git/commits/5c1b1c107ed2b018968f87e84dcf3d9071a52574","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commit/5c1b1c107ed2b018968f87e84dcf3d9071a52574","node_id":"C_kwDOUfviM9oAKDVjMWIxYzEwN2VkMmIwMTg5NjhmODdlODRkY2YzZDkwNzFhNTI1NzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commit/a500bbda8553a67785228fbb1b01b576c0a00d8b","sha":"a500bbda8553a67785228fbb1b01b576c0a00d8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commits/a500bbda8553a67785228fbb1b01b576c0a00d8b"}],"sha":"5c1b1c107ed2b018968f87e84dcf3d9071a52574","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commits/5c1b1c107ed2b018968f87e84dcf3d9071a52574"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commits/a500bbda8553a67785228fbb1b01b576c0a00d8b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T05:21:54Z","email":"z@container","name":"Z User"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T05:21:54Z","email":"z@container","name":"Z User"},"message":"fix(QA): about page block mismatches + editor pre-fills defaults\n\nPage-by-page QA found:\n- About ''What We Believe'' was a features block but its contentEn is a single\n  belief statement (plain text), so the public fell back to unrelated default\n  features (R&D/Manufacturing/Global) => admin text didn''t match the public.\n  Changed to a ''text'' block (centered prose) so the belief renders as written.\n- About ''Milestones'' stats block had empty contentEn => showed generic company\n  stats. Seeded milestone JSON (2003 Founded / 20+ Years / 80+ Countries /\n  30,000m² Factory) so the block shows milestone data, fully editable.\n- The stats/features block editors fell back to BLANK rows when contentEn was\n  empty, so the admin couldn''t see/edit the defaults the public was showing\n  (risk of accidental wipe). Now the editors pre-fill with the public defaults\n  (STATS / DEFAULT_FEATURES exported from ContentBlock) — what you see is what\n  you edit.","tree":{"sha":"a321f1c6d11aaa7eaf25419b85d33b84f4ef4df4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/git/trees/a321f1c6d11aaa7eaf25419b85d33b84f4ef4df4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/git/commits/a500bbda8553a67785228fbb1b01b576c0a00d8b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commit/a500bbda8553a67785228fbb1b01b576c0a00d8b","node_id":"C_kwDOUfviM9oAKGE1MDBiYmRhODU1M2E2Nzc4NTIyOGZiYjFiMDFiNTc2YzBhMDBkOGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commit/82e12549a2b2160eff4667ac84f33cf8186394fd","sha":"82e12549a2b2160eff4667ac84f33cf8186394fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commits/82e12549a2b2160eff4667ac84f33cf8186394fd"}],"sha":"a500bbda8553a67785228fbb1b01b576c0a00d8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commits/a500bbda8553a67785228fbb1b01b576c0a00d8b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commits/82e12549a2b2160eff4667ac84f33cf8186394fd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T04:43:49Z","email":"z@container","name":"Z User"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T04:43:49Z","email":"z@container","name":"Z User"},"message":"fix: every page admin-editable — convert hardcoded CTAs to blocks\n\nTest-manager audit of every page found hardcoded (non-admin-editable)\nsections:\n- AboutPage: hardcoded bottom CTA band (''Work with us.'') — removed, now a\n  ''cta'' content block in the seed (admin can edit heading/text).\n- SolutionsPage: hardcoded bottom CTA band (''Have a specific venue?'') —\n  removed, now a ''cta'' content block in the seed.\n- ProductsPage: grid h1 fell back to a hardcoded i18n string\n  tr(''product_center''); now falls back to the editable page title.\nAll page bodies now render via the banner + content blocks (which the\nadmin can fully edit, incl. the new featured/solution-cards/cta block\ntypes added earlier).","tree":{"sha":"c55f0263649d641fa753dafacacc38f8765c3247","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/git/trees/c55f0263649d641fa753dafacacc38f8765c3247"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/git/commits/82e12549a2b2160eff4667ac84f33cf8186394fd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commit/82e12549a2b2160eff4667ac84f33cf8186394fd","node_id":"C_kwDOUfviM9oAKDgyZTEyNTQ5YTJiMjE2MGVmZjQ2NjdhYzg0ZjMzY2Y4MTg2Mzk0ZmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commit/fbb239fdff1c6aa2cada01abaffbb555de10dce8","sha":"fbb239fdff1c6aa2cada01abaffbb555de10dce8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commits/fbb239fdff1c6aa2cada01abaffbb555de10dce8"}],"sha":"82e12549a2b2160eff4667ac84f33cf8186394fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commits/82e12549a2b2160eff4667ac84f33cf8186394fd"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commits/fbb239fdff1c6aa2cada01abaffbb555de10dce8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T13:14:01Z","email":"z@container","name":"Z User"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T13:14:01Z","email":"z@container","name":"Z User"},"message":"feat: make Featured/Solutions/CTA home sections admin-editable\n\nTest-manager audit found 3 home sections hardcoded in HomePage with NO\nadmin edit location (admin couldn''t edit them => ''后台改了前台不对应''):\n- Featured Products (明星产品) — heading hardcoded\n- Solutions teaser (应用领域) — heading + cards hardcoded; cards had only\n  a name + button, no content\n- CTA band (打造下一套声音系统) — all hardcoded\n\nConvert all 3 into editable content blocks (new types: featured /\nsolution-cards / cta). The admin edits the heading + text via the\nPageManager block editor; the dynamic data (featured products / L1\ncategories) stays automatic. SolutionCardsBlock enriched: each card now\nshows the L1 category name + DESCRIPTION + Learn-more button (was just\nname + button). Added the 3 type options to the BlockDialog. Simplified\nHomePage to hero + contentBlocks.map. Seeded the 3 blocks + L1 category\ndescriptions.\n\nVerified: home now has 6 content blocks (features/stats/text/featured/\nsolution-cards/cta); L1 categories carry descriptions; lint clean. The\nedit->reflect path was proven earlier (admin PUT stats -> public shows new\nvalue); the new types use the same mechanism.","tree":{"sha":"0afa2c91cc2c38267c3ec3fcc08761199be126d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/git/trees/0afa2c91cc2c38267c3ec3fcc08761199be126d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/git/commits/fbb239fdff1c6aa2cada01abaffbb555de10dce8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commit/fbb239fdff1c6aa2cada01abaffbb555de10dce8","node_id":"C_kwDOUfviM9oAKGZiYjIzOWZkZmYxYzZhYTJjYWRhMDFhYmFmZmJiNTU1ZGUxMGRjZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commit/7bb8448f8ae56ab1fa628095ac2897e16d03a5c2","sha":"7bb8448f8ae56ab1fa628095ac2897e16d03a5c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commits/7bb8448f8ae56ab1fa628095ac2897e16d03a5c2"}],"sha":"fbb239fdff1c6aa2cada01abaffbb555de10dce8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commits/fbb239fdff1c6aa2cada01abaffbb555de10dce8"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commits/7bb8448f8ae56ab1fa628095ac2897e16d03a5c2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T12:19:30Z","email":"z@container","name":"Z User"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T12:19:30Z","email":"z@container","name":"Z User"},"message":"fix: admin category buttons always visible; drop pasted screenshots from repo\n\n- CategoryManager action buttons (add-sub/edit/delete) were opacity-0\n  group-hover:opacity-100, so they were invisible until hover — users\n  couldn''t see them and thought categories weren''t editable (reported via\n  screenshot). Now opacity-70 always-visible, full on hover.\n- Remove the user''s pasted screenshots (upload/*.png) from the repo and\n  gitignore /upload/ — they were accidentally committed by ''git add -A''.","tree":{"sha":"853cdd0bb54bd82b1ed722c645392ebf230a423f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/git/trees/853cdd0bb54bd82b1ed722c645392ebf230a423f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/git/commits/7bb8448f8ae56ab1fa628095ac2897e16d03a5c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commit/7bb8448f8ae56ab1fa628095ac2897e16d03a5c2","node_id":"C_kwDOUfviM9oAKDdiYjg0NDhmOGFlNTZhYjFmYTYyODA5NWFjMjg5N2UxNmQwM2E1YzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commit/b3630d828b8c75c216ef5f37a2e1f67db9dbd575","sha":"b3630d828b8c75c216ef5f37a2e1f67db9dbd575","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commits/b3630d828b8c75c216ef5f37a2e1f67db9dbd575"}],"sha":"7bb8448f8ae56ab1fa628095ac2897e16d03a5c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commits/7bb8448f8ae56ab1fa628095ac2897e16d03a5c2"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commits/b3630d828b8c75c216ef5f37a2e1f67db9dbd575/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T12:11:40Z","email":"z@container","name":"Z User"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T12:11:40Z","email":"z@container","name":"Z User"},"message":"fix: make all content blocks admin-editable + home/category consistency\n\n- stats/features blocks were rendered from hardcoded arrays (admin could\n  only edit the section title, not the values/items => ''后台改了前台不对应'').\n  Both now parse structured JSON from contentEn (stats: [{value,labelEn,\n  labelCn}]; features: [{titleEn,titleCn,descEn,descCn}]) with fallback to\n  defaults; PageManager BlockDialog shows repeatable bilingual row editors\n  for those types. Verified: admin edits stats -> public home shows the new\n  value immediately.\n- HomePage no longer filters out ''hero'' content blocks (the seeded home hero\n  block was invisible to visitors => ''home missing something''). Removed the\n  redundant hero block from the home seed (duplicated the banner image).\n  All admin-added blocks now render.\n- Public ProductsPage sidebar now expands L1 categories by default (shows\n  L2 children) so it matches the admin''s expanded tree view; deeper levels\n  auto-expand only when the active category is in them.","tree":{"sha":"1065129fe85477892d5bfd2691258971f813abf7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/git/trees/1065129fe85477892d5bfd2691258971f813abf7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/git/commits/b3630d828b8c75c216ef5f37a2e1f67db9dbd575","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commit/b3630d828b8c75c216ef5f37a2e1f67db9dbd575","node_id":"C_kwDOUfviM9oAKGIzNjMwZDgyOGI4Yzc1YzIxNmVmNWYzN2EyZTFmNjdkYjlkYmQ1NzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commit/0729a5a7753e2a5e381bb931581d42e73da3b2af","sha":"0729a5a7753e2a5e381bb931581d42e73da3b2af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commits/0729a5a7753e2a5e381bb931581d42e73da3b2af"}],"sha":"b3630d828b8c75c216ef5f37a2e1f67db9dbd575","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commits/b3630d828b8c75c216ef5f37a2e1f67db9dbd575"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commits/0729a5a7753e2a5e381bb931581d42e73da3b2af/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T11:01:08Z","email":"z@container","name":"Z User"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T11:01:08Z","email":"z@container","name":"Z User"},"message":"fix: restore content lost in the dark->light theme switch\n\nTwo elements kept text-white assuming a dark parent, which became\ninvisible on the white theme:\n\n- HomePage hero CTA ''Contact Us / 联系我们'' button used bg-background/40\n  (translucent white on the white theme) + white text => white-on-white.\n  Switched to bg-white/10 text-white border-white/50 (subtle translucent\n  outline that stays legible over the dark hero scrim).\n- ContactPage map card used brand-gradient opacity-30 (light pink) + white\n  text => low contrast. Switched the address labels to text-foreground /\n  text-muted-foreground and the decorative grid to dark lines so the card\n  reads correctly on white.","tree":{"sha":"1f6e0845e95c49a657d495fcb267049c83422ec6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/git/trees/1f6e0845e95c49a657d495fcb267049c83422ec6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/git/commits/0729a5a7753e2a5e381bb931581d42e73da3b2af","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commit/0729a5a7753e2a5e381bb931581d42e73da3b2af","node_id":"C_kwDOUfviM9oAKDA3MjlhNWE3NzUzZTJhNWUzODFiYjkzMTU4MWQ0MmU3M2RhM2IyYWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commit/859354b5956031569b49e68f7dfae9a1a0ad1673","sha":"859354b5956031569b49e68f7dfae9a1a0ad1673","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commits/859354b5956031569b49e68f7dfae9a1a0ad1673"}],"sha":"0729a5a7753e2a5e381bb931581d42e73da3b2af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commits/0729a5a7753e2a5e381bb931581d42e73da3b2af"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commits/859354b5956031569b49e68f7dfae9a1a0ad1673/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T10:02:33Z","email":"z@container","name":"Z User"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T10:02:33Z","email":"z@container","name":"Z User"},"message":"feat: switch to white-background theme per customer request\n\n- globals.css: rewrite :root (and .dark) to a light palette — white canvas\n  (#fff), dark-gray text (#16181d), light-gray muted/borders, deep-crimson\n  primary (#d00016, AudioCenter-style). Brand utilities re-tuned to the\n  deeper red so it reads well on white. Scrollbar lightened. Hero scrims\n  kept (dark overlays over banner IMAGES for white-text legibility).\n- layout.tsx: drop className=\"dark\" so the light :root applies.\n- Replace hardcoded dark container/placeholder bg (bg-black / bg-black/40)\n  with bg-muted in BannerSection, HomePage, ContentBlock, ProductCard,\n  NewsPage, ProductDetailPage.\n- ProductDetailPage: drop prose-invert (was dark-mode prose) -> plain prose.\n- Keep text-white only where correct: over hero/banner images (dark scrim)\n  and on red brand/destructive buttons.\n- Verified via curl: html has no dark class, body has bg-background\n  text-foreground; served CSS --background #fff, --primary #d00016.","tree":{"sha":"2ca024260cd39d8cd0378d82ec6b799e6a4bf11a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/git/trees/2ca024260cd39d8cd0378d82ec6b799e6a4bf11a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/git/commits/859354b5956031569b49e68f7dfae9a1a0ad1673","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commit/859354b5956031569b49e68f7dfae9a1a0ad1673","node_id":"C_kwDOUfviM9oAKDg1OTM1NGI1OTU2MDMxNTY5YjQ5ZTY4ZjdkZmFlOWExYTBhZDE2NzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commit/e364efed1833094c40b984ccdd9913314a3d7b5b","sha":"e364efed1833094c40b984ccdd9913314a3d7b5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commits/e364efed1833094c40b984ccdd9913314a3d7b5b"}],"sha":"859354b5956031569b49e68f7dfae9a1a0ad1673","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commits/859354b5956031569b49e68f7dfae9a1a0ad1673"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commits/e364efed1833094c40b984ccdd9913314a3d7b5b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T07:41:29Z","email":"z@container","name":"Z User"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T07:41:29Z","email":"z@container","name":"Z User"},"message":"ux: clarify product-category behavior in admin\n\n- ProductEditor category field: add a hint that picking the deepest\n  (level-3) category also shows the product under every ancestor\n  (level-3 -> visible under level-2 & level-1), since the parent-chain\n  visibility is automatic and no multi-select is needed for that case.\n- ProductCard: simplify the category display to a labelled ''Path: L1 > L2 > L3''\n  breadcrumb instead of ''path · leaf'' which read like two separate assignments.","tree":{"sha":"7171b330174972468430f7132ba24e2482b7db05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/git/trees/7171b330174972468430f7132ba24e2482b7db05"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/git/commits/e364efed1833094c40b984ccdd9913314a3d7b5b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commit/e364efed1833094c40b984ccdd9913314a3d7b5b","node_id":"C_kwDOUfviM9oAKGUzNjRlZmVkMTgzMzA5NGM0MGI5ODRjY2RkOTkxMzMxNGEzZDdiNWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commit/e7654bb240a82eeb073e512dd66dd61e42e9da1a","sha":"e7654bb240a82eeb073e512dd66dd61e42e9da1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commits/e7654bb240a82eeb073e512dd66dd61e42e9da1a"}],"sha":"e364efed1833094c40b984ccdd9913314a3d7b5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commits/e364efed1833094c40b984ccdd9913314a3d7b5b"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commits/e7654bb240a82eeb073e512dd66dd61e42e9da1a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T06:31:32Z","email":"z@container","name":"Z User"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T06:31:32Z","email":"z@container","name":"Z User"},"message":"fix: make the repo clone-and-run on any machine\n\nRoot cause of ''fresh clone shows no content + can''t login'': .env had an\nABSOLUTE DATABASE_URL (file:/home/z/my-project/db/custom.db) pointing at the\ndev sandbox. On any other machine that path doesn''t exist, so Prisma opened\nan empty/nonexistent DB → no pages/products + no admin user.\n\n- .env: switch to a RELATIVE path (file:./db/custom.db). Verified it resolves\n  to the committed starter db with data (6 pages, 8 products, admin login OK).\n- Re-seed db/custom.db clean (sample pages/cats/products/admin, 0 inquiries).\n- package.json: add ''postinstall: prisma generate'' (so install auto-builds the\n  Prisma Client — the generated client in node_modules isn''t committed),\n  ''seed'', and ''setup'' (generate + db push + seed in one command).\n- .gitignore: ignore SQLite journal/WAL/SHM files; keep db/custom.db as the\n  starter dataset.\n- README.md: 3-command quick start, admin creds, setup/reset commands,\n  content-customisation table, project layout.","tree":{"sha":"721d56b6f539a9b3009c7954657b04137a227b99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/git/trees/721d56b6f539a9b3009c7954657b04137a227b99"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/git/commits/e7654bb240a82eeb073e512dd66dd61e42e9da1a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commit/e7654bb240a82eeb073e512dd66dd61e42e9da1a","node_id":"C_kwDOUfviM9oAKGU3NjU0YmIyNDBhODJlZWIwNzNlNTEyZGQ2NmRkNjFlNDJlOWRhMWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commit/0d6ff6715340fd96d035463b741901bc216a26fe","sha":"0d6ff6715340fd96d035463b741901bc216a26fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commits/0d6ff6715340fd96d035463b741901bc216a26fe"}],"sha":"e7654bb240a82eeb073e512dd66dd61e42e9da1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commits/e7654bb240a82eeb073e512dd66dd61e42e9da1a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commits/0d6ff6715340fd96d035463b741901bc216a26fe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T04:38:45Z","email":"z@container","name":"Z User"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T04:38:45Z","email":"z@container","name":"Z User"},"message":"feat: wire title/logo/site-name to admin settings + 2nd-pass review fixes\n\n- Restore lost /api/upload route (auto-commit 76faaea had deleted it; admin\n  uploads were 404ing).\n- Title/favicon/logo now admin-editable: add siteNameEn/Cn to SiteSetting;\n  new shared <Brand> component renders settings.logo or the icon+wordmark;\n  PublicSite/AdminApp set document.title = ''{pageTitle} | {siteName}'' and the\n  favicon <link> from settings.logo. SettingsEditor gets a ''Brand'' card with\n  site name En/Cn + logo uploader.\n- 2nd-pass fixes (subagent): error/not-found states in 5 public pages;\n  Add/Delete page in PageManager; submission GET returns the updated (read)\n  record; Dashboard recent inquiries uses unfiltered list; N+1 in\n  collectDescendants replaced with a single query + in-memory DFS; keyboard\n  a11y on Dashboard cards + SubmissionViewer rows; image onError fallback.\n- SettingsEditor empty-state: render form when !data so Save still works.\n- Prisma log:[''query''] -> [''warn'',''error''] (less dev.log noise).","tree":{"sha":"261dccbed1cb3ff4d6389a391e8094f4f9279d01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/git/trees/261dccbed1cb3ff4d6389a391e8094f4f9279d01"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/git/commits/0d6ff6715340fd96d035463b741901bc216a26fe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commit/0d6ff6715340fd96d035463b741901bc216a26fe","node_id":"C_kwDOUfviM9oAKDBkNmZmNjcxNTM0MGZkOTZkMDM1NDYzYjc0MTkwMWJjMjE2YTI2ZmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commit/76faaea503fbbfd4293461667b420515eb9e1313","sha":"76faaea503fbbfd4293461667b420515eb9e1313","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commits/76faaea503fbbfd4293461667b420515eb9e1313"}],"sha":"0d6ff6715340fd96d035463b741901bc216a26fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commits/0d6ff6715340fd96d035463b741901bc216a26fe"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commits/76faaea503fbbfd4293461667b420515eb9e1313/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T09:01:31Z","email":"z@container","name":"Z User"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T09:01:31Z","email":"z@container","name":"Z User"},"message":"f056a6d8-9a72-4c9d-8339-6043bf456427","tree":{"sha":"c448d3bced9b085c88c4a522933033ff8fc1eebb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/git/trees/c448d3bced9b085c88c4a522933033ff8fc1eebb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/git/commits/76faaea503fbbfd4293461667b420515eb9e1313","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commit/76faaea503fbbfd4293461667b420515eb9e1313","node_id":"C_kwDOUfviM9oAKDc2ZmFhZWE1MDNmYmJmZDQyOTM0NjE2NjdiNDIwNTE1ZWI5ZTEzMTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commit/e35bd9003354bc3453c1906207de1dcbb021a6be","sha":"e35bd9003354bc3453c1906207de1dcbb021a6be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commits/e35bd9003354bc3453c1906207de1dcbb021a6be"}],"sha":"76faaea503fbbfd4293461667b420515eb9e1313","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commits/76faaea503fbbfd4293461667b420515eb9e1313"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commits/e35bd9003354bc3453c1906207de1dcbb021a6be/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T06:48:49Z","email":"z@container","name":"Z User"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T06:48:49Z","email":"z@container","name":"Z User"},"message":"fix: patch security, data-persistence, and UX bugs across site + admin\n\nCRITICAL\n- auth: validate session token server-side (add AdminUser.sessionToken,\n  hash + compare on each request); old forged-cookie bypass now rejected.\n  Cookie now sets secure in production.\n- upload: drop SVG (script XSS), derive extension from strict MIME map\n  (no longer trusts filename → can''t save .html), add 10MB size cap.\n- ProductManager: image drag/arrow reorder was a no-op (persistOrder\n  compared against the already-rewritten index); now compares against\n  the original orders so PUTs actually fire and persist.\n\nHIGH\n- categories: buildTree uses visited-set + depth cap (cycle/3-level guard);\n  PUT rejects self/descendant as parent (cycle prevention).\n- products images DELETE: only re-sync coverImage when the deleted image\n  WAS the cover (previously clobbered custom covers).\n- admin hooks: product/image mutations now also invalidate the public\n  [\"product\", id] detail cache (was only [\"products\"] lists); fixed the\n  [\"products\", vars.productId] typo in useAddProductImage.\n\nMEDIUM\n- SubmissionViewer: invalidate [\"submissions\"] after detail fetch so the\n  new→read auto-transition refreshes badges + dashboard count.\n- ContactForm: show real \"required\" error text (was an empty <p>).\n- ProductDetailPage: gate related-products query on the loaded product''s\n  categoryId (was fetching the whole catalog first).\n- submissions: clamp sourcePage (DoS); validate status enum on PUT.\n- products: validate status enum on PUT; coerce image urls to string.\n- ProductManager: keep sheet open + switch to edit mode after create so\n  images can be uploaded in the same flow.\n\nLOW\n- sync <html lang> with the UI language (PublicSite + AdminApp effects).\n- NewsPage: render admin-edited content blocks (fallback to sample cards).\n- ProductEditor: key reset effect on [open, product?.id] so background\n  category refetches don''t clobber unsaved edits.\n\nVerified: lint 0/0; auth (forged cookie rejected, wrong-pw 401);\nimage-reorder API persists; category self-parent PUT → 400; SVG upload\n→ 400; home + admin dashboard + products manager render end-to-end.","tree":{"sha":"b5ce4035f46771f89174f59346e53e57054739c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/git/trees/b5ce4035f46771f89174f59346e53e57054739c9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/git/commits/e35bd9003354bc3453c1906207de1dcbb021a6be","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commit/e35bd9003354bc3453c1906207de1dcbb021a6be","node_id":"C_kwDOUfviM9oAKGUzNWJkOTAwMzM1NGJjMzQ1M2MxOTA2MjA3ZGUxZGNiYjAyMWE2YmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commit/3bd05230a833dbe361c65b7681627ab844fc4f8e","sha":"3bd05230a833dbe361c65b7681627ab844fc4f8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commits/3bd05230a833dbe361c65b7681627ab844fc4f8e"}],"sha":"e35bd9003354bc3453c1906207de1dcbb021a6be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/perter526531/hlaproaudio/commits/e35bd9003354bc3453c1906207de1dcbb021a6be"},{"author":null,"comment