"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:43:29.235Z","repositoryId":1375539965,"sha":"e2cf1ff3093dc4a63fc0abcd397c5e3fcffa21a5"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"hle-mia-dt","providerType":"User"},"email":"phathuy261089@gmail.com","name":"Lph"},"authoredDate":"2026-09-18T07:24:02Z","committedDate":"2026-09-18T07:24:02Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"hle-mia-dt","providerType":"User"},"email":"phathuy261089@gmail.com","name":"Lph"},"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:43:29.235Z","repositoryId":1375539965,"sha":"6a8d0b02e76177fcf87128d399159c0a6816e90f"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-09T00:43:29.235Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114322484?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hle-mia-dt","id":114322484,"login":"hle-mia-dt","node_id":"U_kgDOBtBsNA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/orbit-platform/commits/9bc096abe6fa743b4d2a418fa47ddb7ee560d099/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T08:58:16Z","email":"phathuy261089@gmail.com","name":"Lph"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T08:58:16Z","email":"phathuy261089@gmail.com","name":"Lph"},"message":"fix(auth): rescope the refresh cookie so sessions survive the queue\n\nReported: signing in from the event queue page worked, but sitting in the\nvirtual waiting room past 10 minutes bounced the user back to sign-in, and\nthey had to keep re-authenticating for as long as they waited.\n\nCause: the refresh cookie''s Path was still /auth/refresh, the API''s own\nroute name, left over from before the same-origin proxy fix. The browser\nnever requests that literal path — every zone proxies /api/* to the API —\nso orbit_rt silently never matched and was dropped from every request a\nreal browser could make. On top of that, nothing on the client ever called\nrefresh at all. Together: an access token that hard-expires in exactly 10\nminutes with no way to renew it.\n\nConfirmed with a real cookie jar (curl -c/-b, which honors Path unlike this\nrepo''s Fastify `inject`-based tests, which is why the mismatch shipped\nunnoticed): a token scoped to /auth/refresh never reaches /api/auth/refresh;\nrescoped to /api/auth/refresh, it does, and refresh succeeds.\n\n- REFRESH_PATH is now /api/auth/refresh, the path the browser actually\n  requests, not the API''s internal route name\n- browser-api''s request() now retries once through a coalesced refresh on\n  401 before giving up, so a session self-heals past the 10-minute mark\n  instead of forcing a re-login\n- the regression test that had pinned the stale Path now pins the correct\n  one, with a note on why the old value looked right in isolation\n- docs/security.md updated to match\n\nAlso: added .claude/launch.json so this app previews through the Browser\npane going forward.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"34afa9bbbb6d84bce0e898dec4fb427c67c6d0c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/orbit-platform/git/trees/34afa9bbbb6d84bce0e898dec4fb427c67c6d0c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/orbit-platform/git/commits/9bc096abe6fa743b4d2a418fa47ddb7ee560d099","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114322484?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hle-mia-dt","id":114322484,"login":"hle-mia-dt","node_id":"U_kgDOBtBsNA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/orbit-platform/commit/9bc096abe6fa743b4d2a418fa47ddb7ee560d099","node_id":"C_kwDOUf0S_doAKDliYzA5NmFiZTZmYTc0M2I0ZDJhNDE4ZmE0N2RkYjdlZTU2MGQwOTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/orbit-platform/commit/2b39e9bef116900c2fa3f32858fea6cd8aa4ab6c","sha":"2b39e9bef116900c2fa3f32858fea6cd8aa4ab6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/orbit-platform/commits/2b39e9bef116900c2fa3f32858fea6cd8aa4ab6c"}],"sha":"9bc096abe6fa743b4d2a418fa47ddb7ee560d099","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/orbit-platform/commits/9bc096abe6fa743b4d2a418fa47ddb7ee560d099"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114322484?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hle-mia-dt","id":114322484,"login":"hle-mia-dt","node_id":"U_kgDOBtBsNA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/orbit-platform/commits/2b39e9bef116900c2fa3f32858fea6cd8aa4ab6c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T08:27:44Z","email":"phathuy261089@gmail.com","name":"Lph"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T08:27:44Z","email":"phathuy261089@gmail.com","name":"Lph"},"message":"fix(auth): end the sign-in loop by proxying the API same-origin\n\nReported by a user: signing in from localhost:3000 succeeded with a 200, then\nevery protected page asked them to sign in again, forever.\n\nCause: session cookies are SameSite=Lax. The page was on localhost:3000 and\nthe API on 127.0.0.1:4000 — different hostnames are different SITES, so the\nbrowser correctly discarded the Set-Cookie. Login worked; the session never\nexisted.\n\nMy test harness missed it because it used 127.0.0.1 for both the page and the\nAPI, making them same-site. It now uses localhost, like a human would.\n\nFix is architectural, not a cookie downgrade:\n\n- each zone proxies /api/* to the API, so every credentialed call is\n  first-party and CORS leaves the browser path entirely\n- browser clients call the relative /api; server clients keep the internal URL\n- the realtime socket needs its own port (WebSocket upgrades do not proxy\n  through Next rewrites), so it derives the host from the open page — ports do\n  not affect ''site'', hostnames do\n- generated poster URLs are relative too, so they work on any host\n\nSameSite=None would have made the symptom vanish and reopened the CSRF surface\nLax closes. A regression test now pins the cookie attributes so that ''fix'' has\nto be made deliberately.\n\nAlso: sign-in verifies the session actually stuck before navigating, turning a\nsilent infinite redirect into one clear message.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01APG5C4GouwX8BKRBuvLdSL","tree":{"sha":"0b64e840ec697aa377f981d963454a519ec432e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/orbit-platform/git/trees/0b64e840ec697aa377f981d963454a519ec432e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/orbit-platform/git/commits/2b39e9bef116900c2fa3f32858fea6cd8aa4ab6c","verification":{"payload":"tree 0b64e840ec697aa377f981d963454a519ec432e8\nparent 1276a9020d230737f0241ab16275c0b6428c931e\nauthor Lph <phathuy261089@gmail.com> 1789720064 +0000\ncommitter Lph <phathuy261089@gmail.com> 1789720064 +0000\n\nfix(auth): end the sign-in loop by proxying the API same-origin\n\nReported by a user: signing in from localhost:3000 succeeded with a 200, then\nevery protected page asked them to sign in again, forever.\n\nCause: session cookies are SameSite=Lax. The page was on localhost:3000 and\nthe API on 127.0.0.1:4000 — different hostnames are different SITES, so the\nbrowser correctly discarded the Set-Cookie. Login worked; the session never\nexisted.\n\nMy test harness missed it because it used 127.0.0.1 for both the page and the\nAPI, making them same-site. It now uses localhost, like a human would.\n\nFix is architectural, not a cookie downgrade:\n\n- each zone proxies /api/* to the API, so every credentialed call is\n  first-party and CORS leaves the browser path entirely\n- browser clients call the relative /api; server clients keep the internal URL\n- the realtime socket needs its own port (WebSocket upgrades do not proxy\n  through Next rewrites), so it derives the host from the open page — ports do\n  not affect ''site'', hostnames do\n- generated poster URLs are relative too, so they work on any host\n\nSameSite=None would have made the symptom vanish and reopened the CSRF surface\nLax closes. A regression test now pins the cookie attributes so that ''fix'' has\nto be made deliberately.\n\nAlso: sign-in verifies the session actually stuck before navigating, turning a\nsilent infinite redirect into one clear message.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01APG5C4GouwX8BKRBuvLdSL\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQD7WSVAx\nUAlSw7QxHt3LYgpEolrNnbfZuNUt44j2cslOuEQ/JppcjT9kfRuF9dqYdSOcEkB9T5+RrReq5EVz\nUQI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114322484?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hle-mia-dt","id":114322484,"login":"hle-mia-dt","node_id":"U_kgDOBtBsNA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/orbit-platform/commit/2b39e9bef116900c2fa3f32858fea6cd8aa4ab6c","node_id":"C_kwDOUf0S_doAKDJiMzllOWJlZjExNjkwMGMyZmEzZjMyODU4ZmVhNmNkOGFhNGFiNmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/orbit-platform/commit/1276a9020d230737f0241ab16275c0b6428c931e","sha":"1276a9020d230737f0241ab16275c0b6428c931e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/orbit-platform/commits/1276a9020d230737f0241ab16275c0b6428c931e"}],"sha":"2b39e9bef116900c2fa3f32858fea6cd8aa4ab6c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/orbit-platform/commits/2b39e9bef116900c2fa3f32858fea6cd8aa4ab6c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114322484?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hle-mia-dt","id":114322484,"login":"hle-mia-dt","node_id":"U_kgDOBtBsNA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/orbit-platform/commits/1276a9020d230737f0241ab16275c0b6428c931e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T07:26:08Z","email":"phathuy261089@gmail.com","name":"Lph"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T07:26:08Z","email":"phathuy261089@gmail.com","name":"Lph"},"message":"fix(shell): align category page revalidate with its fetch window\n\nNext caps a route''s revalidate at the shortest fetch revalidate inside it, so\nthe category pages were silently 60s despite declaring 300. Verified against\nnext build output rather than assumed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01APG5C4GouwX8BKRBuvLdSL","tree":{"sha":"3ec76c66a7a5a49879bfa8768c9b9062250555e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/orbit-platform/git/trees/3ec76c66a7a5a49879bfa8768c9b9062250555e2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/orbit-platform/git/commits/1276a9020d230737f0241ab16275c0b6428c931e","verification":{"payload":"tree 3ec76c66a7a5a49879bfa8768c9b9062250555e2\nparent 011c4b829b01e3d9a3f9e20409d0fa9294dac282\nauthor Lph <phathuy261089@gmail.com> 1789716368 +0000\ncommitter Lph <phathuy261089@gmail.com> 1789716368 +0000\n\nfix(shell): align category page revalidate with its fetch window\n\nNext caps a route''s revalidate at the shortest fetch revalidate inside it, so\nthe category pages were silently 60s despite declaring 300. Verified against\nnext build output rather than assumed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01APG5C4GouwX8BKRBuvLdSL\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQI31wuwp\n/IgaBG/1sZHXX9C5f8qTZ9fR4FuLhY2j1A5620UmZ3y8MU45rF6H8LaG6dZCiBk8vpQms390wSjq\nCQE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114322484?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hle-mia-dt","id":114322484,"login":"hle-mia-dt","node_id":"U_kgDOBtBsNA","organizati