r}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/orbit-platform/commits/e117270d6fc83cf5850e9c564a4d603889ef6a7b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T07:24:02Z","email":"phathuy261089@gmail.com","name":"Lph"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T07:24:02Z","email":"phathuy261089@gmail.com","name":"Lph"},"message":"feat(ui): design system as CSS custom properties\n\nTokens travel as custom properties rather than a JS theme object, which is\nwhat lets an independently-built federated remote stay on-theme — including\nin dark mode — without sharing a styling runtime with its host.\n\nChart ink is a single validated hue: the price-tier palette fails a\ncolourblind-safety check as a chart palette (tier-3/tier-4 separate by only\ndE 11.1 for normal vision) and is only ever used as swatches beside labels.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01APG5C4GouwX8BKRBuvLdSL","tree":{"sha":"f4a099815ee3a401fafb3bb09017ac973a1d8a22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/orbit-platform/git/trees/f4a099815ee3a401fafb3bb09017ac973a1d8a22"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/HuyPhat/orbit-platform/git/commits/e117270d6fc83cf5850e9c564a4d603889ef6a7b","verification":{"payload":"tree f4a099815ee3a401fafb3bb09017ac973a1d8a22\nparent d98e9c6f86d3446d130db771d1c8a2687ae467fb\nauthor Lph <phathuy261089@gmail.com> 1789716242 +0000\ncommitter Lph <phathuy261089@gmail.com> 1789716242 +0000\n\nfeat(ui): design system as CSS custom properties\n\nTokens travel as custom properties rather than a JS theme object, which is\nwhat lets an independently-built federated remote stay on-theme — including\nin dark mode — without sharing a styling runtime with its host.\n\nChart ink is a single validated hue: the price-tier palette fails a\ncolourblind-safety check as a chart palette (tier-3/tier-4 separate by only\ndE 11.1 for normal vision) and is only ever used as swatches beside labels.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01APG5C4GouwX8BKRBuvLdSL\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQPtUqpa5\ndQ8yssJKi0Jwti3SJrrMLVEqH/gkxd9nLWVmdn38YfapWtz/KBuRM65XQAmg+vSkSR9MBi9Je6ex\nkAM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114322484?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hle-mia-dt","id":114322484,"login":"hle-mia-dt","node_id":"U_kgDOBtBsNA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hle-mia-dt","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/orbit-platform/commit/e117270d6fc83cf5850e9c564a4d603889ef6a7b","node_id":"C_kwDOUf0S_doAKGUxMTcyNzBkNmZjODNjZjU4NTBlOWM1NjRhNGQ2MDM4ODllZjZhN2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/HuyPhat/orbit-platform/commit/d98e9c6f86d3446d130db771d1c8a2687ae467fb","sha":"d98e9c6f86d3446d130db771d1c8a2687ae467fb","url":"https://api.g