":"https://api.github.com/users/MET4L-DS/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MET4L-DS/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MET4L-DS/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MET4L-DS/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MET4L-DS","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MET4L-DS/open-mrs/commits/08086ac242aa7ce6e5a027bf824de9e1f92aa81e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T07:00:11Z","email":"73418468+MET4L-DS@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ayanshuDS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T07:00:11Z","email":"73418468+MET4L-DS@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ayanshuDS"},"message":"feat(esm-demographics-app): implement Form 9 Previous Surgery intake and dashboard\n\n- Register AIIMS Previous Surgery concepts in MariaDB and concept dictionary:\n  - Question concepts: c0010001-...-0058 to 0085 (approach, procedures, laterality, notes)\n  - Answer concepts: c0010002-...-0601 to 0662 (approaches, laterality, organ-specific interventions)\n- Add AMPATH schema `forms/aiims_prev_surgery.json` with conditional laterality skip logic\n- Publish form definition with UUID `80930653-7e80-4bfd-9e29-ec37c334d888`\n- Register `previous-surgery` in `FORM_REGISTRY` with `Cut` Carbon icon\n- Implement `previous-surgery` component suite:\n  - `usePreviousSurgery` hook with robust concept UUID & display label laterality mapping\n  - `PreviousSurgeryCard` with categorized procedure tags and laterality annotations\n  - `PreviousSurgeryDashboard` using reusable `FormDashboardShell`\n- Sync Single-SPA extensions in `routes.json` (9 forms, 18 extensions)\n- Add complete i18n translation keys in `translations/en.json`\n- Add unit tests for hook and card component (12 suites, 32 unit tests passing)\n- Update `PROJECT_MEMORY.md` with Form 9 specifications and deployment status","tree":{"sha":"e848d24187c43a8dd8d7736f1e1f084