anshuDS"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T07:04:58Z","email":"73418468+MET4L-DS@users.noreply.github.com","name":"ayanshuDS"},"message":"feat(female-factor): implement Form 5: Female Factor Infertility intake and dashboard\n\n- Introduce 9 question concepts (c0010001-...-0030 to 0038) and 36 answer\n  concepts (c0010002-...-0301 to 0366) in MariaDB and concept registries for:\n  - Tubal factor findings (unilateral/bilateral block, ectopic, hydrosalpinx, hematosalpinx)\n  - Diminished ovarian reserve & POSEIDON groups (1a, 1b, 2a, 2b, 3, 4)\n  - Endometriosis classifications (ASRM, EFI)\n  - Rotterdam PCOS phenotypes (A, B, C, D)\n  - Uterine factor findings (adenomyosis, fibroids, polyps, Asherman''s, septate, unicornuate)\n  - Other etiologies (hypogonadotropic hypogonadism, oncofertility, TB, Turner mosaic, etc.)\n  - Free-text clinical notes\n- Create AMPATH schema forms/aiims_female_factor.json (UUID: ...d884) with\n  multi-level nested skip logic (hideWhenExpression) based on primary factors\n- Add @aiims/esm-demographics-app female-factor module:\n  - Register female-factor in FORM_REGISTRY and routes.json\n  - useFemaleFactor hook supporting single and multi-select coded observations\n  - FemaleFactorCard with Carbon tags and categorized finding rows\n  - FemaleFactorDashboard with toolbar, empty state, and modal form integration\n  - i18n localization keys in translations/en.json\n- Add unit test coverage in female-factor-card.component.test.tsx\n- Update PROJECT_MEMORY.md and concept registry documentation","tree":{"sha":"68cdde8d83771272bbf08dec8d234770c259a230","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MET4L-DS/open-mrs/git/trees/68cdde8d83771272bbf08dec8d234770c259a230"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MET4L-DS/open-mrs/git/commits/d17b61633a67e65464315267dd0155202b6c8012","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.c