th Codebuff\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>","tree":{"sha":"21c50b50337e8c71aea7283abf66f0e0ae5b07bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jayvee2010/yc_moss_projectbrain/git/trees/21c50b50337e8c71aea7283abf66f0e0ae5b07bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jayvee2010/yc_moss_projectbrain/git/commits/70e3abe1b827dfc2275af1397fcce1000c4fc51f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/228506822?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jayvee2010","id":228506822,"login":"jayvee2010","node_id":"U_kgDODZ68xg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jayvee2010/yc_moss_projectbrain/commit/70e3abe1b827dfc2275af1397fcce1000c4fc51f","node_id":"C_kwDOUgZi_NoAKDcwZTNhYmUxYjgyN2RmYzIyNzVhZjEzOTdmY2NlMTAwMGM0ZmM1MWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jayvee2010/yc_moss_projectbrain/commit/7dd85c7e83244c5835b125e709f5acf7497cd3cb","sha":"7dd85c7e83244c5835b125e709f5acf7497cd3cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jayvee2010/yc_moss_projectbrain/commits/7dd85c7e83244c5835b125e709f5acf7497cd3cb"}],"sha":"70e3abe1b827dfc2275af1397fcce1000c4fc51f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jayvee2010/yc_moss_projectbrain/commits/70e3abe1b827dfc2275af1397fcce1000c4fc51f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/228506822?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jayvee2010","id":228506822,"login":"jayvee2010","node_id":"U_kgDODZ68xg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jayvee2010/yc_moss_projectbrain/commits/7dd85c7e83244c5835b125e709f5acf7497cd3cb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T19:29:41Z","email":"shah.jayvee@gmail.com","name":"jayvee2010"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T19:29:41Z","email":"shah.jayvee@gmail.com","name":"jayvee2010"},"message":"Add Vercel deployment support with serverless-safe bootstrapping\n\n- vercel.json routes all requests through the FastAPI app\n- DB path is env-configurable (PROJECTBRAIN_DB_PATH) since serverless\n  filesystems are read-only except /tmp\n- Cold-start bootstrap seeds the demo project into /tmp SQLite\n  (SEED_ON_BOOT=1); warm starts reuse the instance database\n- seed.run_seed gains index_into_moss flag so autosync is opt-in via\n  MOSS_AUTOSYNC, and Moss credit limits never break a deploy\n- .env.example documents every variable for Vercel and local setup\n- requirements.txt adds mangum for the Vercel Python runtime\n\nGenerated with Codebuff\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>","tree":{"sha":"1e7d7a07cef6363ab0b61c86dffdc0bdf1b9d3d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jayvee2010/yc_moss_projectbrain/git/trees/1e7d7a07cef6363ab0b61c86dffdc0bdf1b9d3d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jayvee2010/yc_moss_projectbrain/git/commits/7dd85c7e83244c5835b125e709f5acf7497cd3cb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/228506822?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jayvee2010","id":228506822,"login":"jayvee2010","node_id":"U_kgDODZ68xg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jayvee2010/yc_moss_projectbrain/commit/7dd85c7e83244c5835b125e709f5acf7497cd3cb","node_id":"C_kwDOUgZi_NoAKDdkZDg1YzdlODMyNDRjNTgzNWIxMjVlNzA5ZjVhY2Y3NDk3Y2QzY2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/jayvee2010/yc_moss_projectbrain/commit/fc022b89f4437b0f134114b4b797cb403180ffd1","sha":"fc022b89f4437b0f134114b4b797cb403180ffd1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jayvee2010/yc_moss_projectbrain/commits/fc022b89f4437b0f134114b4b797cb403180ffd1"}],"sha":"7dd85c7e83244c5835b125e709f5acf7497cd3cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jayvee2010/yc_moss_projectbrain/commits/7dd85c7e83244c5835b125e709f5acf7497cd3cb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/228506822?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jayvee2010","id":228506822,"login":"jayvee2010","node_id":"U_kgDODZ68xg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jayvee2010/yc_moss_projectbrain/commits/fc022b89f4437b0f134114b4b797cb403180ffd1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T19:09:53Z","email":"shah.jayvee@gmail.com","name":"jayvee2010"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T19:09:53Z","email":"shah.jayvee@gmail.com","name":"jayvee2010"},"message":"Add conflict resolution (POST /resolve) with frontend wiring and README\n\n- POST /resolve: supersede marks the old decision superseded and records\n  the proposal as the new active decision plus an audit timeline event;\n  keep records the proposal as a rejected_approach so repeat proposals\n  trip deterministic conflict detection (the system learns)\n- SQLite is the source of truth: Moss sync failures degrade to a\n  moss_warning instead of losing a resolution\n- Conflicts page buttons now call /resolve with the conflicting memory\n  ID from /check, replacing the /ingest workaround and cosmetic keep\n- Moss index sync switched to in-place upsert/delete (no load credit\n  burned per reconnect); project-scoped GitHub/seed memory IDs fix the\n  UNIQUE constraint crash when one repo feeds two projects\n- README with the product story, measured Moss latencies, and run guide\n\n🤖 Generated with Codebuff\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>","tree":{"sha":"9a42bd67c426c9054c356bce3c25a46ad3ad08e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jayvee2010/yc_moss_projectbrain/git/trees/9a42bd67c426c9054c356bce3c25a46ad3ad08e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jayvee2010/yc_moss_projectbrain/git/commits/fc022b89f4437b0f134114b4b797cb403180ffd1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/228506822?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jayvee2010","id":228506822,"login":"jayvee2010","node_id":"U_kgDODZ68xg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayvee2010","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/jayvee2010/yc_moss_projectbrain/commit/fc022b89f4437b0f134114b4b797cb403180ffd1","node_id":"C_kwDOUgZi_NoAKGZjMDIyYjg5ZjQ0MzdiMGYxMzQxMTRiNGI3OTdjYjQwMzE4MGZmZDE","parent