"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T18:03:35Z","email":"107414961+garvitguptark@users.noreply.github.com","name":"garvitguptark"},"message":"README: lead with pitch.com, where the gap is widest\n\nStripe is the easy case for plain Claude: it half-remembers the site. On\npitch.com, which it barely remembers, three runs per side give plain\nClaude 8-27% of colours from the real CSS, with zero exact matches, and\nthe plugin 69-82%. In six plain runs across both sites, with web access,\nplain Claude never opened the reference once. Stripe stays as the second\ndata point, with its screenshots linked.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6fd3a725ab407ad4ddc0c73f8daddf16764e243b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/garvitguptark/frontend-flow/git/trees/6fd3a725ab407ad4ddc0c73f8daddf16764e243b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/garvitguptark/frontend-flow/git/commits/73a32b9f24875b2b7c43a0a70f94d40f13fdbee4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107414961?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/garvitguptark","id":107414961,"login":"garvitguptark","node_id":"U_kgDOBmcFsQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/garvitguptark/frontend-flow/commit/73a32b9f24875b2b7c43a0a70f94d40f13fdbee4","node_id":"C_kwDOUgglltoAKDczYTMyYjlmMjQ4NzViMmI3YzQzYTBhNzBmOTRkNDBmMTNmZGJlZTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/garvitguptark/frontend-flow/commit/b2ced01f1caf999bacf1c9e249d5c4913cf1b7e6","sha":"b2ced01f1caf999bacf1c9e249d5c4913cf1b7e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/garvitguptark/frontend-flow/commits/b2ced01f1caf999bacf1c9e249d5c4913cf1b7e6"}],"sha":"73a32b9f24875b2b7c43a0a70f94d40f13fdbee4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/garvitguptark/frontend-flow/commits/73a32b9f24875b2b7c43a0a70f94d40f13fdbee4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107414961?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/garvitguptark","id":107414961,"login":"garvitguptark","node_id":"U_kgDOBmcFsQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/garvitguptark/frontend-flow/commits/b2ced01f1caf999bacf1c9e249d5c4913cf1b7e6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T17:51:07Z","email":"107414961+garvitguptark@users.noreply.github.com","name":"garvitguptark"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T17:51:07Z","email":"107414961+garvitguptark@users.noreply.github.com","name":"garvitguptark"},"message":"README: show the difference against plain Claude, with numbers\n\nLead with a side-by-side: the same \"like Stripe\" prompt, same model and\ntools, three runs each. Plain Claude never opened stripe.com, and 25-61%\nof its colours exist in Stripe''s real CSS. With the plugin, 78-88%. Add\na \"when plain Claude is enough\" list, and ship evals/fidelity/score.mjs\nso the numbers can be re-checked.\n\nAlso correct the /architecture claim the evals disproved: plain Claude\nrecommended a modular monolith for a solo developer 3 of 3 times. What\nit never did was state the trade-off and what would change its answer.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1ccd906da1e51be75b44f8a199359e590ff802c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/garvitguptark/frontend-flow/git/trees/1ccd906da1e51be75b44f8a199359e590ff802c5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/garvitguptark/frontend-flow/git/commits/b2ced01f1caf999bacf1c9e249d5c4913cf1b7e6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107414961?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/garvitguptark","id":107414961,"login":"garvitguptark","node_id":"U_kgDOBmcFsQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/garvitguptark/frontend-flow/commit/b2ced01f1caf999bacf1c9e249d5c4913cf1b7e6","node_id":"C_kwDOUgglltoAKGIyY2VkMDFmMWNhZjk5OWJhY2YxYzllMjQ5ZDVjNDkxM2NmMWI3ZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/garvitguptark/frontend-flow/commit/0c79bf8c3113619432572882eef59f186dafb74f","sha":"0c79bf8c3113619432572882eef59f186dafb74f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/garvitguptark/frontend-flow/commits/0c79bf8c3113619432572882eef59f186dafb74f"}],"sha":"b2ced01f1caf999bacf1c9e249d5c4913cf1b7e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/garvitguptark/frontend-flow/commits/b2ced01f1caf999bacf1c9e249d5c4913cf1b7e6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107414961?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/garvitguptark","id":107414961,"login":"garvitguptark","node_id":"U_kgDOBmcFsQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/garvitguptark/frontend-flow/commits/0c79bf8c3113619432572882eef59f186dafb74f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-26T17:23:56Z","email":"107414961+garvitguptark@users.noreply.github.com","name":"garvitguptark"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-26T17:23:56Z","email":"107414961+garvitguptark@users.noreply.github.com","name":"garvitguptark"},"message":"Fix main skill never loading; 0.3.1\n\nThe orchestrator''s SKILL.md description held an unquoted \": \" and ran to\n1081 characters, over the 1024 cap. Claude Code dropped the skill from the\nlisting without a warning, and `claude plugin validate` still passed, so\nbuild requests fell through to /website instead. Shorten it to 725\ncharacters with no colon, and word /website so it stops competing for\nbuild requests.\n\nAlso: manifest author/homepage/repository, eval tags so Windows can run\n`--tag no-shell`, a format-independent grader in rejects-buzzwords, and a\nlanding-page URL grader the judge no longer misreads.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e80a817aaa5d96e4e41007897750916e894f2063","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/garvitguptark/frontend-flow/git/trees/e80a817aaa5d96e4e41007897750916e894f2063"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/garvitguptark/frontend-flow/git/commits/0c79bf8c3113619432572882eef59f186dafb74f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107414961?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/garvitguptark","id":107414961,"login":"garvitguptark","node_id":"U_kgDOBmcFsQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/garvitguptark/frontend-flow/commit/0c79bf8c3113619432572882eef59f186dafb74f","node_id":"C_kwDOUgglltoAKDBjNzliZjhjMzExMzYxOTQzMjU3Mjg4MmVlZjU5ZjE4NmRhZmI3NGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/garvitguptark/frontend-flow/commit/e68a059fb1f5631ef83ba2b80568d5634daa880c","sha":"e68a059fb1f5631ef83ba2b80568d5634daa880c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/garvitguptark/frontend-flow/commits/e68a059fb1f5631ef83ba2b80568d5634daa880c"}],"sha":"0c79bf8c3113619432572882eef59f186dafb74f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/garvitguptark/frontend-flow/commits/0c79bf8c3113619432572882eef59f186dafb74f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107414961?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/garvitguptark","id":107414961,"login":"garvitguptark","node_id":"U_kgDOBmcFsQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/garvitguptark/frontend-flow/commits/e68a059fb1f5631ef83ba2b80568d5634daa880c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T15:36:12Z","email":"107414961+garvitguptark@users.noreply.github.com","name":"garvitguptark"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T15:54:55Z","email":"107414961+garvitguptark@users.noreply.github.com","name":"garvitguptark"},"message":"Add eval suite\n\nSeven cases for `claude plugin eval`, weighted toward the behaviour this plugin\nexists for: refusing an expensive architecture that a stated requirement does not\njustify. Each case runs with and without the plugin, so the delta shows what the\nplugin contributed rather than what the model would have done anyway.\n\n- rejects-buzzwords: the headline case. \"Scalable\" and \"enterprise-grade\" are\n  decoys; one developer and live tracking are the facts\n- earns-microservices: guards the other direction, so the table isn''t a constant\n- serverless-trap: a trigger that fires while its own trade-off disqualifies it\n- microfrontend-not-microservices: UI deploy pressure must not restructure a\n  backend that was stated as settled\n- drift-utility-first: scaffolds a Tailwind fixture and asserts the scanner never\n  again claims \"no interaction motion in CSS\" on a repo whose motion is in class\n  names, and that it names the token being bypassed\n- landing-page-no-gate: Phase 0 must stay silent on a one-page site\n- not-our-job: negative control, so over-triggering is detectable\n\nThe drift case needs Bash, which allowed_tools does not grant on its own:\nrun with `--allow-tools Bash --scaffold`.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"68a8ed0e1bad30b48b64c6e0ca3199288deb4faa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/garvitguptark/frontend-flow/git/trees/68a8ed0e1bad30b48b64c6e0ca3199288deb4faa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/garvitguptark/frontend-flow/git/commits/e68a059fb1f5631ef83ba2b80568d5634daa880c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107414961?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/garvitguptark","id":107414961,"login":"garvitguptark","node_id":"U_kgDOBmcFsQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/garvitguptark/frontend-flow/commit/e68a059fb1f5631ef83ba2b80568d5634daa880c","node_id":"C_kwDOUgglltoAKGU2OGEwNTlmYjFmNTYzMWVmODNiYTJiODA1NjhkNTYzNGRhYTg4MGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/garvitguptark/frontend-flow/commit/395c0bb3a0655f12016af68181c41e620dec2325","sha":"395c0bb3a0655f12016af68181c41e620dec2325","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/garvitguptark/frontend-flow/commits/395c0bb3a0655f12016af68181c41e620dec2325"}],"sha":"e68a059fb1f5631ef83ba2b80568d5634daa880c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/garvitguptark/frontend-flow/commits/e68a059fb1f5631ef83ba2b80568d5634daa880c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107414961?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/garvitguptark","id":107414961,"login":"garvitguptark","node_id":"U_kgDOBmcFsQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/garvitguptark","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/garvitguptark/frontend-flow/commits/395c0bb3a0655f12016af68181c41e620dec2325/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T18:13:17Z","email":"107414961+garvitguptark@users.noreply.github.com","name":"garvitguptark"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T18:13:17Z","email":"107414961+garvitguptark@users.noreply.github.com","name":"garvitguptark"},"message":"Frontend Flow 0.3.0\n\nA Claude Code plugin that decides the shape of what you''re building, then\nbuilds it against a real design reference instead of a guessed one.\n\n- /architecture maps a requirement onto one of seven system architectures,\n  walked cheapest-to-operate first, and names what the answer costs\n- /drift extracts the design system a codebase actually has, including\n  utility-first repos and the gap between declared tokens and real usage\n- /website reads design tokens off a reference site''s own stylesheets\n- frontend-builder turns tokens, motion level and architecture into files\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"74e8bf9d841bd741faf4239e17b86e6e4ee64fe5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/garvitguptark/frontend-flow/git/trees/74e8bf9d841bd741faf4239e17b86e6e4ee64fe5"},"url":"ht