istener, published through a Cloudflare quick tunnel\n  (or PUBLIC_URL). Only /u/<token> is reachable from the internet.\n- Uploaded photos are validated, uprighted and kept in memory only; they\n  render as die-cut photo stickers with an optional caption pill.\n- Color step gains All / Base / Gradient filter chips, sharing a new\n  FilterChips component with the font picker.\n- test_photos.py covers sessions, upload validation, shapes and captions.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3858ae599b56a306b7429b73f1778eced9ce7ad9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MakiKainan/SLOPS/git/trees/3858ae599b56a306b7429b73f1778eced9ce7ad9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MakiKainan/SLOPS/git/commits/c39e911dfeede8b5d538c4fa0ff074bfe630571d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/102711200?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MakiKainan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MakiKainan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MakiKainan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MakiKainan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/MakiKainan","id":102711200,"login":"MakiKainan","node_id":"U_kgDOBh8_oA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MakiKainan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MakiKainan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MakiKainan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MakiKainan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MakiKainan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MakiKainan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/MakiKainan/SLOPS/commit/c39e911dfeede8b5d538c4fa0ff074bfe630571d","node_id":"C_kwDOUg9EItoAKGMzOWU5MTFkZmVlZGU4YjVk