github.com/users/Ralph-Kilian/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ralph-Kilian/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ralph-Kilian","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RalphK66/mf-singleton-cross-scope/commits/f6ac7c70f693c8f8319dd4061dc69a04e4a3f623/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T05:06:03Z","email":"ralph.kilian@forsta.com","name":"Ralph Kilian"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T05:06:03Z","email":"ralph.kilian@forsta.com","name":"Ralph Kilian"},"message":"Add webpack remote and top-level shareScope to reproduce cross-scope singleton bug\n\nThe bug requires both a Webpack remote (which registers shares globally)\nand top-level shareScope on all federation configs. With this setup,\ngetRegisteredShare resolves singletons across all share scopes instead\nof respecting scope boundaries, causing a Vite React 18 remote to\nreceive React 19 from the Webpack remote''s scope.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a2ad7a75b127b075f022be2ee48d32ea6f4e9bd2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RalphK66/mf-singleton-cross-scope/git/trees/a2ad7a75b127b075f022be2ee48d32ea6f4e9bd2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RalphK66/mf-singleton-cross-scope/git/commits/f6ac7c70f693c8f8319dd4061dc69a04e4a3f623","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107004150?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ralph-Kilian/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ralph-Kilian/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ralph-Kilian/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ralph-Kilian/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Ralph-Kilian","id":107004150,"login":"Ralph-Kilian","node_id":"U_kgDOBmDA9g","organi