lowing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EugeneNguyen","id":4458160,"login":"EugeneNguyen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NTgxNjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/a6ac3f50df865b46d5e6ec8910703a8d403aaba3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T07:30:07Z","email":"xuanbinh91@gmail.com","name":"EugeneNguyen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T07:30:07Z","email":"xuanbinh91@gmail.com","name":"EugeneNguyen"},"message":"Mobile sidebar: open the menu in a left drawer\n\nBelow lg the top bar''s toggler opens the nav in platform-core''s own\nDrawer (placement \"start\", 16rem) instead of Bootstrap''s collapse\ndropdown - React state, no Bootstrap JS. It closes on navigation (the\ndrawer remembers the path it opened on), Escape, backdrop, the close\nbutton, and when the viewport grows to lg. Nav groups open inline in\nthe drawer rather than as popovers.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7983c54a861ba014b995fa700b8a824038f241f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/git/trees/7983c54a861ba014b995fa700b8a824038f241f8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/git/commits/a6ac3f50df865b46d5e6ec8910703a8d403aaba3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4458160?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EugeneNguyen","id":4458160,"login":"EugeneNguyen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NTgxNjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PMNexa/platform-core/commit/a6ac3f50df865b46d5e6ec8910703a8d403aaba3","node_id":"C_kwDOUhKRa9oAKGE2YWMzZjUwZGY4NjViNDZkNWU2ZWM4OTEwNzAzYThkNDAzYWFiYTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PMNexa/platform-core/commit/2510ade24d5c22e08f945c7b06ec4089c25ca1e3","sha":"2510ade24d5c22e08f945c7b06ec4089c25ca1e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/2510ade24d5c22e08f945c7b06ec4089c25ca1e3"}],"sha":"a6ac3f50df865b46d5e6ec8910703a8d403aaba3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/a6ac3f50df865b46d5e6ec8910703a8d403aaba3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4458160?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EugeneNguyen","id":4458160,"login":"EugeneNguyen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NTgxNjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/2510ade24d5c22e08f945c7b06ec4089c25ca1e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T06:27:27Z","email":"xuanbinh91@gmail.com","name":"EugeneNguyen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T06:27:27Z","email":"xuanbinh91@gmail.com","name":"EugeneNguyen"},"message":"Add platform_system: settings, audit log, email outbox, admin pages\n\ncore_api.system is the facade every module uses; platform_system (new\napp in this package) stores what it needs. Without the app installed,\nthe facade falls back: settings read env/defaults, audit is a no-op,\nemail sends directly.\n\n- System settings: modules register_setting(); a value comes from its\n  env variable (locked), the admin''s saved value, the host''s\n  SYSTEM_SETTING_DEFAULTS, then the default. Read-only deployment facts\n  (database, mail server, secrets set/missing, versions) via info.py.\n- Audit log (AuditEvent) with CSV export.\n- Email outbox (OutgoingEmail): EMAIL_URL parsing (core_api.email_url),\n  send on commit, retries with backoff via run_system_jobs().\n- Operations: job heartbeats, Apprise delivery log, usage providers,\n  announcement banner, status endpoint.\n- Hooks for other modules: user_removed / org_removed signals, session\n  providers, per-org limits (org_limit, check_org_limit), personal data\n  export providers.\n- Frontend: SystemSettingsScreen, SystemStatusScreen,\n  AnnouncementBanner, createSystemRoutes/createSystemNavItems, and a\n  listFile option on createCrudRoutes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2996c40f7a64f2261e8e7ebcd2590b051ef40de8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/git/trees/2996c40f7a64f2261e8e7ebcd2590b051ef40de8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/git/commits/2510ade24d5c22e08f945c7b06ec4089c25ca1e3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4458160?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EugeneNguyen","id":4458160,"login":"EugeneNguyen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NTgxNjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PMNexa/platform-core/commit/2510ade24d5c22e08f945c7b06ec4089c25ca1e3","node_id":"C_kwDOUhKRa9oAKDI1MTBhZGUyNGQ1YzIyZTA4Zjk0NWM3YjA2ZWM0MDg5YzI1Y2ExZTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PMNexa/platform-core/commit/147be7fcd010b6510802187e598aef95b2976ad5","sha":"147be7fcd010b6510802187e598aef95b2976ad5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/147be7fcd010b6510802187e598aef