://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4458160?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EugeneNguyen","id":4458160,"login":"EugeneNguyen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NTgxNjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/2f4f66f038c1c119f2040c5bea4a432e495ea4a1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T04:31:27Z","email":"xuanbinh91@gmail.com","name":"EugeneNguyen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T04:31:27Z","email":"xuanbinh91@gmail.com","name":"EugeneNguyen"},"message":"Check cross-module ids against the target resource''s scope\n\nA bare cross-module id (Meta.related_endpoints, e.g. a goal''s org_id)\nwas written like any plain field, so anyone could file a row under an\norg they don''t belong to. BaseViewSet now requires a new or changed\nvalue to be a row the caller could list at that endpoint - the same rule\nlink already uses - and answers 400 on the field otherwise. Fields whose\naccess is decided elsewhere opt out with\nMeta.unchecked_related_endpoints.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e6b2fdb85298966d8b3bf431882a19308d28eb3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/git/trees/e6b2fdb85298966d8b3bf431882a19308d28eb3b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/git/commits/2f4f66f038c1c119f2040c5bea4a432e495ea4a1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4458160?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EugeneNguyen","id":4458160,"login":"EugeneNguyen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NTgxNjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PMNexa/platform-core/commit/2f4f66f038c1c119f2040c5bea4a432e495ea4a1","node_id":"C_kwDOUhKRa9oAKDJmNGY2NmYwMzhjMWMxMTlmMjA0MGM1YmVhNGE0MzJlNDk1ZWE0YTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PMNexa/platform-core/commit/6294040a0784b15bdb83f8c47d2885b5e034f10e","sha":"6294040a0784b15bdb83f8c47d2885b5e034f10e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/6294040a0784b15bdb83f8c47d2885b5e034f10e"}],"sha":"2f4f66f038c1c119f2040c5bea4a432e495ea4a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/2f4f66f038c1c119f2040c5bea4a432e495ea4a1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4458160?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EugeneNguyen","id":4458160,"login":"EugeneNguyen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NTgxNjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/6294040a0784b15bdb83f8c47d2885b5e034f10e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T02:10:39Z","email":"xuanbinh91@gmail.com","name":"EugeneNguyen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T02:10:39Z","email":"xuanbinh91@gmail.com","name":"EugeneNguyen"},"message":"Add access-policy hook, schema capabilities, nav groups and relation labels\n\n- core_api/access.py: optional CORE_API_ACCESS_POLICY that every\n  BaseViewSet consults on top of its own permissions/scoping\n  (has_permission, has_object_permission, filter_queryset, allows).\n  Create/update re-check the saved row inside a transaction, so a row\n  can''t be created in or moved into a scope without rights there.\n  BaseViewSet.scope_field tells a policy where a row''s scope lives.\n- Schema reports `can: {create, update, delete}`; the generic list,\n  detail and relation screens hide actions the caller can''t use.\n- registry.registered_endpoints() for building permission catalogs.\n- CRUD tables sideload to-one relations (?include[]=) and show the\n  related row''s display_field instead of its id.\n- Sidebar: collapsible nav groups (NavGroup, entries with `children`),\n  closed state remembered per browser; folded rail shows a flyout.\n  NavItem gains an optional `permission` for hosts to filter on.\n- Folded sidebar brand initial centered on the rail.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c5c2f735fe66601ad89390c58a2999dfa758a310","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/git/trees/c5c2f735fe66601ad89390c58a2999dfa758a310"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/git/commits/6294040a0784b15bdb83f8c47d2885b5e034f10e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4458160?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EugeneNguyen","id":4458160,"login":"EugeneNguyen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NTgxNjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PMNexa/platform-core/commit/6294040a0784b15bdb83f8c47d2885b5e034f10e","node_id":"C_kwDOUhKRa9oAKDYyOTQwNDBhMDc4NGIxNWJkYjgzZjhjNDdkMjg4NWI1ZTAzNGYxMGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PMNexa/platform-core/commit/4e6dcc589