 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"597bd7565b4eb229c00c0772a0fca5bac2eba62b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/git/trees/597bd7565b4eb229c00c0772a0fca5bac2eba62b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/git/commits/4618b144431b533863658b140b671577d3867c3b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4458160?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EugeneNguyen","id":4458160,"login":"EugeneNguyen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NTgxNjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PMNexa/platform-core/commit/4618b144431b533863658b140b671577d3867c3b","node_id":"C_kwDOUhKRa9oAKDQ2MThiMTQ0NDMxYjUzMzg2MzY1OGIxNDBiNjcxNTc3ZDM4NjdjM2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PMNexa/platform-core/commit/affb03487f15d88d546606b1b862ced52f0b8891","sha":"affb03487f15d88d546606b1b862ced52f0b8891","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/affb03487f15d88d546606b1b862ced52f0b8891"}],"sha":"4618b144431b533863658b140b671577d3867c3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/4618b144431b533863658b140b671577d3867c3b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4458160?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EugeneNguyen","id":4458160,"login":"EugeneNguyen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NTgxNjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/affb03487f15d88d546606b1b862ced52f0b8891/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T06:07:32Z","email":"xuanbinh91@gmail.com","name":"EugeneNguyen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T06:07:32Z","email":"xuanbinh91@gmail.com","name":"EugeneNguyen"},"message":"Add schema-driven detail screen with 1-n CRUD and n-n linking\n\nBackend (core_api):\n- Schema describes each to-many relation''s kind (one_to_many /\n  many_to_many), its back_filter and a custom through model''s fields,\n  plus resource-level label/label_plural/display_field/searchable and\n  per-field format \"uuid\" / multiline hints.\n- BaseViewSet gains generic POST <res>/<id>/relations/<name>/link and\n  /unlink actions; linked ids are scoped through the related model''s\n  own viewset (auto-registered), through fields validated on link.\n- Test-only app + tests (python manage.py test tests\n  --settings=config.test_settings).\n\nFrontend:\n- CrudDetailScreen (/<resource>/:id): page header with breadcrumb,\n  one full-width card with a Details tab and one tab per relation\n  (row counts), in-place CRUD for children in modals, link/unlink and\n  create-and-link for many-to-many (CrudRelationSection,\n  CrudFormModal, CrudLinkModal).\n- Related rows link to wherever the host mounted them, resolved from\n  the route manifest (useResourcePath).\n- Labels, names and search visibility come from the schema; icon row\n  actions (new Icon atom), textarea for long text, formatted list\n  cells, narrower sidebar (AppShell sidebarWidth, default 13rem).\n- createCrudRoutes registers the detail route; list rows, create and\n  edit-save lead to it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e30d4b950a06e199c70cad29cddcd7c05b3e0639","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/git/trees/e30d4b950a06e199c70cad29cddcd7c05b3e0639"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/git/commits/affb03487f15d88d546606b1b862ced52f0b8891","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4458160?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EugeneNguyen","id":4458160,"login":"EugeneNguyen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NTgxNjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PMNexa/platform-core/commit/affb03487f15d88d546606b1b862ced52f0b8891","node_id":"C_kwDOUhKRa9oAKGFmZmIwMzQ4N2YxNWQ4OGQ1NDY2MDZiMWI4NjJjZWQ1MmYwYjg4OTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PMNexa/platform-core/commit/d5ce71bc9130ff45be38ff54088ddb3af8a77c96","sha":"d5ce71bc9130ff45be38ff54088ddb3af8a77c96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/d5ce71bc9130ff45be38ff54088ddb3af8a77c96"}],"sha":"affb03487f15d88d546606b1b862ced52f0b8891","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/affb03487f15d88d546606b1b862ced52f0b8891"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4458160?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EugeneNguyen","id":4458160,"login":"EugeneNguyen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NTgxNjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/d5ce71bc9130ff45be38ff54088ddb3af8a77c96/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T03:11:39Z","email":"xuanbinh91@gmail.com","name":"EugeneNguyen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T03:11:39Z","email":"xuanbinh91@gmail.com","name":"EugeneNguyen"},"message":"Route builders in the main entry, folding sidebar, Modal, date pickers\n\n- createCrudRoutes/prefixRoutes/routeFilePath are exported from \".\" (no\n  \"./routes\" subpath). They build plain route objects instead of using\n  @react-router/dev/routes and avoid node:* so they are safe in the\n  client bundle, where they tree-shake out.\n- AppShell: desktop sidebar folds to Tabler''s icon rail (.navbar-folded)\n  via a header toggle, remembered in localStorage. Folded items show\n  their icon (or first letter) with the label as a tooltip.\n- Modal organism: Tabler markup driven by React state, Escape/backdrop\n  close, scroll lock, focus in and back to the opener.\n- CrudFormFields: native date / datetime-local pickers (local <-> ISO\n  conversion) and help text. The schema now reports nullable and\n  help_text, so an emptied non-nullable field is omitted (server default\n  applies) while a nullable one sends null.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0f2ba03ae827e8f1ca9371df1e97d8b12301b52c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/git/trees/0f2ba03ae827e8f1ca9371df1e97d8b12301b52c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/git/commits/d5ce71bc9130ff45be38ff54088ddb3af8a77c96","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4458160?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EugeneNguyen","id":4458160,"login":"EugeneNguyen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NTgxNjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PMNexa/platform-core/commit/d5ce71bc9130ff45be38ff54088ddb3af8a77c96","node_id":"C_kwDOUhKRa9oAKGQ1Y2U3MWJjOTEzMGZmNDViZTM4ZmY1NDA4OGRkYjNhZjhhNzdjOTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PMNexa/platform-core/commit/07fdcbbeaf6f048fddecdc415db16f704cfc0e58","sha":"07fdcbbeaf6f048fddecdc415db16f704cfc0e58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/07fdcbbeaf6f048fddecdc415db16f704cfc0e58"}],"sha":"d5ce71bc9130ff45be38ff54088ddb3af8a77c96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/d5ce71bc9130ff45be38ff54088ddb3af8a77c96"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4458160?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EugeneNguyen","id":4458160,"login":"EugeneNguyen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NTgxNjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/07fdcbbeaf6f048fddecdc415db16f704cfc0e58/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T01:46:16Z","email":"xuanbinh91@gmail.com","name":"EugeneNguyen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T01:46:16Z","email":"xuanbinh91@gmail.com","name":"EugeneNguyen"},"message":"Show a message when every column is hidden instead of a blank table\n\nHiding every column via ColumnPicker (no bulk guard - just individual\ntoggles) left DataTable rendering zero header cells and zero body\ncells with no explanation at all - \"schema loaded, data loaded,\nnothing visible\" was technically correct (visibleColumns really was\nempty), just indistinguishable from a real bug. Add a message for that\nstate, in both toolbar and bare (CrudListScreen) modes - bare mode is\nthe one every real caller in this platform actually uses, so excluding\nit (the first attempt at this fix) meant no caller ever saw the\nmessage at all.","tree":{"sha":"7b5a6952b7202f8a9b51607554a0d963ed15b61f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/git/trees/7b5a6952b7202f8a9b51607554a0d963ed15b61f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/git/commits/07fdcbbeaf6f048fddecdc415db16f704cfc0e58","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4458160?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EugeneNguyen","id":4458160,"login":"EugeneNguyen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NTgxNjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PMNexa/platform-core/commit/07fdcbbeaf6f048fddecdc415db16f704cfc0e58","node_id":"C_kwDOUhKRa9oAKDA3ZmRjYmJlYWY2ZjA0OGZkZGVjZGM0MTVkYjE2ZjcwNGNmYzBlNTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PMNexa/platform-core/commit/1a8875e904302447fa0856f417cad365dc4e92c2","sha":"1a8875e904302447fa0856f417cad365dc4e92c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/1a8875e904302447fa0856f417cad365dc4e92c2"}],"sha":"07fdcbbeaf6f048fddecdc415db16f704cfc0e58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/07fdcbbeaf6f048fddecdc415db16f704cfc0e58"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4458160?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EugeneNguyen","id":4458160,"login":"EugeneNguyen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NTgxNjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/1a8875e904302447fa0856f417cad365dc4e92c2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T00:31:20Z","email":"xuanbinh91@gmail.com","name":"EugeneNguyen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T00:31:20Z","email":"xuanbinh91@gmail.com","name":"EugeneNguyen"},"message":"Nest createCrudRoutes with prefix(), let editFile stay a real escape hatch\n\nSwitch createCrudRoutes to prefix(resource, [index, route(\"new\"),\nroute(\":id/edit\")]) instead of three flat route() calls repeating the\nresource name - same URLs, one grouping point. Fix crud-new.tsx/\ncrud-edit.tsx to derive the resource from the URL''s LAST segment(s),\nnot the first - crud-edit.tsx''s old front-anchored derivation only\nhappened to work because nothing was nested yet; a host nesting a\nresource under its own prefix (see platform-org''s own commit) would\nhave silently computed the wrong backend URL and the wrong \"go back to\nlist\" target otherwise.\n\nAdd CrudListScreen''s own `basePath` prop so its internal New/Edit link\nhrefs respect a nested mount point too, not just the generic route\nfiles'' own navigation.","tree":{"sha":"f5f8e43392dff0bf05af3f0895bc7ec0d8e84f9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/git/trees/f5f8e43392dff0bf05af3f0895bc7ec0d8e84f9b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/git/commits/1a8875e904302447fa0856f417cad365dc4e92c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4458160?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EugeneNguyen","id":4458160,"login":"EugeneNguyen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NTgxNjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PMNexa/platform-core/commit/1a8875e904302447fa0856f417cad365dc4e92c2","node_id":"C_kwDOUhKRa9oAKDFhODg3NWU5MDQzMDI0NDdmYTA4NTZmNDE3Y2FkMzY1ZGM0ZTkyYzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PMNexa/platform-core/commit/baf9850d12167107ebbbd4dd224832182cbf7d47","sha":"baf9850d12167107ebbbd4dd224832182cbf7d47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/baf9850d12167107ebbbd4dd224832182cbf7d47"}],"sha":"1a8875e904302447fa0856f417cad365dc4e92c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/1a8875e904302447fa0856f417cad365dc4e92c2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4458160?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EugeneNguyen","id":4458160,"login":"EugeneNguyen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NTgxNjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/baf9850d12167107ebbbd4dd224832182cbf7d47/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T15:42:51Z","email":"xuanbinh91@gmail.com","name":"EugeneNguyen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T15:42:51Z","email":"xuanbinh91@gmail.com","name":"EugeneNguyen"},"message":"Make CrudRouter fully schema-driven; add relation picker support\n\nReplace hand-written per-resource CRUD config/routes with a generic\nschema-driven pipeline: CrudListScreen/CrudCreateScreen/CrudEditScreen\nnow take only baseUrl+accessToken, load BaseViewSet.schema() first, and\nderive columns/fields from it (createSchemaColumns/createSchemaFields).\ncreateCrudRouter builds the three screens from one baseUrl; the three\ngeneric route files (routes/crud-{list,new,edit}.tsx) replace every\nper-module route file, registered via createCrudRoutes in a host''s own\nroutes.ts.\n\nAdd relation field support: a to-one relation now renders as a real\npicker (select, options fetched from its own related_endpoint) instead\nof a bare-id text box - fixes a real bug where every relation field was\nexcluded from write forms entirely (DynamicRelationField is always\nread_only=True by design, which isWritable was treating as \"not\nwritable\" instead of just \"not through validated_data\"). New\ncore_api.registry lets a serializer''s Meta.related_endpoints tag a bare\ncross-module id field (no real FK) as a relation too, for the frontend''s\nsake only.\n\nRemove the standalone dev-app scaffold (App.tsx/main.tsx/index.html/etc)\n- this package is only ever consumed, never run on its own.","tree":{"sha":"d820ec64c7da5c000feb69394c0103f3ea04cabf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/git/trees/d820ec64c7da5c000feb69394c0103f3ea04cabf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/git/commits/baf9850d12167107ebbbd4dd224832182cbf7d47","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4458160?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EugeneNguyen","id":4458160,"login":"EugeneNguyen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NTgxNjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PMNexa/platform-core/commit/baf9850d12167107ebbbd4dd224832182cbf7d47","node_id":"C_kwDOUhKRa9oAKGJhZjk4NTBkMTIxNjcxMDdlYmJiZDRkZDIyNDgzMjE4MmNiZjdkNDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PMNexa/platform-core/commit/d9f87a22830f7e18fc32ae3eb926955e5531674d","sha":"d9f87a22830f7e18fc32ae3eb926955e5531674d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/d9f87a22830f7e18fc32ae3eb926955e5531674d"}],"sha":"baf9850d12167107ebbbd4dd224832182cbf7d47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/baf9850d12167107ebbbd4dd224832182cbf7d47"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4458160?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EugeneNguyen","id":4458160,"login":"EugeneNguyen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NTgxNjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/d9f87a22830f7e18fc32ae3eb926955e5531674d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T09:12:14Z","email":"xuanbinh91@gmail.com","name":"EugeneNguyen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T09:12:14Z","email":"xuanbinh91@gmail.com","name":"EugeneNguyen"},"message":"Un-defer to-one auto relations, add select CrudField, add BaseViewSet.schema\n\nBaseSerializer''s auto-relation-wrapping deferred EVERY auto-added\nrelation, including a plain to-one forward FK (e.g. Metric.goal) - those\nnever actually got expensive to fetch (they''re already a column on the\nrow), so deferring them meant a plain retrieve/list never included them\nat all unless a caller explicitly sideloaded via ?include[]=, breaking\nany consumer (like an edit form) that needs to know the current value to\npre-fill a control. Only a to-many relation (reverse/M2M) auto-defers now.\n\nCrudField gains a \"select\" type (CrudFormFields renders a native\n<select>) - the only way a to-one relation like the one above can\nactually be edited from a generic CRUD screen. Its empty placeholder\noption is only disabled when the field is required, so an optional\nrelation can be explicitly cleared back to null, not just left unset.\n\nBaseViewSet gains a generic `GET <resource>/schema` action (every\nsubclass gets it for free) describing every field a serializer can\nemit - type, required/read_only, choices for an enum, and (for a\nrelation) its target model, many-ness, and whether it''s deferred by\ndefault. Meant to eventually replace a per-resource hand-written\nCrudConfig field list with something generated from this instead.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"502ca4763a8e63caec3f56d60ca53250366e7a0d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/git/trees/502ca4763a8e63caec3f56d60ca53250366e7a0d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/git/commits/d9f87a22830f7e18fc32ae3eb926955e5531674d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4458160?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EugeneNguyen","id":4458160,"login":"EugeneNguyen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NTgxNjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PMNexa/platform-core/commit/d9f87a22830f7e18fc32ae3eb926955e5531674d","node_id":"C_kwDOUhKRa9oAKGQ5Zjg3YTIyODMwZjdlMThmYzMyYWUzZWI5MjY5NTVlNTUzMTY3NGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PMNexa/platform-core/commit/7e4869e5fbcc4f7823e56913e1b64ae53c7c32ec","sha":"7e4869e5fbcc4f7823e56913e1b64ae53c7c32ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/7e4869e5fbcc4f7823e56913e1b64ae53c7c32ec"}],"sha":"d9f87a22830f7e18fc32ae3eb926955e5531674d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/d9f87a22830f7e18fc32ae3eb926955e5531674d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4458160?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EugeneNguyen","id":4458160,"login":"EugeneNguyen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NTgxNjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/7e4869e5fbcc4f7823e56913e1b64ae53c7c32ec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T04:26:11Z","email":"xuanbinh91@gmail.com","name":"EugeneNguyen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T04:26:11Z","email":"xuanbinh91@gmail.com","name":"EugeneNguyen"},"message":"Fix N+1: BaseViewSet didn''t prefetch auto-added relation fields\n\nget_auto_relations() (classmethod, no instance/request needed) exposes\nthe same relation set get_fields() auto-wraps, factored out of it -\nBaseViewSet.get_queryset() only checked _declared_fields for a sideloaded\nDynamicRelationField to prefetch_related, which never included a relation\nBaseSerializer added on its own (auto-fields mode). Organization.memberships\nand OrgMembership.org silently lost prefetch coverage the moment their\nhand-declared fields were dropped in favor of auto mode - caught while\nbuilding the same auto-relation pattern for a new module.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c2cd91775bfa636976123e43d3423b61cf26d51e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/git/trees/c2cd91775bfa636976123e43d3423b61cf26d51e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/git/commits/7e4869e5fbcc4f7823e56913e1b64ae53c7c32ec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4458160?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EugeneNguyen","id":4458160,"login":"EugeneNguyen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NTgxNjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PMNexa/platform-core/commit/7e4869e5fbcc4f7823e56913e1b64ae53c7c32ec","node_id":"C_kwDOUhKRa9oAKDdlNDg2OWU1ZmJjYzRmNzgyM2U1NjkxM2UxYjY0YWU1M2M3YzMyZWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PMNexa/platform-core/commit/408e5264a8e35b4b604abdbc4b4b49f413bf7567","sha":"408e5264a8e35b4b604abdbc4b4b49f413bf7567","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/408e5264a8e35b4b604abdbc4b4b49f413bf7567"}],"sha":"7e4869e5fbcc4f7823e56913e1b64ae53c7c32ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/7e4869e5fbcc4f7823e56913e1b64ae53c7c32ec"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4458160?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EugeneNguyen","id":4458160,"login":"EugeneNguyen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NTgxNjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/408e5264a8e35b4b604abdbc4b4b49f413bf7567/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T04:18:49Z","email":"xuanbinh91@gmail.com","name":"EugeneNguyen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T04:18:49Z","email":"xuanbinh91@gmail.com","name":"EugeneNguyen"},"message":"Auto-derive BaseSerializer fields and relations from the model by default\n\nMeta.fields is now optional - omit it (and Meta.exclude) and every model\nfield is emitted, same as fields = \"__all__\". In that mode every relation\n(forward FK/O2O/M2M, reverse _set side) is also auto-added, wrapped as\nDynamicRelationField and auto-deferred, resolved against related models\nvia a Meta.model -> serializer class registry built as subclasses load -\nno more hand-declaring each relation field or wiring deferred-import\nhelpers to dodge circular imports between mutually-referencing serializers.\nMeta.fields, Meta.deferred_fields, and hand-declared fields still override\nper subclass. Meta.auto_exclude permanently drops named fields in auto\nmode (distinct from the per-request ?exclude[]=, which a caller can just\nnot pass).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2f6e2623b9e8d9450093fbe0a597e7f6ab7a7c61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/git/trees/2f6e2623b9e8d9450093fbe0a597e7f6ab7a7c61"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/git/commits/408e5264a8e35b4b604abdbc4b4b49f413bf7567","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4458160?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EugeneNguyen","id":4458160,"login":"EugeneNguyen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NTgxNjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PMNexa/platform-core/commit/408e5264a8e35b4b604abdbc4b4b49f413bf7567","node_id":"C_kwDOUhKRa9oAKDQwOGU1MjY0YThlMzViNGI2MDRhYmRiYzRiNGI0OWY0MTNiZjc1Njc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PMNexa/platform-core/commit/e1bf1d93e4a28ee51089f82f0d2b528768cf90bb","sha":"e1bf1d93e4a28ee51089f82f0d2b528768cf90bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/e1bf1d93e4a28ee51089f82f0d2b528768cf90bb"}],"sha":"408e5264a8e35b4b604abdbc4b4b49f413bf7567","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/408e5264a8e35b4b604abdbc4b4b49f413bf7567"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4458160?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EugeneNguyen","id":4458160,"login":"EugeneNguyen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NTgxNjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/e1bf1d93e4a28ee51089f82f0d2b528768cf90bb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T03:18:39Z","email":"xuanbinh91@gmail.com","name":"EugeneNguyen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T03:18:39Z","email":"xuanbinh91@gmail.com","name":"EugeneNguyen"},"message":"Add a design system (components/, containers/) with DataTable and CrudRouter\n\nBuilds a Tabler-based component library on top of AppShell: Button,\nCard, Breadcrumb, Fieldset/FormLabel/FormControl/FormCheck, Pagination,\nalongside the existing Table/Checkbox - each in its own folder\n(Component.tsx + index.ts + colocated test), one barrel per level.\nDashboardLayout now wraps children in .container-xl, matching Tabler''s\nown page-body convention.\n\ncontainers/DataTable/ is a real fetched/paginated/sortable/searchable\nlist from one DataTableConfig, matching core_api''s list-endpoint\ncontract exactly (?page=/?sort=/?q=). Supports both an owned-state\nconfig mode and a lifted table mode (useDataTable called by the caller,\npassed in) for hosts that want to build their own chrome around it -\nColumnPicker was extracted for the same reason. Per-column filtering\n(filterable/filterLookup, ?filter{}=) was built, then removed wholesale\nafter review; core_api''s own DynamicFilterBackend is untouched.\n\ncontainers/CrudRouter/ bundles List/Create/Edit screens plus their path\nsegments (createCrudRouter) on top of DataTable, all Card-framed. The\nwhole row opens the edit screen via a per-cell decoy Link (not a\nstretched-link on <tr>, which real browsers don''t support as a\ncontaining block, and not on the visible Edit link itself, since .btn''s\nown position:relative breaks the same trick one level closer) - required\nwidening LinkComponentProps to pass through tabIndex/aria-hidden.\n\n30 test files, 120 tests. AGENTS.md documents all of it, including the\napproaches that looked right and weren''t, verified against a real\nbrowser rather than trusted from reasoning alone.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fb51fe28ebda07bd63d274e7b9656f96677f0a25","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/git/trees/fb51fe28ebda07bd63d274e7b9656f96677f0a25"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/git/commits/e1bf1d93e4a28ee51089f82f0d2b528768cf90bb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4458160?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EugeneNguyen","id":4458160,"login":"EugeneNguyen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NTgxNjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PMNexa/platform-core/commit/e1bf1d93e4a28ee51089f82f0d2b528768cf90bb","node_id":"C_kwDOUhKRa9oAKGUxYmYxZDkzZTRhMjhlZTUxMDg5ZjgyZjBkMmI1Mjg3NjhjZjkwYmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PMNexa/platform-core/commit/9ad7ea7e586fb43641da080bb291af00768d6c51","sha":"9ad7ea7e586fb43641da080bb291af00768d6c51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/9ad7ea7e586fb43641da080bb291af00768d6c51"}],"sha":"e1bf1d93e4a28ee51089f82f0d2b528768cf90bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/e1bf1d93e4a28ee51089f82f0d2b528768cf90bb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4458160?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EugeneNguyen","id":4458160,"login":"EugeneNguyen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NTgxNjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/9ad7ea7e586fb43641da080bb291af00768d6c51/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T12:15:41Z","email":"xuanbinh91@gmail.com","name":"EugeneNguyen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T12:15:41Z","email":"xuanbinh91@gmail.com","name":"EugeneNguyen"},"message":"Absorb platform-ui''s AppShell into frontend/ as the platform-core package\n\nplatform-ui was frontend-only (no backend), so it had nothing to justify\nits own repo once the platform''s convention became packaging a\nfrontend+backend pair per module. Its atomic-design AppShell source\nmoves in as this repo''s frontend package (name: platform-core, exports\nsrc/index.ts) alongside the existing, still-unused Module Federation\nshell, which is untouched.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"029da677cb1267128f45f8283bfc2fc6541fe22d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/git/trees/029da677cb1267128f45f8283bfc2fc6541fe22d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/git/commits/9ad7ea7e586fb43641da080bb291af00768d6c51","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4458160?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EugeneNguyen","id":4458160,"login":"EugeneNguyen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NTgxNjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PMNexa/platform-core/commit/9ad7ea7e586fb43641da080bb291af00768d6c51","node_id":"C_kwDOUhKRa9oAKDlhZDdlYTdlNTg2ZmI0MzY0MWRhMDgwYmIyOTFhZjAwNzY4ZDZjNTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PMNexa/platform-core/commit/614fdd810e08a58de03594fe2d95c0b6def80056","sha":"614fdd810e08a58de03594fe2d95c0b6def80056","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/614fdd810e08a58de03594fe2d95c0b6def80056"}],"sha":"9ad7ea7e586fb43641da080bb291af00768d6c51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/9ad7ea7e586fb43641da080bb291af00768d6c51"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4458160?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EugeneNguyen","id":4458160,"login":"EugeneNguyen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NTgxNjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/614fdd810e08a58de03594fe2d95c0b6def80056/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T09:31:05Z","email":"xuanbinh91@gmail.com","name":"EugeneNguyen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T09:31:05Z","email":"xuanbinh91@gmail.com","name":"EugeneNguyen"},"message":"Add BaseSerializer/BaseViewSet - dynamic fields, sideloading, filtering\n\nInspired by django-rest-framework''s dynamic-rest, reimplemented against\nthis platform''s own conventions instead of vendored, since dynamic-rest\nbakes in its own pagination/routing opinions:\n\n- BaseSerializer: ?include[]=/?exclude[]= control which declared fields\n  serialize; Meta.deferred_fields lists ones left out unless explicitly\n  included.\n- DynamicRelationField: a relation renders as a bare id (or list of ids)\n  by default; naming it in ?include[]= sideloads the full nested\n  representation via another BaseSerializer instead. Accepts a zero-arg\n  callable instead of a class directly, so two serializers can reference\n  each other without a circular import.\n- DynamicFilterBackend: ?filter{field}=value, ?filter{field.lookup}=value\n  (icontains/gt/gte/lt/lte/in/isnull), leading \"-\" negates.\n- BaseViewSet: composes all of the above plus EnvelopePageNumberPagination\n  and the existing ?sort=/?q= filters, and auto-prefetch_relateds any\n  sideloaded many=True relation to avoid a silent N+1.\n\nerrors.py is now the superset of what platform-auth''s and platform-org''s\nown previously-vendored copies each declared, and exceptions.py''s handler\nis renamed to the generic platform_exception_handler - every module''s\nsettings.py now points at this one function. See root AGENTS.md for the\napps/main settings.py gotcha this surfaced (a host''s own\nEXCEPTION_HANDLER copy doesn''t follow renames in a module''s settings.py).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8315b377e10bd5e79754366946767d9fb71057e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/git/trees/8315b377e10bd5e79754366946767d9fb71057e6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/git/commits/614fdd810e08a58de03594fe2d95c0b6def80056","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4458160?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EugeneNguyen","id":4458160,"login":"EugeneNguyen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NTgxNjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PMNexa/platform-core/commit/614fdd810e08a58de03594fe2d95c0b6def80056","node_id":"C_kwDOUhKRa9oAKDYxNGZkZDgxMGUwOGE1OGRlMDM1OTRmZTJkOTVjMGI2ZGVmODAwNTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PMNexa/platform-core/commit/30fd07788da369c895f705f438959aa9c5f24775","sha":"30fd07788da369c895f705f438959aa9c5f24775","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/30fd07788da369c895f705f438959aa9c5f24775"}],"sha":"614fdd810e08a58de03594fe2d95c0b6def80056","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/614fdd810e08a58de03594fe2d95c0b6def80056"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4458160?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EugeneNguyen","id":4458160,"login":"EugeneNguyen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NTgxNjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/30fd07788da369c895f705f438959aa9c5f24775/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T00:31:22Z","email":"xuanbinh91@gmail.com","name":"EugeneNguyen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T00:31:22Z","email":"xuanbinh91@gmail.com","name":"EugeneNguyen"},"message":"Load a module''s UI inline via Module Federation, based on modules.yaml''s remote_entry\n\nvite.config.ts''s federation() plugin declares shared react/react-dom\nsingletons with no static remotes - which module(s) to load is entirely\nruntime data. src/lib/remoteComponents.tsx registers a module as a\nremote and loads one exposed component from it\n(@module-federation/runtime''s registerRemotes/loadRemote), idempotently.\nHome.tsx uses this to render platform-auth''s RemoteLogin inline; falls\nback to the existing url_prefix link if a module has no remote_entry.\n\nModuleConfig (backend) and its TS mirror both gain remote_entry.\n\nVerified in a real headless browser (Playwright): the federated form\nrenders on platform-core''s own page and a full login round-trip\nsucceeds, with react/react-dom correctly deduped to one instance across\nthe two independently-built apps (no \"invalid hook call\" crash).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"89be604108f622a88c802ea75318c4ac27857530","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/git/trees/89be604108f622a88c802ea75318c4ac27857530"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/git/commits/30fd07788da369c895f705f438959aa9c5f24775","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4458160?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EugeneNguyen","id":4458160,"login":"EugeneNguyen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NTgxNjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/PMNexa/platform-core/commit/30fd07788da369c895f705f438959aa9c5f24775","node_id":"C_kwDOUhKRa9oAKDMwZmQwNzc4OGRhMzY5Yzg5NWY3MDVmNDM4OTU5YWE5YzVmMjQ3NzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/PMNexa/platform-core/commit/ceea6b9e6e28e794f4e2f80f1ca664e425e30d23","sha":"ceea6b9e6e28e794f4e2f80f1ca664e425e30d23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/ceea6b9e6e28e794f4e2f80f1ca664e425e30d23"}],"sha":"30fd07788da369c895f705f438959aa9c5f24775","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/30fd07788da369c895f705f438959aa9c5f24775"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4458160?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EugeneNguyen","id":4458160,"login":"EugeneNguyen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NTgxNjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/ceea6b9e6e28e794f4e2f80f1ca664e425e30d23/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T16:41:12Z","email":"xuanbinh91@gmail.com","name":"EugeneNguyen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T16:41:12Z","email":"xuanbinh91@gmail.com","name":"EugeneNguyen"},"message":"Move platform-core to single-port composition: /api routes, url_prefix links\n\nBackend routes move under /api (matching platform-auth''s own convention),\nso every module in this platform is reachable at /api on its own port -\nand, composed, at <gateway>/api behind a single nginx entrypoint.\n\nFrontend simplifies: modules.yaml''s frontend_url (an absolute,\ncross-port URL the shell redirected to) becomes url_prefix (a path the\ngateway itself routes) - drops the now-dead client-side\nModuleRedirect/useParams routing entirely, since the gateway handles\ncross-module navigation before it ever reaches this frontend''s own\nrouter. Home page just links to each module''s url_prefix.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"35036ca53285201fe867ddac8fff89b12cb4da9d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/git/trees/35036ca53285201fe867ddac8fff89b12cb4da9d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/git/commits/ceea6b9e6e28e794f4e2f80f1ca664e425e30d23","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4458160?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EugeneNguyen","id":4458160,"login":"EugeneNguyen","node_id":"MDQ6V