ps://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/EugeneNguyen","id":4458160,"login":"EugeneNguyen","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NTgxNjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EugeneNguyen","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/PMNexa/platform-core/commits/aecc36ecd7ad980e4e0ecc6dd2134f2ede8498fe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T16:05:52Z","email":"xuanbinh91@gmail.com","name":"EugeneNguyen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T16:05:52Z","email":"xuanbinh91@gmail.com","name":"EugeneNguyen"},"message":"Rewrite platform-core backend on Django + DRF, drop all models\n\nplatform-core becomes a pure kernel: shared DRF conventions (error\ncontract, pagination, filters, uuid7/timestamp utils via core_api/) that\nother modules build on. No Actor/User/Organization/RBAC/Project models,\nno generic CRUD factory, no entity registry - all of that was tightly\ncoupled to a domain this repo shouldn''t own. Auth already moved to\nplatform-auth; other capabilities (orgs, RBAC, product features) are\nexpected to become their own modules the same way.\n\nOnly real route: GET /health. frontend/, nginx/, docker-compose.yml are\nnow stale (built against the removed FastAPI routes) - flagged in\nAGENTS.md, not touched here pending a decision on what to do with them.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"s