":"2026-10-08T13:40:39Z","email":"dineshmj@yahoo.com","name":"dineshmj"},"message":"6e-1 Audit (backend): new Audit Domain API with its Kafka consumer inside, recording every business event (onboarding, KYC stages, Compliance, Accounts, funds replies, payments) in an append-only, hash-chained trail in EwpAuditDb - identifiers and people only, plus each message''s SHA-256.\nTamper evidence: INSERT/SELECT-only database user, a trigger refusing UPDATE/DELETE/TRUNCATE, and scheduled chain verification on readiness and metrics. Group audit.trail-subscriber starts at the earliest offset, so the trail records Kafka''s history.\nEwpAuditDb.sql; ewp_audit_api user; Kafka user ewp-audit-api (read-only) and DLQ; solution and launch profile; docs.","tree":{"sha":"5ac939d4021999b96a96a51ef5222ebf399fc018","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dineshmj/EnterpriseWebPlatform_V3/git/trees/5ac939d4021999b96a96a51ef5222ebf399fc018"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dineshmj/EnterpriseWebPlatform_V3/git/commits/2540b0c98845750b97d9e58ed143268a3c2cd8af","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1352986?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dineshmj","id":1352986,"login":"dineshmj","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNTI5ODY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dineshmj/EnterpriseWebPlatform_V3/commit/2540b0c98845750b97d9e58ed143268a3c2cd8af","node_id":"C_kwDOUhalhNoAKDI1NDBiMGM5ODg0NTc1MGI5N2Q5ZTU4ZWQxNDMyNjhhM2MyY2Q4YWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dineshmj/EnterpriseWebPlatform_V3/commit/cf03add7200d300f47291e907012ca12a3f63810","sha":"cf03add7200d300f47291e907012ca12a3f63810","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dineshmj/EnterpriseWebPlatform_V3/commits/cf03add7200d300f47291e907012ca12a3f63810"}],"sha":"2540b0c98845750b97d9e58ed143268a3c2cd8af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dineshmj/EnterpriseWebPlatform_V3/commits/2540b0c98845750b97d9e58ed143268a3c2cd8af"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1352986?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dineshmj","id":1352986,"login":"dineshmj","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNTI5ODY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dineshmj/EnterpriseWebPlatform_V3/commits/cf03add7200d300f47291e907012ca12a3f63810/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T12:52:20Z","email":"dineshmj@yahoo.com","name":"dineshmj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T12:52:20Z","email":"dineshmj@yahoo.com","name":"dineshmj"},"message":"6d: structured logs and metrics on every .NET component. Serilog (service name and trace ID on every entry, one line per request with the caller, text in Development / JSON elsewhere, levels from Logging:LogLevel).\nPrometheus GET /metrics (workers on their health port; off outside Development unless enabled): HTTP, rate limiting, auth, Polly, Npgsql and runtime metrics, Kafka published / consumed by outcome, and every health check''s status and numbers. Logs and metrics also over OTLP when configured.\nShared in Common.Observability; docs (ReadMe 4h, Demoable 1.7.3, Blueprint).","tree":{"sha":"bfb6ae4319b0c7b442c87c7371045b87986b4415","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dineshmj/EnterpriseWebPlatform_V3/git/trees/bfb6ae4319b0c7b442c87c7371045b87986b4415"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dineshmj/EnterpriseWebPlatform_V3/git/commits/cf03add7200d300f47291e907012ca12a3f63810","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1352986?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dineshmj","id":1352986,"login":"dineshmj","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNTI5ODY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj","user_view_type":"public