tate: sessions and Data Protection keys (DPAPI-encrypted on Windows) of the Shell, CO, Compliance, Accounts and Payments BFFs live in PostgreSQL EwpBffStateDb, one schema and user per BFF; expired sessions cleaned up, so a restart signs nobody out. New db/EwpBffStateDb.sql and four BFF database users.\nDocs brought up to date: Payments saga and rate limiting in the Demoable features, Blueprint matrix/roadmap/landscape, root README, component READMEs and requirements, ReadMe.txt; two broken links fixed.","tree":{"sha":"da044b336ab98828768f40533e29b8b98b2122bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dineshmj/EnterpriseWebPlatform_V3/git/trees/da044b336ab98828768f40533e29b8b98b2122bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dineshmj/EnterpriseWebPlatform_V3/git/commits/b3712503806ec851694c384e6d5a4f58e2a03662","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1352986?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dineshmj","id":1352986,"login":"dineshmj","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNTI5ODY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dineshmj/EnterpriseWebPlatform_V3/commit/b3712503806ec851694c384e6d5a4f58e2a03662","node_id":"C_kwDOUhalhN