hmj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dineshmj/EnterpriseWebPlatform_V3/commits/02257bec88c07a59cd28ab794636eefdf2c58423/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T06:19:20Z","email":"dineshmj@yahoo.com","name":"dineshmj"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T06:19:20Z","email":"dineshmj@yahoo.com","name":"dineshmj"},"message":"Payments (5b-1): assisted-channel screens. Payments BFF (ASP.NET Core, Duende BFF) + MFE: New Payment (customer and paying account\nwith available funds, BSB lookup, Confirmation of Payee, review, one Idempotency-Key per form), status page with the live saga timeline,\npayments list. Accounts GET /v1/accounts/for-payment; Payments API policy / BSB / payee-confirmation endpoints; simulator BSB directory\nand CoP. Expired BFF session on an API call answers 401 (silent re-sign-in keeps the query). Menu: New Payment / View Payments for CSAs; export step 7; docs.","tree":{"sha":"722b1a3883b2c481aef6fe9ccf03093af6dd1b97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dineshmj/EnterpriseWebPlatform_V3/git/trees/722b1a3883b2c481aef6fe9ccf03093af6dd1b97"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dineshmj/EnterpriseWebPlatform_V3/git/commits/02257bec88c07a59cd28ab794636eefdf2c58423","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1352986?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dineshmj","id":1352986,"login":"dineshmj","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNTI