cations API (ASP.NET Core 10, EwpNotificationsDb, Inbox, rules: new work to staff:{role}:{branch}, outcomes to the initiator; SignalR hub; REST list/mark read) and NotificationsSubscriber (10 workflow topics, DLQ, starts at latest).\nShell BFF proxies /bff/notifications and /hubs/notifications with the user''s token (Origin check for the WebSocket); IDP resource, scopes and M2M client; Kafka user/ACLs; ewp_notifications_api.\nEvents add ApplicantName (KYC/Compliance created) and HolderName + decider LAN IDs (Accounts), additively. Docs: ReadMe, READMEs, event catalogue, Kafka README.","tree":{"sha":"419c29a52cad83dc22c3f6d39a7e8532703b7333","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dineshmj/EnterpriseWebPlatform_V3/git/trees/419c29a52cad83dc22c3f6d39a7e8532703b7333"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dineshmj/EnterpriseWebPlatform_V3/git/commits/f9ebfdf75a686114bcfd2d3bb852e49d89429f0e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1352986?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dineshmj","id":1352986,"login":"dineshmj","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNTI5ODY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dineshmj/EnterpriseWebP