omit, etpar, olben, jawil, ...) issued as the lan_id claim; sign-in names unchanged.\nEach context (CO, KYC, CMP, ACC) keeps a staff_members directory (subject ID -> LAN ID) filled from the officer''s token and from events; rules stay on subject IDs.\nEvents carry InitiatedByLanId and the deciders'' LAN IDs; officer screens show LAN IDs (or \"You\") instead of shortened GUIDs.\nDocs: IDP requirements, event catalogue, features 2.2.6.","tree":{"sha":"b21232310b9d8744dcc21efc4ae44eb02e7c8f83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dineshmj/EnterpriseWebPlatform_V3/git/trees/b21232310b9d8744dcc21efc4ae44eb02e7c8f83"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dineshmj/EnterpriseWebPlatform_V3/git/commits/7731dafe5e5f0ed4ce5b544021c6ee97efd7b239","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1352986?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dineshmj","id":1352986,"login":"dineshmj","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNTI5ODY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dineshmj/EnterpriseWebPlatform_V3/commit/7731dafe5e5f0ed4ce5b544021c6ee97efd7b239","node_id":"C_kwDOUhalhNoAKDc3MzFkYWZlNWU1ZjBlZDRjZTViNTQ0MDIxYzZlZTk3ZWZkN2IyMzk","parents":[