Failing/Down/Refusing) with background opening worker, retries and circuit breaker.\nSoD (not initiator, not CMP approver), branch scope, assignment and clearance enforced in the aggregate; CO records ACCOUNT_OPENING_IN_PROGRESS -> COMPLETED via account outcomes; Kafka users/topics/ACLs, IDP M2M client, ewp_accounts_api DB user; jack.accounts moved to SYD001.\nAccounts officer UI: ASP.NET Core 10 Accounts BFF (Duende BFF, server-side session, CSP) + Next.js MFE (work queue, application page with product choice, accounts, lifecycle); IDP MfeAccounts client rebuilt; CompileAndExport step 6.\nAll platform ports moved 443xx -> 463xx (VS 2026 reserves 44300-44399 via HTTP.sys); IIS Express profiles removed; docs, ReadMe, event catalogue and requirements updated.","tree":{"sha":"4b1e7d63c9c5f2e19e3f656b6758303f234ad25a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dineshmj/EnterpriseWebPlatform_V3/git/trees/4b1e7d63c9c5f2e19e3f656b6758303f234ad25a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dineshmj/EnterpriseWebPlatform_V3/git/commits/98b89e5a736159d3289b0d6a7091041adce5e914","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1352986?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dineshmj","id":1352986,"login":"dineshmj","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNTI5ODY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.githu