":"2026-10-05T10:08:34Z","email":"dineshmj@yahoo.com","name":"dineshmj"},"message":"Compensation (2c): CO records evidence document IDs at submission and publishes OnboardingApplicationRejected on KYC/CMP rejection (onboarding.application.rejected).\nDM''s first subscriber, DocumentInvalidationSubscriber: documents INVALIDATED (retained; delete refused), Inbox, branch-scoped, pinned M2M client.\nSenior compliance officer grace.compliance (clearance 5) in the IDP seed; Kafka user/topics/ACLs; docs (catalogue, requirements, saga plan, features 1.4.2), REJECTED wording fixed.\n\nCO number sequences: CACHE 1 (was CACHE 20), so pooled connections no longer reserve blocks of 20 numbers (CUST-100001 → 100021 jumps).\n\nSolution migrated to the XML format: EnterpriseWebPlatform.BSS.slnx (same 20 projects and folders), .sln removed.\nReadMe, Scan-Dependencies.ps1 and AddToSolution.ps1 point at the .slnx; ReadMe notes the IDE / SDK versions required.","tree":{"sha":"8b8223112a91c9ef25b9641e419c2a8aa6283798","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dineshmj/EnterpriseWebPlatform_V3/git/trees/8b8223112a91c9ef25b9641e419c2a8aa6283798"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dineshmj/EnterpriseWebPlatform_V3/git/commits/0df0accb5988f0a478d8d6965810f7391be3a513","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1352986?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dineshmj","id":1352986,"login":"dineshmj","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNTI5ODY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dineshmj/received_events","repo