 usuarios, roles, seguridad y acceso HTTP\n- El access token lleva sid (id de sesion) para enlazar peticiones con su sesion\n- Contrasena con mayuscula/minuscula/numero/simbolo, correo estricto, nombres y textos sin HTML\n- Cabeceras de seguridad y limite de tamano del cuerpo (413)\n- 304 pruebas (incluye contrato de la bitacora contra MongoDB real), cobertura ~99 %\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7b297c548b24535f92f212ec37881472bace6154","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/roxRam16/centynella-core/git/trees/7b297c548b24535f92f212ec37881472bace6154"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/roxRam16/centynella-core/git/commits/32c829011a499e1a37bf9650e6d685c0fe93aafb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124376023?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosariokromaduanal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosariokromaduanal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosariokromaduanal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosariokromaduanal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rosariokromaduanal","id":124376023,"login":"rosariokromaduanal","node_id":"U_kgDOB2nT1w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosariokromaduanal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosariokromaduanal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosariokromaduanal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosariokromaduanal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosariokromaduanal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosariokromaduanal","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/roxRam16/centynella-core/commit/32c829011a499e1a37bf9650e6d685c0fe93aafb","node_id":"C_k