rmisos\n\n- Registro, login, sesion persistente (access JWT + refresh rotativo en cookie HttpOnly), logout\n- Recuperacion de contrasena por correo (simulado) y cambio de contrasena autenticado\n- Perfil propio y administracion de usuarios (paginado, busqueda, filtros, CRUD)\n- Roles y permisos administrables; endpoints protegidos por permiso\n- Bloqueo por intentos fallidos, Argon2id, tokens guardados como hash\n- Patron Repository (interfaces + MongoDB + doble en memoria con pruebas de contrato)\n- Administrador inicial por entorno; login con Google preparado (501)\n- app.py pasa a factory (uvicorn app:create_app --factory); JWT_SECRET_KEY obligatoria\n- 194 pruebas, cobertura ~99 %\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3aa6f0c9568edbceb41bca049994283991d411a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/roxRam16/centynella-core/git/trees/3aa6f0c9568edbceb41bca049994283991d411a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/roxRam16/centynella-core/git/commits/5688d876495391d3fef1701e808483ce226f2f95","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124376023?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosariokromaduanal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosariokromaduanal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosariokromaduanal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosariokromaduanal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rosariokromaduanal","id":124376023,"login":"rosariokromaduanal","node_id":"U_kgDOB2nT1w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosariokromaduanal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosariokromaduanal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosariokromaduanal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosariokromaduanal