6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T03:50:13Z","email":"rosario.ramirez@kromaduanal.com","name":"rosariokromaduanal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T03:50:13Z","email":"rosario.ramirez@kromaduanal.com","name":"rosariokromaduanal"},"message":"feat: API base FastAPI con Swagger, health y MongoDB\n\n- Estructura modular config/database/dtos/middlewares/models/routes/services\n- API RESTful versionada /api/v1 con Swagger, ReDoc y OpenAPI\n- Endpoints /health (liveness), /health/ready (readiness) y /api/v1/greeting\n- Errores RFC 9457 (problem+json), X-Request-ID y CORS para el shell del MFE\n- Conexion a MongoDB con pymongo asincrono (local via docker compose)\n- Dockerfile (usuario no-root), docker-compose, workflow deploy.yml, README y CLAUDE.md\n- 30 pruebas unitarias + 1 de integracion (cobertura 99 %)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e91919a75b3acecb12e863a2b422980eacf5e989","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/roxRam16/centynella-core/git/trees/e91919a75b3acecb12e863a2b422980eacf5e989"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/roxRam16/centynella-core/git/commits/b0dc6c74f34b7ec23d2743ef64e246e5980b7096","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/124376023?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosariokromaduanal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosariokromaduanal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosariokromaduanal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosariokromaduanal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rosariokromaduanal","id":124376023,"login":"rosariokromaduanal","node_id":"U_kgDOB2nT1w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosariokromaduanal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rosariokromaduanal/received_eve