s\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQKF/OkzB\nQQsKx3Ng70tGdGI/gpN9Se6gy9JdeX9ljG05Dr6qWeBSbf7MtCQNkOzVh34GztokD0Uv4HrWpyPU\niw4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-20T08:15:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/commit/5b016df8080ff509af5b99a6504c7e2595f01802","node_id":"C_kwDOUh2LgdoAKDViMDE2ZGY4MDgwZmY1MDlhZjViOTlhNjUwNGM3ZTI1OTVmMDE4MDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/commit/f4d3d28be5e9354ba29675049c69bc09f88a23e1","sha":"f4d3d28be5e9354ba29675049c69bc09f88a23e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/commits/f4d3d28be5e9354ba29675049c69bc09f88a23e1"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/commit/247b2b7d29def3f932449697f52d53f2f5c9af65","sha":"247b2b7d29def3f932449697f52d53f2f5c9af65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/commits/247b2b7d29def3f932449697f52d53f2f5c9af65"}],"sha":"5b016df8080ff509af5b99a6504c7e2595f01802","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/commits/5b016df8080ff509af5b99a6504c7e2595f01802"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/commits/247b2b7d29def3f932449697f52d53f2f5c9af65/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T08:12:25Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T08:12:37Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Move the MFE cross-version knob from card padding to the banner''s corner\n\nThe theme audit (2f8b7b5) removed Tecton''s `--astryx-card-padding` override\non purpose — the component''s own default is already the design''s 16px — so\nthe built CSS no longer carries it and both version-B derivations failed with\n\"No stylesheet set --astryx-card-padding …\". `pnpm check:mfe` and\n`pnpm verify:registry` were red.\n\nSwitch the knob to a per-component decision the theme still makes: the corner\nit gives a `Banner` with `container=\"card\"`, which compiles to\n`--_banner-radius: var(--radius-element)` (4px) in the theme layer. Version B\nrewrites it to `var(--radius-page)` (16px). Both scripts read the declared\nvalue out of the built `tecton.css` rather than hard-coding it, and throw if\nthe declaration is gone.\n\nEach container now renders that banner and the assertions compare its computed\n`border-radius` on `.astryx-banner[data-container=\"card\"]` — the element the\ntheme''s rule targets — in place of the card''s padding. The meaning is\nunchanged: Tecton''s per-component decisions live in the theme layer beside its\ntokens, so the host''s single tokens.css decides them for every container, and\ntwo complete bundles resolve them by source order exactly as they resolve a\ntoken.\n\nMessages, comments and docs that described the old knob are updated.\n`packages/react/src/theme/**` is untouched.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JWM57sS5nw57y7RDQZBBhn","tree":{"sha":"0c13d4af3bc805b9f783343f295446c4bd2dd4b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/git/trees/0c13d4af3bc805b9f783343f295446c4bd2dd4b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/git/commits/247b2b7d29def3f932449697f52d53f2f5c9af65","verification":{"payload":"tree 0c13d4af3bc805b9f783343f295446c4bd2dd4b3\nparent f4d3d28be5e9354ba29675049c69bc09f88a23e1\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789891945 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789891957 +0000\n\nMove the MFE cross-version knob from card padding to the banner''s corner\n\nThe theme audit (2f8b7b5) removed Tecton''s `--astryx-card-padding` override\non purpose — the component''s own default is already the design''s 16px — so\nthe built CSS no longer carries it and both version-B derivations failed with\n\"No stylesheet set --astryx-card-padding …\". `pnpm check:mfe` and\n`pnpm verify:registry` were red.\n\nSwitch the knob to a per-component decision the theme still makes: the corner\nit gives a `Banner` with `container=\"card\"`, which compiles to\n`--_banner-radius: var(--radius-element)` (4px) in the theme layer. Version B\nrewrites it to `var(--radius-page)` (16px). Both scripts read the declared\nvalue out of the built `tecton.css` rather than hard-coding it, and throw if\nthe declaration is gone.\n\nEach container now renders that banner and the assertions compare its computed\n`border-radius` on `.astryx-banner[data-container=\"card\"]` — the element the\ntheme''s rule targets — in place of the card''s padding. The meaning is\nunchanged: Tecton''s per-component decisions live in the theme layer beside its\ntokens, so the host''s single tokens.css decides them for every container, and\ntwo complete bundles resolve them by source order exactly as they resolve a\ntoken.\n\nMessages, comments and docs that described the old knob are updated.\n`packages/react/src/theme/**` is untouched.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JWM57sS5nw57y7RDQZBBhn\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQMuyH5XI\nhQzt0mh+6FbwHzFdO+q8vpVcviTZlCfNZCK2YwnmDHrgABAEEePpZbeznLzDah2ttvfS9XwrbCRs\ngQg=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-20T08:15:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/commit/247b2b7d29def3f932449697f52d53f2f5c9af65","node_id":"C_kwDOUh2LgdoAKDI0N2IyYjdkMjlkZWYzZjkzMjQ0OTY5N2Y1MmQ1M2YyZjVjOWFmNjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/commit/f4d3d28be5e9354ba29675049c69bc09f88a23e1","sha":"f4d3d28be5e9354ba29675049c69bc09f88a23e1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/commits/f4d3d28be5e9354ba29675049c69bc09f88a23e1"}],"sha":"247b2b7d29def3f932449697f52d53f2f5c9af65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/commits/247b2b7d29def3f932449697f52d53f2f5c9af65"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/commits/f4d3d28be5e9354ba29675049c69bc09f88a23e1/comments","commit":{"a