pkapps/tecton-astryx/commits/4b58a29b457a6c1a310d05dcb7f1c34174fbf584/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T07:47:57Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T07:47:57Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Draw the gallery tile''s own frame\n\nThe tile took its surface from `--color-background-muted`, which the theme\naudit repointed at the table stripe. On the page background in dark mode that\nis effectively invisible, so a row of tiles read as previews floating in space.\nThe frame is the tile''s own now — a card surface and a one-pixel border — which\nis a tile in both modes whatever a surface token comes to mean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JWM57sS5nw57y7RDQZBBhn","tree":{"sha":"8278a4b8d23fa8eb78acc50dc8ed0a62be61c8a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/git/trees/8278a4b8d23fa8eb78acc50dc8ed0a62be61c8a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/git/commits/4b58a29b457a6c1a310d05dcb7f1c34174fbf584","verification":{"payload":"tree 8278a4b8d23fa8eb78acc50dc8ed0a62be61c8a8\nparent 0b1db6927b7754991e805f829d149745c0bfefdc\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789890477 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789890477 +0000\n\nDraw the gallery tile''s own frame\n\nThe tile took its surface from `--color-background-muted`, which the theme\naudit repointed at the table stripe. On the page background in dark mode that\nis effectively invisible, so a row of tiles read as previews floating in space.\nThe frame is the tile''s own now — a card surface and a one-pixel border — which\nis a tile in both modes whatever a surface token comes to mean.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JWM57sS5nw57y7RDQZBBhn\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNA