56719220def/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T07:05:52Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T07:05:52Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Keep the third-party notice with the port that writes it\n\nTHIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md is generated by the example port, so the paragraphs\nabout the template images and the ported page layout belong in its template\nrather than in the file. Hand-editing the file made `pnpm examples:check` fail,\nwhich is exactly what that check is for.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JWM57sS5nw57y7RDQZBBhn","tree":{"sha":"74ca133b062fe20c0e6a83019e7df4ecd9f19d76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/git/trees/74ca133b062fe20c0e6a83019e7df4ecd9f19d76"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/git/commits/d075fe1f9ef53126a0806dbc59fba56719220def","verification":{"payload":"tree 74ca133b062fe20c0e6a83019e7df4ecd9f19d76\nparent 7738b8ce212d89580680925c68ab8b403a76cf69\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789887952 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789887952 +0000\n\nKeep the third-party notice with the port that writes it\n\nTHIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md is generated by the example port, so the paragraphs\nabout the template images and the ported page layout belong in its template\nrather than in the file. Hand-editing the file made `pnpm examples:check` fail,\nwhich is exactly what that check is for.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JWM57sS5nw57y7RDQZBBhn\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQBB5vZdU\ntlDbs4zY3J4THA+ytS6TCtkd8SfDRB5foStaj5kjb1ihvbNuCGzlqBBmowhU3