e/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/commits/7738b8ce212d89580680925c68ab8b403a76cf69/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T06:53:01Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T06:53:01Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Document the site as it now is\n\n`docs-site.md` is rewritten end to end: where the component pages come from and\nhow their strings are rewritten, the order a component page reads in and what\nchanged from the port, how the synthetic sidebar folders work, which page\nrenders which example and why one directory needs an alias, the StyleX setup\nand the two non-obvious things about it, and what the guard and the two\nPlaywright suites each assert.\n\nThe README''s claim that `apps/docs` no longer depends on the library underneath\nTecton is now half wrong, so it says the true half: nothing on a page imports\nthat library, and the generator reads its doc objects.\n\n`pnpm setup`, `pnpm dev` and `pnpm check` are unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JWM57sS5nw57y7RDQZBBhn","tree":{"sha":"38e42c6088150750ea181607b2ee9b2d0f014260","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/git/trees/38e42c6088150750ea181607b2ee9b2d0f014260"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/git/commits/7738b8ce212d89580680925c68ab8b403a76cf69","verification":{"payload":"tree 38e42c6088150750ea181607b2ee9b2d0f014260\nparent 1e46478fd28fb79e6ce482fdebcf61db0830a734\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789887181 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789887181 +0000\n\nDocument the site as it now is\n\n`docs-site.md` is rewritten end to end: where the component pages come from and\nhow their strings are rewritten, the order a component page reads in and what\nchanged from the port, how the synthetic sidebar folders work, which page\nrenders which example and why one directory needs an alias, the StyleX setup\nand the two non-obvious things about it, and what the guard and the two\nPlaywright suites each assert.\n\nThe README''s claim that `apps/docs` no longer depends on the library underneath\nTecton is now half wrong, so it says the true half: nothing on a page imports\nthat library, and the generator reads its doc objects.\n\n`pnpm setup`, `pnpm dev` and `pnpm check` are unchanged.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JWM57sS5nw57y7RDQZBBhn\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQPq4Bk/i\nh32Bun9S2pl8vSmT3oIhC0sAexdTRhiC7VVfnFsTFAYKarcRweK09lm11Abwjtr4yvM8B6UvO0mK\npQY=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-20T07:50:27Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_t