:"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/git/trees/028abf14eb111666965b7257188f89937f712700"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/git/commits/698dd9a2e56c8ccfecfe2fe51f98b7e1733da7f3","verification":{"payload":"tree 028abf14eb111666965b7257188f89937f712700\nparent 119198c1a5a9b33fe1c05fc4583b4f25f35f932c\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789875360 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789875360 +0000\n\nMake the repo runnable in three commands: pnpm setup / pnpm dev / pnpm check, plus pnpm doctor\n\nQuick start at the top of the README, a doctor script that reports Node,\npnpm, CRLF checkouts, install state and whether the package is built, a\nbuild:package script, and no more agent files written by next dev.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JWM57sS5nw57y7RDQZBBhn\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQLrfruXQ\ndOqCBIAQ/u/4KCHy6erkiI/th8CX3OvMHnRAYTfnoRcUc/Oa8fwzapl8MFOAWgfTFNKAgoNLc/J4\nngQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-20T03:36:02Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/commit/698dd9a2e56c8ccfecfe2fe51f98b7e1733da7f3","node_id":"C_kwDOUh2LgdoAKDY5OGRkOWEyZTU2YzhjY2ZlY2ZlMmZlNTFmOThiN2UxNzMzZGE3ZjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/commit/119198c1a5a9b33fe1c05fc4583b4f25f35f932c","sha":"119198c1a5a9b33fe1c05fc4583b4f25f35f932c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/commits/119198c1a5a9b33fe1c05fc4583b4f25f35f932c"}],"sha":"698dd9a2e56c8ccfecfe2fe51f98b7e1733da7f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/commits/698dd9a2e56c8ccfecfe2fe51f98b7e1733da7f3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/commits/9e1a88f69fe4787d22616fc934296491169b9ce4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T03:31:04Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T03:31:04Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Port: reduce what the translation has to give up\n\nFour more rules, each of which turns a hard failure into either a working\nexample or a recorded loss:\n\n- the support table wins over the component table for a name in both, so\n  `useToast` stays the hook rather than becoming the Toast component;\n- orphaned constants are found through the syntax tree rather than by\n  matching text, so a name that only survives in a comment no longer keeps\n  a dead `stylex.create` alive, and unreferenced arrow functions go too;\n- an icon prop on a designed component that the port cannot reduce to a\n  glyph name is dropped and logged, rather than left as an element the\n  prop does not accept;\n- a header slot that held markup keeps its words: `<Text>Billing</Text>`\n  becomes `title=\"Billing\"`.\n\n504 files ported, 492 examples and 12 page templates. The log''s header now\ncounts what was refused before translation separately from what was removed\nafter it, and the mapping document says plainly why the templates fare worst.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JWM57sS5nw57y7RDQZBBhn","tree":{"sha":"8677e7f3e783bb0dd25c870ab2313188df5f46cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/git/trees/8677e7f3e783bb0dd25c870ab2313188df5f46cd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/git/commits/9e1a88f69fe4787d22616fc934296491169b9ce4","verification":{"payload":"tree 8677e7f3e783bb0dd25c870ab2313188df5f46cd\nparent df33088fdc0113faa8518443bfc394d78c983f4f\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789875064 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789875064 +0000\n\nPort: reduce what the translation has to give up\n\nFour more rules, each of which turns a hard failure into either a working\nexample or a recorded loss:\n\n- the support table wins over the component table for a name in both, so\n  `useToast` stays the hook rather than becoming the Toast component;\n- orphaned constants are found through the syntax tree rather than by\n  matching text, so a name that only survives in a comment no longer keeps\n  a dead `stylex.create` alive, and unreferenced arrow functions go too;\n- an icon prop on a designed component that the port cannot reduce to a\n  glyph name is dropped and logged, rather than left as an element the\n  prop does not accept;\n- a header slot that held markup keeps its words: `<Text>Billing</Text>`\n  becomes `title=\"Billing\"`.\n\n504 files ported, 492 examples and 12 page templates. The log''s header now\ncounts what was refused before translation separately from what was removed\nafter it, and the mapping document says plainly why the templates fare worst.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JWM57sS5nw57y7RDQZBBhn\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQL3cBoWp\n2aEL2sT+Cds3ytSmn4AXKetx1+jVTJShkoZ8/fQdOQD9txMOg1gGRkR2lDJT2+paHDexbdwUB0Od\nZgs=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-20T03:53:50Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/commit/9e1a88f69fe4787d22616fc934296491169b9ce4","node_id":"C_kwDOUh2LgdoAKDllMWE4OGY2OWZlNDc4N2QyMjYxNmZjOTM0Mjk2NDkxMTY5YjljZTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/commit/df33088fdc0113faa8518443bfc394d78c983f4f","sha":"df33088fdc0113faa8518443bfc394d78c983f4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/commits/df33088fdc0113faa8518443bfc394d78c983f4f"}],"sha":"9e1a88f69fe4787d22616fc934296491169b9ce4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/commits/9e1a88f69fe4787d22616fc934296491169b9ce4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/commits/119198c1a5a9b33fe1c05fc4583b4f25f35f932c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T03:29:08Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T03:29:08Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Fix Windows (CRLF) checkouts: normalise line endings in the docs generator and drift checks, pin LF via .gitattributes\n\nThe docs example rewriter matched import lines only with LF endings, so a\ncheckout with core.autocrlf left the relative import in place and the build\nfailed with ''still has a relative import after rewriting''.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JWM57sS5nw57y7RDQZBBhn","tree":{"sha":"ee8e100e64b8d5461cb657185bdd555aaed8b974","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/git/trees/ee8e100e64b8d5461cb657185bdd555aaed8b974"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/git/commits/119198c1a5a9b33fe1c05fc4583b4f25f35f932c","verification":{"payload":"tree ee8e100e64b8d5461cb657185bdd555aaed8b974\nparent b6b2da6bcf7deada4d135673e9e0d2a2a1be04f9\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789874948 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789874948 +0000\n\nFix Windows (CRLF) checkouts: normalise line endings in the docs generator and drift checks, pin LF via .gitattributes\n\nThe docs example rewriter matched import lines only with LF endings, so a\ncheckout with core.autocrlf left the relative import in place and the build\nfailed with ''still has a relative import after rewriting''.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JWM57sS5nw57y7RDQZBBhn\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQFWBQP8W\nHVfTR2i5aSlaWlwiBs9gI6Y9wX+g4f9+dsQay1n47V5isB4GEguzCe6YhEUq5yPcNExE4CES4ypE\nCQ0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-20T03:29:11Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/commit/119198c1a5a9b33fe1c05fc4583b4f25f35f932c","node_id":"C_kwDOUh2LgdoAKDExOTE5OGMxYTVhOWIzM2ZlMWMwNWZjNDU4M2I0ZjI1ZjM1ZjkzMmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/commit/b6b2da6bcf7deada4d135673e9e0d2a2a1be04f9","sha":"b6b2da6bcf7deada4d135673e9e0d2a2a1be04f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/commits/b6b2da6bcf7deada4d135673e9e0d2a2a1be04f9"}],"sha":"119198c1a5a9b33fe1c05fc4583b4f25f35f932c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/commits/119198c1a5a9b33fe1c05fc4583b4f25f35f932c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/commits/df33088fdc0113faa8518443bfc394d78c983f4f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T03:23:04Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T03:23:04Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Document the surface: mapping table, README list, changelog\n\n- docs/engineering/component-mapping.md gains the whole 180-component table\n  (upstream name, Tecton name, designed or generated, category, example\n  count), generated into a marked region by the wrapper generator so it\n  cannot drift from the manifest it describes; plus the sections on the five\n  names that had to bend around the designed surface, and on what the example\n  port cannot carry across and why.\n- packages/react/README.md''s component list is now generated from the\n  components'' own documentation by scripts/generate-readme.mjs, with a\n  --check mode in the package build (step 0d) and in `pnpm check`.\n- A changelog for the package.\n- The port''s provenance marker moved from a field on each example''s doc to a\n  comment above it: provenance is not part of what an example is, and the\n  documentation site reads those files into a typed registry.\n- apps/docs: the data generator skips the new page-template docs, which are\n  not components. One filter, with a note about where they belong when the\n  site grows a templates gallery.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JWM57sS5nw57y7RDQZBBhn","tree":{"sha":"65cdbca55f4b8ebe6b4fd41d41be6da17b2f89c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/git/trees/65cdbca55f4b8ebe6b4fd41d41be6da17b2f89c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/git/commits/df33088fdc0113faa8518443bfc394d78c983f4f","verification":{"payload":"tree 65cdbca55f4b8ebe6b4fd41d41be6da17b2f89c0\nparent f2ad2971a59f8f68b71e2642d64f375385869255\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789874584 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789874584 +0000\n\nDocument the surface: mapping table, README list, changelog\n\n- docs/engineering/component-mapping.md gains the whole 180-component table\n  (upstream name, Tecton name, designed or generated, category, example\n  count), generated into a marked region by the wrapper generator so it\n  cannot drift from the manifest it describes; plus the sections on the five\n  names that had to bend around the designed surface, and on what the example\n  port cannot carry across and why.\n- packages/react/README.md''s component list is now generated from the\n  components'' own documentation by scripts/generate-readme.mjs, with a\n  --check mode in the package build (step 0d) and in `pnpm check`.\n- A changelog for the package.\n- The port''s provenance marker moved from a field on each example''s doc to a\n  comment above it: provenance is not part of what an example is, and the\n  documentation site reads those files into a typed registry.\n- apps/docs: the data generator skips the new page-template docs, which are\n  not components. One filter, with a note about where they belong when the\n  site grows a templates gallery.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JWM57sS5nw57y7RDQZBBhn\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAAB