"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/commits/83e8157194ac060ce40974d30ea16ef2c5e6c38f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T01:22:12Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T01:22:12Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Merge Phase 3 wrapper-side multi-version mitigations\n\nRef-counted root ownership registry, TectonProvider scope and\nconfigureTectonRoot, theme token-coverage manifest, split stylesheet entry\npoints (tokens.css, components.css, no-reset variants), the micro-frontend\nharness as a fixture with Playwright assertions, and the consumer guide.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JWM57sS5nw57y7RDQZBBhn","tree":{"sha":"3170561b302c73c89aceabb7af3d52ea53c66d54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/git/trees/3170561b302c73c89aceabb7af3d52ea53c66d54"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/git/commits/83e8157194ac060ce40974d30ea16ef2c5e6c38f","verification":{"payload":"tree 3170561b302c73c89aceabb7af3d52ea53c66d54\nparent 8edd6b195813bd3d86e4bd8194f91c03ac6d93ea\nparent a46eb1f437b56e6b55e31e91afa1e010196355fd\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789867332 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789867332 +0000\n\nMerge Phase 3 wrapper-side multi-version mitigations\n\nRef-counted root ownership registry, TectonProvider scope and\nconfigureTectonRoot, theme token-coverage manifest, split stylesheet entry\npoints (tokens.css, components.css, no-reset variants), the micro-frontend\nharness as a fixture with Playwright assertions, and the consumer guide.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JWM57sS5nw57y7RDQZBBhn\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQCPcYwxj\nW0mS2vNfoQcSwX6lLq1KfwpVWmBYH3CGgu6bSrudKwmsMNh4T8+LEuCXLkjgDo2Uo3CMWNIJhyL6\nvgw=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-20T01:22:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/commit/83e8157194ac060ce409