n- 192 tests asserting resolved tokens against the transcribed design,\n  contrast in both modes, and the built theme artefacts\n- temporary /preview/theme gallery in the docs app plus a Playwright capture\n  script; captures and the fidelity report under docs/design/\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JWM57sS5nw57y7RDQZBBhn","tree":{"sha":"0cb04e8ff8ff3118bca2007e9c8b6d717fcc5d01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/git/trees/0cb04e8ff8ff3118bca2007e9c8b6d717fcc5d01"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rpkapps/tecton-astryx/git/commits/2811c87637812139159eea451e825e3bd6a3b3f7","verification":{"payload":"tree 0cb04e8ff8ff3118bca2007e9c8b6d717fcc5d01\nparent f11e7de11d333450fb6fe6a6934dbdc1638ff544\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789862580 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1789862580 +0000\n\nPhase 1: Tecton palette and theme on the upstream theme system, with fidelity report\n\n- generate-palette.mjs turns tokens/tecton.tokens.json into a typed palette\n  module (drift-checked in build and pnpm check)\n- tectonTheme: 193 token overrides, 33 theme-local tokens, 65 component\n  targets, 4 custom variants, 8 custom Text types; every colour traces to a\n  source token; light mode derived by the documented same-stop rule\n- tecton semantic token map exported from @tecton/react/theme\n- 192 tests asserting resolved tokens against the transcribed design,\n  contrast in both modes, and the built theme artefacts\n- temporary /preview/theme gallery in the docs app plus a Playwright capture\n  script; captures and the fidelity report under docs/design/\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JWM57sS5nw57y7RDQZBBhn\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1M