s","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoanCR1221/Proyect_Typing_Battle/commits/f8cc52c7250f3fe5d6feeeb363979d46851f4ebe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T04:47:59Z","email":"162819627+JoanCR1221@users.noreply.github.com","name":"JoanCR1221"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T04:47:59Z","email":"162819627+JoanCR1221@users.noreply.github.com","name":"JoanCR1221"},"message":"feat(ui): agregar los estilos, los formatos y el estado de cada carácter\n\n- typing.css: identidad visual con variables CSS bajo .tb-app y prefijo tb- en\n  todas las clases, para no chocar con los estilos del Shell. Tema claro, verde\n  azulado profundo, contraste de texto de al menos 4,5:1, foco visible, números\n  tabulares y sin movimiento con prefers-reduced-motion\n- format.ts: números, porcentajes, fechas en hora local y ordinales en español\n- typing-chars.ts: calcula si cada carácter del texto está bien, mal, es el actual\n  o está pendiente, reutilizando los mismos objetos para repintar solo lo que cambió\n- Pruebas de los formatos y de los estados de carácter\n\nImplementa 03-contratos-tecnicos.md (contrato visual del microfrontend).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d69065f367110c1c1c24952f7eb6934040ede68a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoanCR1221/Proyect_Typing_Battle/git/trees/d69065f367110c1c1c24952f7eb6934040ede68a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoanCR1221/Proyect_Typing_Battle/git/commits/f8cc52c7250f3fe5d6feeeb363979d46851f4ebe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://av