b.com/JoanCR1221","id":162819627,"login":"JoanCR1221","node_id":"U_kgDOCbRuKw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoanCR1221/Proyect_Typing_Battle/commits/598f553cfbca0fa8685e8c7eb648a3dbb4387162/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T04:25:47Z","email":"162819627+JoanCR1221@users.noreply.github.com","name":"JoanCR1221"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T04:25:47Z","email":"162819627+JoanCR1221@users.noreply.github.com","name":"JoanCR1221"},"message":"feat(frontend): agregar el modo standalone y un Shell simulado\n\n- Modo standalone (npm start, puerto 4004): la aplicación hace de Shell con un\n  contexto falso y botones initialize/start/pause/dispose para probar el ciclo de\n  vida; el área del juego tiene las medidas del contrato visual\n- Parámetros ?match=&user=&name= para simular varios jugadores en pestañas\n- Shell simulado (npm run start:shell, puerto 4010) que carga el remote por Module\n  Federation con au-compose: valida que Aurelia se comparta como singleton sin\n  esperar al Shell real\n\nImplementa 03-contratos-tecnicos.md (contrato visual del microfrontend).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"24615e0587fcbf6080acaeebc2559665bcac95d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoanCR1221/Proyect_Typing_Battle/git/trees/24615e0587fcbf6080acaeebc2559665bcac95d8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoanCR1221/Proyect_Typing_Battle/git/commits/598f553cfbca0fa8685e8c7eb648a3dbb4387162","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"u