"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JoanCR1221","id":162819627,"login":"JoanCR1221","node_id":"U_kgDOCbRuKw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoanCR1221/Proyect_Typing_Battle/commits/65784d6a9d2c6c123ea21ed7b7c46167714fbcc3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T04:25:45Z","email":"162819627+JoanCR1221@users.noreply.github.com","name":"JoanCR1221"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T04:25:45Z","email":"162819627+JoanCR1221@users.noreply.github.com","name":"JoanCR1221"},"message":"feat(frontend): exponer GameModule y GameView por Module Federation\n\n- El remote «typingGame» expone ./GameModule (clase que implementa GameModule) y\n  ./GameView (elemento <typing-game module.bind=\"...\">), porque la interfaz del\n  contrato no recibe un contenedor DOM y el Shell necesita dibujar la vista\n- Vista mínima que muestra el estado y permite jugar; la interfaz definitiva\n  reemplaza su plantilla\n- Prueba de la vista renderizada con Aurelia sobre un módulo real\n\nImplementa 02-arquitectura-y-flujo.md (microfrontend cargado por Module Federation).\nVer duda 2 en docs/contratos-pendientes.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3fe2d20f91dd2bc8df2f1426d00da01f591caddc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoanCR1221/Proyect_Typing_Battle/git/trees/3fe2d20f91dd2bc8df2f1426d00da01f591caddc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoanCR1221/Proyect_Typing_Battle/git/commits/65