url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JoanCR1221","id":162819627,"login":"JoanCR1221","node_id":"U_kgDOCbRuKw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoanCR1221/Proyect_Typing_Battle/commits/47a235bc113cecc99d07c969093d049c1b0bef5a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T04:25:22Z","email":"162819627+JoanCR1221@users.noreply.github.com","name":"JoanCR1221"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T04:25:22Z","email":"162819627+JoanCR1221@users.noreply.github.com","name":"JoanCR1221"},"message":"feat(frontend): implementar GameModule y el controlador de la partida\n\n- TypingGameModule cumple el ciclo de vida del contrato: initialize prepara sin\n  conectar, start conecta y entra a la sala (o reanuda tras pause), pause detiene\n  la entrada local, dispose sale de la sala y libera todo\n- GameController mantiene el estado que la interfaz muestra (fase, jugadores,\n  texto, temporizadores con la hora del servidor, clasificación), envía lo que se\n  escribe sin acumular envíos y vuelve a entrar a la sala al reconectar\n- Los errores técnicos se traducen a mensajes para el jugador\n- Pruebas con reloj falso\n\nImplementa 03-contratos-tecnicos.md (sección 6: ciclo de vida del microfrontend).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ec0b9457d1dbd9b44058ea1e698ea982607f8b3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repo