 en segundo plano\n- Pruebas de integración con SignalR real: partida completa de dos jugadores\n  (resultado guardado, historial y aviso), fin por tiempo, jugador desconectado,\n  entrada a mitad de carrera y autenticación del hub con JWT\n\nImplementa 03-contratos-tecnicos.md (hub propio /hubs/typing).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5bdf7239c2eb1fceca12f5724ce7e824a7996e09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoanCR1221/Proyect_Typing_Battle/git/trees/5bdf7239c2eb1fceca12f5724ce7e824a7996e09"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoanCR1221/Proyect_Typing_Battle/git/commits/6753750eae5fb629c0a73d722fa46c930719102a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162819627?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JoanCR1221","id":162819627,"login":"JoanCR1221","node_id":"U_kgDOCbRuKw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JoanCR1221/Proyect_Typing_Battle/commit/6753750eae5fb629c0a73d722fa46c930719102a","node_id":"C_kwDOUh9N_9oAKDY3NTM3NTBlYWU1ZmI2MjljMGE3M2Q3MjJmYTQ2YzkzMDcxOTEwMmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JoanCR1221/Proyect_Typin