  URL no esté configurada\n- Nunca lanza: un Matchmaking caído o lento no debe afectar la partida\n- La ruta es una suposición configurable: el contrato todavía no define cómo un\n  juego avisa el fin de partida (duda 1 en docs/contratos-pendientes.md)\n\nImplementa 04-persistencia-y-api-juegos.md (relación con Matchmaking).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9237e14631cbbbae4bcae02b5365bb59a58e5c6b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoanCR1221/Proyect_Typing_Battle/git/trees/9237e14631cbbbae4bcae02b5365bb59a58e5c6b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoanCR1221/Proyect_Typing_Battle/git/commits/6cdf662cd4e7424682652df9a615d4f64fa3c571","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162819627?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JoanCR1221","id":162819627,"login":"JoanCR1221","node_id":"U_kgDOCbRuKw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JoanCR1221/Proyect_Typing_Battle/commit/6cdf662cd4e7424682652df9a615d4f64fa3c571","node_id":"C_kwDOUh9N_9oAKDZjZGY2NjJjZDRlNzQyNDY4MjY1MmRmOWE2MTVkNGY2NGZhM2M1NzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JoanCR1221/Proyect_Typing_Battle/commit/f40a9c8ee1ef0f71ec7f841ed9f244bced399fe5","sha":"f40a9c8ee1ef0f71ec7f841ed9f244bced399fe5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoanCR1221/Proyect_Typing_Battle/commits/f40a9c8ee1ef0f71ec7f841ed9f244bced399fe5"}],"sha":"6cdf662cd4e7424682652df9a615d4f64fa3c571","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoanCR1221/Proyect_Typing_Battle/commits/6cdf662cd4e7424682652df9a615d4f64fa3c571"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162819627?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JoanCR1221","id":162819627,"login":"JoanCR1221","node_id":"U_kgDOCbRuKw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoanCR1221/Proyect_Typing_Battle/commits/f40a9c8ee1ef0f71ec7f841ed9f244bced399fe5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T03:58:44Z","email":"162819627+JoanCR1221@users.noreply.github.com","name":"JoanCR1221"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T03:58:44Z","email":"162819627+JoanCR1221@users.noreply.github.com","name":"JoanCR1221"},"message":"feat(game): agregar la lógica de la partida: textos, puntaje y sala\n\n- GameRoom: máquina de estados sin SignalR (espera, cuenta regresiva, carrera y\n  fin) que usa TimeProvider y devuelve los eventos a difundir\n- Gana el primero en escribir el texto completo; si se acaba el tiempo, quien\n  llegó más lejos. Un jugador desconectado no retrasa el final\n- El servidor calcula avance, WPM, precisión y puntaje (TypingScorer) y descarta\n  progreso más rápido de lo que una persona puede teclear\n- 20 textos en español y armado del resultado con el metadata de Typing Battle\n- Pruebas unitarias con reloj falso (FakeTimeProvider)\n\nImplementa 03-contratos-tecnicos.md (mecánica propia del hub) y\n04-persistencia-y-api-juegos.md (metadata con WPM y precisión).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c3918be004b2d2ed98cbba4d934eeb1c3e0787e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoanCR1221/Proyect_Typing_Battle/git/trees/c3918be004b2d2ed98cbba4d934eeb1c3e0787e2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoanCR1221/Proyect_Typing_Battle/git/commits/f40a9c8ee1ef0f71ec7f841ed9f244bced399fe5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162819627?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JoanCR1221","id":162819627,"login":"JoanCR1221","node_id":"U_kgDOCbRuKw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url