"JoanCR1221"},"message":"feat(auth): validar JWT de Auth0 en la API y agregar el modo de desarrollo\n\n- Auth:Mode=Auth0 valida los JWT del tenant (Auth:Domain y Auth:Audience); el\n  id del jugador es el claim sub. En rutas /hubs el token puede venir en\n  ?access_token=, porque un WebSocket del navegador no envía encabezados\n- Auth:Mode=Development permite trabajar sin Auth0 (encabezado X-Dev-User o\n  dev_user en la URL) y la API se niega a arrancar con él fuera de Development\n  y Testing\n- Los endpoints de resultados exigen usuario autenticado; /health sigue público\n- Pruebas: JWT firmados de verdad (válido, vencido, otra audience, otra clave) y\n  comprobación de que el usuario de desarrollo se ignora en modo Auth0\n\nImplementa 03-contratos-tecnicos.md (Auth0/JWT como proveedor de identidad).\nVer duda 3 en docs/contratos-pendientes.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9e62eb6565fc3e6910c0a80003805f956c733779","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoanCR1221/Proyect_Typing_Battle/git/trees/9e62eb6565fc3e6910c0a80003805f956c733779"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoanCR1221/Proyect_Typing_Battle/git/commits/eeefda5a9b878100cfcedfe5324faa258d319e33","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162819627?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JoanCR1221","id":162819627,"login":"JoanCR1221","node_id":"U_kgDOCbRuKw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.