9 si la partida ya existe), consultar, historial\n  y estadísticas\n- Pruebas unitarias del validador, de la extracción de metadata y de UtcDate\n\nImplementa 04-persistencia-y-api-juegos.md (qué debe persistir cada juego).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"77002cd88328b476fe0278f639082d0739f31907","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoanCR1221/Proyect_Typing_Battle/git/trees/77002cd88328b476fe0278f639082d0739f31907"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoanCR1221/Proyect_Typing_Battle/git/commits/fed654656c8957bb22bad2dae8308ad750a7b1d0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162819627?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JoanCR1221","id":162819627,"login":"JoanCR1221","node_id":"U_kgDOCbRuKw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JoanCR1221/Proyect_Typing_Battle/commit/fed654656c8957bb22bad2dae8308ad750a7b1d0","node_id":"C_kwDOUh9N_9oAKGZlZDY1NDY1NmM4OTU3YmIyMmJhZDJkYWU4MzA4YWQ3NTBhN2IxZDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/JoanCR1221/Proyect_Typing_Battle/commit/acf75fcd3e0f4e1b4a6ad50a1724e94d512e8cfe","sha":"acf75fcd3e0f4e1b4