nd (Aurelia);\n  cada job se omite con advertencia mientras su proyecto no exista\n- Plantilla de Pull Request con el checklist del contrato\n- Carpetas src/backend, src/frontend, tests/backend y tests/frontend\n- Borradores en docs/: dudas hacia battlehub-contracts y ADR del motor de BD\n\nImplementa 01-gobernanza-repositorios.md (estructura mínima y .gitignore)\ny 05-cicd-testing-commits.md (CI y checklist de PR).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3aa882915b21134d3c826014f9e3e2a1db66494b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoanCR1221/Proyect_Typing_Battle/git/trees/3aa882915b21134d3c826014f9e3e2a1db66494b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JoanCR1221/Proyect_Typing_Battle/git/commits/5c910c2af5d6f32406b8d2e345c469c5beaf45c6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162819627?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/JoanCR1221","id":162819627,"login":"JoanCR1221","node_id":"U_kgDOCbRuKw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/JoanCR1221","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/JoanCR1221/Proyect_Typing_Battle/commit/5c910c2af5d6f32406b8d2e345c469c5beaf45c6","node_id":"C_kwDOUh9N_9oAKDVjOTEwYz