","name":"conversun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T03:23:52Z","email":"conversun@users.noreply.github.com","name":"conversun"},"message":"1.21.1: 下载后台任务化+暂停/继续(断点续传)+顶部通知栏4s自动收起\n\n- 「下载 fpk」解耦到服务端后台任务：关闭应用/详情页下载不中断，进度可轮询/重开看到\n- 设置页 FPK 下载列表新增后台下载区：下载中显示进度+「暂停」按钮(与安装同款)，\n  已暂停显示「继续」按钮(.part Range 断点续传)\n- 详情页「下载 fpk」按钮三态联动：下载 fpk / 暂停(带进度填充) / 继续\n- 后台任务通知栏从底部移到顶部居中，出现 4 秒后自动收起(完成绿✓/失败红✗)\n- 新增接口 /api/apps/{appname}/task/pause、/task/resume\n- 修复任务系统自死锁：handleGetTask 持 t.mu 又调 IsFinished 再锁(非重入锁)\n- 修复重启后通知栏永久刷旧任务：load() 恢复终态任务时未置 finished 标志\n- 全量 go test -race 绿(含 3 个新回归测试)；测试机 e2e 暂停/继续/完成全链路通","tree":{"sha":"9e173b54d44e665c0fcdffcd057e8040cefaf5c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/git/trees/9e173b54d44e665c0fcdffcd057e8040cefaf5c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/git/commits/4a0389a84350f2af9fc9106c2b4630b5de0fd6ca","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22893221?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/conversun","id":22893221,"login":"conversun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyODkzMjIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Bl