浏览器缓存 + 图标磁盘缓存/预热(iconwarm.go)\n- 设置页加速源健康/已下载FPK/高级/应用源自动监测 4 区默认折叠\n- 修复: SourceManager.persistListSettings 漏传 panel 字段 → handlePutSettings\n  全量重建把官方应用中心账号抹零、355 官方应用消失; 现补回传 panel 三字段\n- 回退: 外部社区源默认不载入开关 + 内置图标最优加速源(按用户要求恢复到 1.20.17 行为)","tree":{"sha":"f1706c9fdf48a23e0d10dd4b5edddeb011c2d48e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/git/trees/f1706c9fdf48a23e0d10dd4b5edddeb011c2d48e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/git/commits/3c182c103442503b456dba2de6b2b16cfa93860f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59500523?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blue-Mink/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blue-Mink/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blue-Mink/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blue-Mink/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Blue-Mink","id":59500523,"login":"Blue-Mink","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5NTAwNTIz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blue-Mink/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blue-Mink/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blue-Mink/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blue-Mink/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blue-Mink/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blue-Mink","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Blue-Mink/New-Store/commit/3c182c103442503b456dba2de6b2b16cfa93860f","node_id":"C_kwDOUh-77doAKDNjMTgyYzEwMzQ0MjUwM2I0NTZkYmEyZGU2YjJiMTZjZmE5Mzg2MGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Blue-Mink/New-Store/commit/e6d507989041c2e3296f6d86ee7cf810e194fc60","sha":"e6d507989041c2e3296f6d86ee7cf810e194fc60","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/commits/e6d50798904