om","name":"conversun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T11:12:39Z","email":"conversun@users.noreply.github.com","name":"conversun"},"message":"v1.20.1 官方应用详情页补全 + 主题过渡 + 移动端 WebView 适配\n\n- 官方应用详情打开时惰性拉面板详情补全：描述（HTML 白名单清洗后富文本渲染）、\n  预览截图（appDetail.poster CDN 直链，接入现有轮播+灯箱）、发布者、\n  安装包大小、系统最低版本；无截图的应用不显示预览区\n- 详情页新增下载次数行（全应用）；官方应用隐藏「下载 fpk」（无 FPK 直链）、\n  隐藏空值的「最近更新」行\n- 官方源平台从图标 URL 推断（-x86-/-arm64-/-all-）\n- 主题切换加 250ms 颜色过渡（html.theme-transition 临时类，320ms 后摘除）\n- 移动端 WebView 适配（飞牛 app 内嵌）：全局 touch-action: manipulation\n  去掉双击缩放等待（首击延迟/被吞的常见根因）、tap-highlight 透明、\n  顶栏/详情页叠 safe-area-inset-top、高度单位 h-screen→h-dvh\n- 面板客户端 PanelAppDetail 增加 poster 字段","tree":{"sha":"f0ab03911dc4729d37ae7b98c41cb3552df14471","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/git/trees/f0ab03911dc4729d37ae7b98c41cb3552df14471"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/git/commits/c724533c44442e43a9e220fca6a5fcd2dfbcb70a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22893221?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/conversun","id":22893221,"login":"conversun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyODkzMjIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun","user_view_