弹窗\n\n- internal/panel: 面板客户端（WS user.login→ticket→ost cookie），app/list、\n  app/detail、download/task+status、install/task+status 全契约（抓包逆向）\n- internal/source/official: fnos-official 内置源，355 官方目录并入注册表\n- internal/api/panel_install: panel-detail（依赖+同名应用）+ 官方安装管道\n  （依赖顺序安装/跳过，SSE 复用标准 step 词汇）+ 登录测试（支持表单 ad-hoc 值）\n- settings: 面板账号配置（密码不回传/显式清除）+ 变更即重建客户端+刷新注册表\n- 注册表: 官方源先于外部源抓取（跨源去重官方优先）；sourceStatus 改为\n  并入而非整 map 覆盖（修官方源状态被清空的 bug）\n- 前端: PanelInstallDialog（依赖状态+已安装同名应用可选跳过）、设置页\n  官方应用中心卡片（开关/账号/密码/地址/测试登录）\n- 折叠排序: fnos-official 提升为最高优先级（sourceRank=0），同名应用以\n  官方条目为卡（45 个与内置目录重复的应用改由官方通道安装）\n- 官方应用更新暂不支持（明确提示去官方应用中心内更新）\n- 附带: releases/ 移出版本库（.gitignore）、问题反馈链接改 New-Store 仓库","tree":{"sha":"8dcb87f6ef5830fbf6008e95df61c5ed50bfd9c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/git/trees/8dcb87f6ef5830fbf6008e95df61c5ed50bfd9c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/git/commits/736233e53c7dedd1206eb657c2637b9daec8b293","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22893221?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/conversun","id":22893221,"login":"conversun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyODkzMjIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun