本 + 自更新版本门槛\n\n根因：conversun/fnos-apps 内置目录 apps.json 收录了商店自身旧版\nfnos-apps-store 1.9.5；Registry.Get 精确键命中优先返回内置旧条目，\nstore-update 把 1.9.5 当最新（has_update 恒 false），手动 update\n会直接拉 1.9.5 降级安装（2026-09-18 测试机 1.19.4→1.9.5 实锤）。\n\n- core.Registry.GetBest：跨所有源取同名条目中版本最高者（平局外部源优先）\n- store-update GET/POST 与 handleUpdate 的自更新分支改走 GetBest\n- pipeline.runSelfUpdate 加版本门槛：可用版本必须严格高于已装版本，\n  否则拒绝（最后防线，杜绝任何来源的降级）\n- 3 个新单测（最高版本/平局外源优先/空版本不胜出）全绿","tree":{"sha":"897e661af34438fb4373719b3befdc0005f61fba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/git/trees/897e661af34438fb4373719b3befdc0005f61fba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/git/commits/9e5e6fb425e042333f425c7c992791016aa0eb28","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22893221?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/conversun","id":22893221,"login":"conversun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyODkzMjIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Blue-Mink/New-Store/commit/9e5e6fb425e042333f425c7c992791016aa0eb28","node_id":"C_kwDOUh-77doAKDllNWU2ZmI0MjVlMDQyMzMzZjQyNWM3Yzk5Mjc5MTAxNmFhMGViMjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/