daemon 全通道对齐\n\n- 排序: alphaInitial 按名字首字符判定（字母/数字优先字母/汉字拼音），\n  修复「网易云API」被排进 A 区等误排（原实现全文找第一个字母）\n- UI: 排序下拉从 pill 行末尾/桌面 header 移入「全部」pill 内（▾ 展开），\n  桌面/移动统一；菜单覆盖层 z-index 修正保证 pill 可点击收起\n- 后端: List() 优先 daemon /rpc/v1/app/installed（GET，权威状态含\n  starting/stopping/nostart + 每应用 control 能力位），CLI 表格解析降级为回退\n- 启停: StartConfirmed/StopConfirmed = start|stop/check → start|stop/task →\n  轮询 common/status 确认（官方应用中心同一套实现），替代 fire-and-forget CLI；\n  停用前校验依赖应用；操作后立即刷新运行时状态缓存\n- API: 同名多源应用折叠为一张卡（修复已安装计数虚高 30→27，\n  easytier 等重复卡），新增 start_stop/uninstallable 能力位字段\n- 前端: nostart 系统组件隐藏启停按钮，starting/stopping 显示转圈，\n  卸载按钮按 uninstallable 控制\n- version 1.14.0","tree":{"sha":"61ea2a35b4a5744a82571420ce2cff12e6b6ad73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/git/trees/61ea2a35b4a5744a82571420ce2cff12e6b6ad73"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/git/commits/bd80c4e17dcfd7f51f3aaacab6cffd1781df9a8d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/Blue-Mink/New-Store/commit/bd80c4e17dcfd7f51f3aaacab6cffd1781df9a8d","node_id":"C_kwDOUh-77doAKGJkODBjNGUxN2RjZmQ3ZjUxZjNhYWFjYWI2Y2ZmZDE3ODFkZjlhOGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Blue-Mink/New-Store/commit/e8083b93fd7ad8f13944cdb55a6ed0eb9ba2e14c","sha":"e8083b93fd7ad8f13944cdb55a6ed0eb9ba2e14c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/commits/e8083b93fd7ad8f13944cdb55a6ed0eb9ba2e14c"}],"sha":"bd80c4e17dcfd7f51f3aaacab6cffd1781df9a8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/commits/bd80c4e17dcfd7f51f3aaacab6cffd1781df9a8d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22893221?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/user