n     解决「下一张/关闭」按钮被 DialogOverlay 拦截无法点击\n  2) 灯箱根节点拦截 pointerdown，解决灯箱内点击被 Radix 当外部点击连带关闭对话框\n  另加加载转圈/失败重试/相邻图预加载\n- 修复启动阻塞：首次目录刷新（含源列表首跑验证几十个仓库）改后台执行，\n  HTTP 监听立即就绪（实测首跑 15min → 6s 起服务）\n- NewFNDepotSourceCtx：源验证受 ctx 约束（批量场景按源超时）","tree":{"sha":"b6ba43cfc5149041416b90e6033b041e2eca9918","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/git/trees/b6ba43cfc5149041416b90e6033b041e2eca9918"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/git/commits/8d2711d6e8ab2ed00d985586772d7cb4e1c3f5c7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22893221?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/conversun","id":22893221,"login":"conversun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyODkzMjIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Blue-Mink/New-Store/commit/8d2711d6e8ab2ed00d985586772d7cb4e1c3f5c7","node_id":"C_kwDOUh-77doAKDhkMjcxMWQ2ZThhYjJlZDAwZDk4NTU4Njc3MmQ3Y2I0ZTFjM2Y1Yzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Blue-Mink/New-Store/commit/29bb04e102114632197bae59f99880a8773620be","sha":"29bb04e102114632197bae59f99880a8773620be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/commits/29bb04e102114632