ersun@users.noreply.github.com","name":"conversun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T18:36:32Z","email":"conversun@users.noreply.github.com","name":"conversun"},"message":"feat(ui): Apple App Store 风格重设计\n\n- 主题令牌层：iOS 配色（亮 #f5f5f7/白卡 / 暗 纯黑/#1c1c1e），iOS 蓝\n  #0071e3/#0a84ff，SF 字体栈 + PingFang 回退，18px 卡片圆角\n- 新增 squircle 超椭圆图标圆角、pill 药丸、appstore 阴影工具类\n- AppCard：56px 超椭圆图标、15px 半粗应用名 + appname 开发者行、\n  安装=实心蓝药丸 / 更新=描边蓝药丸（App Store GET/UPDATE 风格）\n- 侧栏：毛玻璃底 + 蓝色圆角选中项（App Store 风格）\n- 顶栏：大标题、药丸搜索框/排序器、毛玻璃底\n- 新增 ThemeToggle：亮/暗/跟随系统切换（next-themes，持久化）\n- 发现页新增 FeaturedShowcase：Today 风格渐变横幅（下载量 Top3）\n  + 热门应用 / 最近更新横向滚动区\n- e2e 契约保持：main/heading 应用名/overflow-hidden 卡片/按钮精确名\n  安装·更新·卸载 均未改动\n- 重新构建 web/ 嵌入产物\n\n验证：tsc 零错误、vitest 50/50 通过、mock 数据四视图截图验证\n（亮/暗 × 应用/发现）","tree":{"sha":"b4da38f0df2c9d73996c65b220132daeb2931ab5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/git/trees/b4da38f0df2c9d73996c65b220132daeb2931ab5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/git/commits/45f965f39bd6f84ad2d09f9523f60b77d2dd8d60","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22893221?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/conversun","id":22893221,"login":"conversun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyODkzMjIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://