e5c2ce46557bec953"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22893221?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/conversun","id":22893221,"login":"conversun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyODkzMjIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/commits/9af079ab6fffd9b5427709e2560488cc0124c19f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T17:00:37Z","email":"conversun@gmail.com","name":"conversun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T17:00:37Z","email":"conversun@gmail.com","name":"conversun"},"message":"fix: refuse an install whose port is already taken, before downloading\n\nDocker''s container-create aborts an appcenter install task halfway on a port\nconflict, leaving the app half-registered — the zombie where stop says\n''not installed'', uninstall returns 10300, and reinstall is refused\n(conversun/fnos-apps#295). Probe the service port (wizard answer first,\ncatalog default second) before any download so the failure is a clean no-op.\nThe listen probe catches socket holders (docker-proxy, native services);\nNAT-only published ports hold no socket and pass — best effort.","tree":{"sha":"4b1d61ca841594eb5dd12302f5855b9ddb45ce03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/git/trees/4b1d61ca841594eb5dd12302f5855b9ddb45ce03"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/git/commits/9af079ab6fffd9b5427709e2560488cc0124c19f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22893221?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/conversun","id":22893221,"login":"conversun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyODkzMjIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Blue-Mink/New-Store/commit/9af079ab6fffd9b5427709e2560488cc0124c19f","node_id":"C_kwDOUh-77doAKDlhZjA3OWFiNmZmZmQ5YjU0Mjc3MDllMjU2MDQ4OGNjMDEyNGMxOWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Blue-Mink/New-Store/commit/8a228790ddb05a820cbbb242bda8d478744349dc","sha":"8a228790ddb05a820cbbb242bda8d478744349dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/commits/8a228790ddb05a820cbbb242bda8d478744349dc"}],"sha":"9af079ab6fffd9b5427709e2560488cc0124c19f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/commits/9af079ab6fffd9b5427709e2560488cc0124c19f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22893221?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/conversun","id":22893221,"login":"conversun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyODkzMjIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/commits/8a228790ddb05a820cbbb242bda8d478744349dc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-12T17:00:37Z","email":"conversun@gmail.com","name":"conversun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-12T17:00:37Z","email":"conversun@gmail.com","name":"conversun"},"message":"fix: give ghcr.io images a mirror that actually carries them\n\nEvery public path-prefix docker mirror denies ghcr refs (measured on a live\nfnOS box: allowlist/manifest failures across 1ms, rat.dev, 1panel,\ndockerproxy, registry.cyou), so ghcr-sourced apps fell through to a direct\nghcr.io pull that EOFs behind the GFW — the paperless-ngx dead-end in\nconversun/fnos-apps#286 and friends. Add NJU as a registry-rewrite mirror\n(ghcr.io/x/y -> ghcr.nju.edu.cn/x/y, verified by a full layer pull on fnOS\n1.2.0203): its rewrite leads the chain when selected, and slots in before\nthe trailing direct ref otherwise.","tree":{"sha":"d3fe35a5ef7f9fee977f558f8234358e8581e099","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/git/trees/d3fe35a5ef7f9fee977f558f8234358e8581e099"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/git/