/api.github.com/users/conversun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/conversun","id":22893221,"login":"conversun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyODkzMjIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/commits/a50fe40fda493d4572f79394b2fd0c3f0b33e886/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-02T14:46:29Z","email":"conversun@gmail.com","name":"conversun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-02T14:46:29Z","email":"conversun@gmail.com","name":"conversun"},"message":"fix: route fresh installs through the daemon install channel\n\nFresh installs only used the daemon when a wizard supplied params\n(`len(params) > 0`); everything else — the 78 apps with no wizard, plus\napps whose wizard is tips-only like frigate — fell back to install-local.\ninstall-local is a CLI shortcut whose chown step fails installs outright\nwith the opaque \"code 10237\" on some builds (conversun/fnos-apps#227,\n#228), while the daemon''s install/task is the native path fnOS''s own App\nCenter uses and does not hit it.\n\nRoute every fresh install through the daemon (InstallFpkWithWizard with\nan empty param set when the app declares no wizard), keeping install-local\nonly as the fallback for a box whose daemon is unreachable — safe there\nbecause a fresh install has no existing app/data to destroy (unlike an\nupdate, #189). Updates are unchanged: still daemon-only via UpgradeFpk.\n\nExtract chooseInstallRoute so the channel decision is unit-testable, and\ncover the three routes.","tree":{"