m/conversun","id":22893221,"login":"conversun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyODkzMjIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/commits/f9aee5b81938ee428e5d781654b3d236a8db50a6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T05:13:43Z","email":"conversun@gmail.com","name":"conversun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T05:13:43Z","email":"conversun@gmail.com","name":"conversun"},"message":"chore: bump version to 1.7.10\n\nShips the verifyInstalled retry+fallback fix from the previous three\ncommits (conversun/fnos-apps#181).","tree":{"sha":"48a57d148b6924e44e7995d51393aa2f979cce83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/git/trees/48a57d148b6924e44e7995d51393aa2f979cce83"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/git/commits/f9aee5b81938ee428e5d781654b3d236a8db50a6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22893221?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/conversun","id":22893221,"login":"conversun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyODkzMjIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Blue-Mink/New-Store/commit/f9aee5b81938ee428e5d781654b3d236a8db50a6","node_id":"C_kwDOUh-77doAKGY5YWVlNWI4MTkzOGVlNDI4ZTVkNzgxNjU0YjNkMjM2YThkYjUwYTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Blue-Mink/New-Store/commit/60a2ce5cffa1ae6eb38198a931b57cdd17a497f2","sha":"60a2ce5cffa1ae6eb38198a931b57cdd17a497f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/commits/60a2ce5cffa1ae6eb38198a931b57cdd17a497f2"}],"sha":"f9aee5b81938ee428e5d781654b3d236a8db50a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/commits/f9aee5b81938ee428e5d781654b3d236a8db50a6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22893221?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/conversun","id":22893221,"login":"conversun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyODkzMjIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/commits/60a2ce5cffa1ae6eb38198a931b57cdd17a497f2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T05:13:30Z","email":"conversun@gmail.com","name":"conversun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T05:13:30Z","email":"conversun@gmail.com","name":"conversun"},"message":"fix(api): retry verifyInstalled with backoff + List() fallback (#181)\n\nRoot cause: fnOS `appcenter-cli install-local` returns before its\ninternal registration DB commits, so the immediate single-shot\n`appcenter-cli check <appname>` sometimes reports the app as not\ninstalled, producing the \"安装后验证失败，应用未正确安装\" toast on\notherwise-successful installs. First seen in issue #18 (Plex 5.2.7.1,\nclosed without a code fix); resurfaced in #181 (Plex, x86, two users).\n\nFix: replace the single-shot Check with a bounded retry loop against\nverifyRetryDelays (8 attempts, cumulative 20s). Between attempts,\nrespect ctx cancellation via verifyWait. Hard CLI errors (Check\nreturns err != nil) short-circuit — they indicate a real CLI/config\nfailure, not a race, and retrying only masks the signal.\n\nFallback: if all 8 Check attempts return installed=false, consult\nList() as a broader signal that tolerates output-format drift (locale,\nstatus suffixes). Accept only when the app row is present AND has a\nsane status (running/stopped). Reject unknown/empty to avoid blessing\npartial-install failures.\n\nEvery attempt writes a log line so production instances can post-mortem\nthe race window. On persistent failure the error message now cites the\nretry count and total wait, and directs the user to app logs.\n\nBehaviour on the happy path is unchanged (attempt 1 fires at t=0 with\nno delay). Worst-case verify latency rises from ~instant to ~20s on\nthe sad path — hidden by runWithVirtualProgress''s 500ms virtual\nprogress ticker.\n\nTurns TestVerifyInstalled from 2/9 to 9/9 green under -race.\n\nCloses conversun/fnos-apps#181.","tree":{"sha":"accf0c2c395fd1ceeed7dcf97132ecfa6c282977","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/git/trees/accf0c2c395fd1ceeed7dcf97132ecfa6c282977"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/git/commits/60a2ce5cffa1ae6eb38198a931b57cdd17a497f2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22893221?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/conversun","id":22893221,"login":"conversun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyODkzMjIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Blue-Mink/New-Store/commit/60a2ce5cffa1ae6eb38198a931b57cdd17a497f2","node_id":"C_kwDOUh-77doAKDYwYTJjZTVjZmZhMWFlNmViMzgxOThhOTMxYjU3Y2RkMTdhNDk3ZjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Blue-Mink/New-Store/commit/2a1459c97c143f50aa6fbf4cbcb4b0666fc0ec12","sha":"2a1459c97c143f50aa6fbf4cbcb4b0666fc0ec12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/commits/2a1459c97c143f50aa6fbf4cbcb4b0666fc0ec12"}],"sha":"60a2ce5cffa1ae6eb38198a931b57cdd17a497f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/commits/60a2ce5cffa1ae6eb38198a931b57cdd17a497f2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22893221?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/conversun","id":22893221,"login":"conversun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyODkzMjIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/commits/2a1459c97c143f50aa6fbf4cbcb4b0666fc0ec12/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T05:12:29Z","email":"conversun@gmail.com","name":"conversun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T05:12:29Z","email":"conversun@gmail.com","name":"conversun"},"message":"test(api): add failing tests + retry scaffolding for verifyInstalled (#181)\n\nAdds verifyRetryDelays (8-slot backoff schedule summing to ~20s) and\nverifyWait (ctx-aware sleep, overridable for tests) as package vars,\nthen table-driven pipeline_test.go covering 9 scenarios:\n\n  1. happy_first_try                    — Check succeeds on attempt 1\n  2. race_recovers_at_4                 — recovers from 3 stale reads\n  3. list_fallback_hit_running          — List() rescue, status=running\n  4. list_fallback_hit_stopped          — List() rescue, status=stopped\n  5. list_fallback_reject_unknown_status — reject Status=unknown\n  6. list_fallback_wrong_appname        — reject non-matching AppName\n  7. list_fallback_miss_empty           — reject empty List()\n  8. hard_error_no_retry                — Check err != nil short-circuits\n  9. ctx_already_canceled               — first verifyWait returns ctx.Err()\n\nAgainst the current single-shot verifyInstalled impl, 7 of 9 cases\nFAIL (RED phase). The next commit adds the retry loop + List()\nfallback and turns them GREEN.\n\nFor conversun/fnos-apps#181.","tree":{"sha":"f3dd7a1738582bec437379866c915315e1d0bd15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/git/trees/f3dd7a1738582bec437379866c915315e1d0bd15"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/git/commits/2a1459c97c143f50aa6fbf4cbcb4b0666fc0ec12","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22893221?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/conversun","id":22893221,"login":"conversun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyODkzMjIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Blue-Mink/New-Store/commit/2a1459c97c143f50aa6fbf4cbcb4b0666fc0ec12","node_id":"C_kwDOUh-77doAKDJhMTQ1OWM5N2MxNDNmNTBhYTZmYmY0Y2JjYjRiMDY2NmZjMGVjMTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Blue-Mink/New-Store/commit/6026153054a6302166a4da015dbb21fab1aa8872","sha":"6026153054a6302166a4da015dbb21fab1aa8872","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/commits/6026153054a6302166a4da015dbb21fab1aa8872"}],"sha":"2a1459c97c143f50aa6fbf4cbcb4b0666fc0ec12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/commits/2a1459c97c143f50aa6fbf4cbcb4b0666fc0ec12"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22893221?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/conversun","id":22893221,"login":"conversun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyODkzMjIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/commits/6026153054a6302166a4da015dbb21fab1aa8872/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-09T05:10:41Z","email":"conversun@gmail.com","name":"conversun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-09T05:10:41Z","email":"conversun@gmail.com","name":"conversun"},"message":"refactor(api): thread ctx into verifyInstalled (#181)\n\nPrepare verifyInstalled for retry-with-backoff by adding the context\nparameter and propagating it from runStandard. No behavior change yet —\nthis commit only threads the context so subsequent commits can add\nretry loop cancellation and List() fallback without touching the caller.\n\nPreparatory refactor for conversun/fnos-apps#181.","tree":{"sha":"8f8ede1b3d7700f301ca91eccdc78655818c2a64","url":"https