github.com/users/conversun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/conversun","id":22893221,"login":"conversun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyODkzMjIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/commits/658a8e00643b566978a65d5e8f54c463272e89d9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T17:09:57Z","email":"conversun@gmail.com","name":"conversun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T17:09:57Z","email":"conversun@gmail.com","name":"conversun"},"message":"ci: tag 推送后自动触发 fnos-apps 构建 (option A)\n\n之前: tag v1.7.x 推送 -> fnos-store release 创建 -> 等到 fnos-apps\ndaily cron (08:00 UTC, 0–24h 延迟) -> .fpk 才出现在 apps.json。\n\n现在: tag 推送后立即在同一个 release job 末尾用 gh CLI 触发 fnos-apps\nbuild-apps.yml workflow_dispatch (--field app=fnos-apps-store), 总传播\n延迟从 ~24h 降到 ~5min。\n\n实现细节:\n- 在 job-level env 绑定 secrets.FNOS_APPS_DISPATCH_TOKEN, 这样 `if`\n  expression 能看到它 (step-level env 是 if 之后才求值的)\n- if: env.FNOS_APPS_DISPATCH_TOKEN != '''' 让 fork 仓库或未配置 PAT\n  时这一步直接跳过, 不影响 release 本身\n\n启用步骤 (一次性):\n  在 fnos-store repo settings -> Secrets and variables -> Actions\n  新增 FNOS_APPS_DISPATCH_TOKEN, 值为 fine-grained PAT:\n    Repository access: Only select repositories -> conversun/fnos-apps\n    Permissions:        Actions: Read and write","tree":{"sha":"a1b8e36282d82b2676fb1b3d35ca45c59dbb0559","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/git/trees/a1b8e36282d82b2676fb1b3d35ca45c59dbb0559"},"url"