rl":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Blue-Mink/New-Store/commit/cc009e6782617cb745789c2cd242608e50f6cf5a","node_id":"C_kwDOUh-77doAKGNjMDA5ZTY3ODI2MTdjYjc0NTc4OWMyY2QyNDI2MDhlNTBmNmNmNWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Blue-Mink/New-Store/commit/8985dea2da468dbf6d0d2b7e00a9feec5ace7cc5","sha":"8985dea2da468dbf6d0d2b7e00a9feec5ace7cc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/commits/8985dea2da468dbf6d0d2b7e00a9feec5ace7cc5"}],"sha":"cc009e6782617cb745789c2cd242608e50f6cf5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/commits/cc009e6782617cb745789c2cd242608e50f6cf5a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22893221?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/conversun","id":22893221,"login":"conversun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyODkzMjIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/commits/8985dea2da468dbf6d0d2b7e00a9feec5ace7cc5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-06T08:02:30Z","email":"conversun@gmail.com","name":"conversun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-06T08:02:30Z","email":"conversun@gmail.com","name":"conversun"},"message":"fix: 修复商店自更新假报错并加固多项稳定性\n\n主问题: 点击更新后立即显示「更新请求失败」, 但实际更新成功。\n\n根因: runSelfUpdate 发送 self_update SSE 事件后立即调用 detached\nappcenter-cli (Setsid + cmd.Start), 后端被子进程杀掉的速度快于浏览器\nfetch reader 读取该事件; promise reject -> catch 触发 toast.error。\n\n后端:\n- pipeline.go: self_update 事件后增加 selfUpdateFlushDelay (750ms)\n  让 SSE 字节抵达客户端; InstallLocal 失败时 sendError + 清理 dir\n- pipeline.go: runWithVirtualProgress 在 ctx 取消时等待 fn() 完成,\n  防止 fpk 临时文件被 defer 清理时与 in-flight CLI 调用竞争\n- cron.go: Stop 之后再 Start 时重建 stopCh, 允许调度器重启\n- main.go: SIGTERM 改为 httpServer.Shutdown(15s) 优雅 drain\n\n前端:\n- App.tsx: 新增 selfUpdateRestartSeenRef, 仅在 self_update 事件实际\n  抵达后置位; catch 仅在此 ref 为 true 时抑制 toast, 避免 pre-SSE\n  失败 (HTTP 409 / 网络错误) 被静默吞掉\n- App.tsx: pollForRestart useCallback + ref 去重 + 卸载时清理\n- App.tsx: triggerReload 取消上一次未完成的 reload SSE\n- App.tsx: handleInstall/handleUpdate 合并为单次 setAppOp (避免进度\n  回到 0%); 双击防重; finally 块的 loadApps 移出 setState updater\n  并在自更新期间跳过\n- AppDetailDialog: 之前被丢弃的 operation prop 现在用于禁用按钮 +\n  loading 状态, 防止从详情对话框双触发\n- client.ts: SSE 解析支持 CRLF; 按 SSE 规范拼接多行 data:; EOF\n  flush 剩余 pendingData; parse 错误 console.warn 并截断 raw payload\n\nDev:\n- dev/mock-appcenter-cli.sh: 新增 install-local 子命令, 允许 macOS\n  本地模拟自更新流程\n\n构建: npm run build 重新生成 web/ 嵌入资源。","tree":{"sha":"fe63784f0ffba154a0dd9af03f02624abb1e9257","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/git/trees/fe63784f0ffba154a0dd9af03f02624abb1e9257"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/git/commits/8985dea2da468dbf6d0d2b7e00a9feec5ace7cc5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":nu