ail.com","name":"conversun"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-27T15:53:17Z","email":"conversun@gmail.com","name":"conversun"},"message":"feat(ui): switch light-mode primary color to fnOS blue (#138)\n\nCloses #138\n\nThe light-mode primary token was `240 5.9% 10%` — almost black — which\nmade the Install / Update / Save buttons feel heavy and visually noisy\non the cards (\"黑秋秋的\"). Dark mode already used a clean fnOS-style\nblue (`211 70% 55%`).\n\nAlign the light-mode token to the same blue so the action buttons read\nas a clear action color in both themes. Update --ring to match for\nfocus-state consistency.\n\nComponents affected by this single token change:\n  - AppCard \"安装\" button (default variant)\n  - SettingsDialog save button\n  - Banner reload button\n  - Badges using bg-primary/10 / text-primary\n  - Focus rings on inputs / buttons","tree":{"sha":"ad4cfa68f1100e760f970f28ee2caca38757631e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/git/trees/ad4cfa68f1100e760f970f28ee2caca38757631e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blue-Mink/New-Store/git/commits/10ac5b9c6591bb2ce06b6353d492e0aea6b13dc8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22893221?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/conversun","id":22893221,"login":"conversun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyODkzMjIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/conversun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.g