 the plaintext code back\n  via the HMAC hatch. Zero surface in the pro bundle.\n* sign.component.ts: install hook in ngOnInit and forward the installed\n  debug key to requestOtp so the ceremony can be driven headlessly.\n* playwright.config.ts + e2e/: full suite structure\n  - fixtures/: synthetic id_front/id_back PNGs (Textract-passing) and a\n    signature PNG regenerated from the backend integration_signatures\n    helpers, kept in sync via fixtures/regenerate.sh\n  - helpers/env.ts: single-source env-var loader with a real interface\n  - helpers/backend.ts: thin API clients to register users, seed a\n    process to stage=''signature'', and open raw ceremonies via the M2M\n    service key\n  - helpers/signing-driver.ts: typed wrapper around window.__signingE2E\n  - specs/signing-standalone.spec.ts: opens a raw ceremony and drives\n    the wizard to the async boundary (worker fails on the fake PDF URL,\n    which is expected); no portal dependency\n  - specs/portal-to-payment.spec.ts: registers a user, seeds a process,\n    logs into the portal, clicks ''Firmar ahora'', drives the full\n    ceremony, returns to the portal, and asserts the auto-advance to\n    payment\n* .github/workflows/e2e.yml: manual dispatch workflow; runs against dev\n  using GH env secrets/vars. Not on the deploy critical path (worker\n  takes 30-90s per test).\n* .gitignore: e2e reports/env\n* npm scripts: e2e / e2e:headed / e2e:ui\n\nFace fixture is opt-in via SIGNATURES_TEST_FACE_PATH (privacy). Specs\ntest.skip() gracefully when missing.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"5e0274978f52aed0b7b7a9a981b029b48c89e361","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/salo368/Software-Inge-frontend/git/trees/5e0274978f52aed0b7b7a9a981b029b48c89e361"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/salo368/Software-Inge-frontend/git/commits/630e17ad48530a06123e38d794819558e6454d4f","verification":{"payload":"tree 5e0274978f52aed0b7b7a9a981b029b48c89e361\nparent 41c0df0a8560874b26e655e0bbca292ccceef607\nauthor Salomon Saenz <122643656+salo368@users.noreply.github.com> 1790048673 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790048673 -0500\n\nfeat(e2e): playwright suite for signing feature (#8)\n\nFase 10e:\n\n* projects/signing/src/app/core/e2e-hooks.ts: install window.__signingE2E\n  when stage=''dev'' AND ?e2e=1. Exposes typed actions that bypass the\n  <video>+getUserMedia (camera) and <canvas> pointer strokes (signature\n  pad) by feeding blobs directly into the same code paths the real UI\n  uses; introspection via getState()/waitForScreen()/waitForStage();\n  debug OTP key install so request_otp echoes the plaintext code back\n  via the HMAC hatch. Zero surface in the pro bundle.\n* sign.component.ts: install hook in ngOnInit and forward the installed\n  debug key to requestOtp so the ceremony can be driven headlessly.\n* playwright.config.ts + e2e/: full suite structure\n  - fixtures/: synthetic id_front/id_back PNGs (Textract-passing) and a\n    signature PNG regenerated from the backend integration_signatures\n    helpers, kept in sync via fixtures/regenerate.sh\n  - helpers/env.ts: single-source env-var loader with a real interface\n  - helpers/backend.ts: thin API clients to register users, seed a\n    process to stage=''signature'', and open raw ceremonies via the M2M\n    service key\n  - helpers/signing-driver.ts: typed wrapper around window.__signingE2E\n  - specs/signing-standalone.spec.ts: opens a raw ceremony and drives\n    the wizard to the async boundary (worker fails on the fake PDF URL,\n    which is expected); no portal dependency\n  - specs/portal-to-payment.spec.ts: registers a user, seeds a process,\n    logs into the portal, clicks ''Firmar ahora'', drives the full\n    ceremony, returns to the portal, and asserts the auto-advance to\n    payment\n* .github/workflows/e2e.yml: manual dispatch workflow; runs against dev\n  using GH env secrets/vars. Not on the deploy critical path (worker\n  takes 30-90s per test).\n* .gitignore: e2e reports/env\n* npm scripts: e2e / e2e:headed / e2e:ui\n\nFace fixture is opt-in via SIGNATURES_TEST_FACE_PATH (privacy). Specs\ntest.skip() gracefully when missing.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqsfmhCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAlIUQAIgktrYcF4BI+QqYs7z9+eaH\nrcf0CWN2G/1UsPQB7Bndp9ZCpfkGxMZPr6KqlNyHSXFOjBnr7UYKx0x1r4QDUF6q\nui1troTIvXTY3DwtjBiB4pUVhSWf6EqutBjtYJHyMM3vi0HIxzklD6lZyO/EfrPy\nDw4xzRC77pDoKHy46IFinqCLYqO2Az2b1e1rRsv8iL3PlQ2pyXPSvQ1Z4mwhcbv1\nckIM1oRkRXREbwhXGdz66RFQ0pT/6E0sdrS0LTQCaiV6EL7poVFxgS3TcI7/o6MH\nwW87DEPXRf3SFjBoegmenrJpwd73YwNXT6tKX1qzupEJ0s6k8Ke7nFn4B/nInS42\nruQBZmVNrzPxkzqcNMDcYdb1OTqL9tzGJO8fGeVflZgFsW7C9DMm99mjTumWaMoM\nCGqdcGUhF1G90Ut167uZgIhRrLI/5glmeFgy4n+c/kVdz3HLL9Cwao9bD52EcSbu\npk0hkwXdYwENTkn6KeEEw/IpX+rqFiqv+/MAk2Lmh2wHapk5CkyG+4+eiSHnRLfe\nAYxUIPHnhe/oEniR9NvzJC4M2lAQvcOeLVVlrCxbWF3uc6NeHEZdUubi8zLRhc4c\nwZXp4RwYgg9N8JBJx1pOZRYHz7Lika9CybDsSjNEyeHR+EiPIZBoDhZnTm68iF8q\ngYjNj8O7e6FV2W4ze/6r\n=XTYX\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-22T03:44:33Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":