lowing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salo368/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/salo368","id":122643656,"login":"salo368","node_id":"U_kgDOB09kyA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salo368/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salo368/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salo368/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salo368/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salo368/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/salo368","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/salo368/Software-Inge-frontend/commits/eeb5d4033d47c55983d691035a34318437960248/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T18:53:55Z","email":"salomonsaenzg368@gmail.com","name":"Salomon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T18:53:55Z","email":"salomonsaenzg368@gmail.com","name":"Salomon"},"message":"chore: stand the frontend up as its own repo\n\nExtracted from the backend monorepo with `git subtree split`, so the 12\ncommits that touched frontend/ keep their history with the SPA at the root.\n\nBrings its own pipeline instead of the block matrix it used to be a case of:\npush to develop deploys dev, push to main deploys pro, and both delegate to a\nreusable workflow. `sls deploy` now runs only when serverless.yml changed or\nthe stack is missing -- before it was gated on \"any file outside src/\", which\nredeployed CloudFront for an angular.json tweak.\n\nThe AWS side is unchanged on purpose: same `cdts-<stage>-frontend` stack, so\nthis repo updates what already exists rather than standing up a parallel\nbucket and distribution.","tree":{"sha":"f97d351db0391485a2c228c7aaf13d6983452a86","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/salo368/Software-Inge-frontend/git/trees/f97d351db0391485a2c228c7aaf13d6983452a86"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/salo368/Software-In