,"type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/salo368","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/salo368/Software-Inge-frontend/commits/4f4a39bd2b551eedb54dd1c60ddc0f12cd8e09be/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T17:41:10Z","email":"salomonsaenzg368@gmail.com","name":"salomon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T17:41:10Z","email":"salomonsaenzg368@gmail.com","name":"salomon"},"message":"feat(frontend): signature ceremony UI at /firmar/:token\n\nPorts the MVP signing SPA into the existing Angular app instead of a second\ndeployable: review the order with a pdf.js preview that shows where the\nsignature lands, capture three guided photos, draw the signature and confirm\nwith the emailed code.\n\nThe route is public on purpose -- the token is the credential, so the link\nfrom the email works on any device without a session.\n\nThe process wizard no longer fakes this stage: it opens the ceremony and\nhands the user over, and the backend moves the process to payment on\nconfirm.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"11107619b2b34336a2fc2d955e6df5aeaffa3847","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/salo368/Software-Inge-frontend/git/trees/11107619b2b34336a2fc2d955e6df5aeaffa3847"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/salo368/Software-Inge-frontend/git/commits/4f4a39bd2b551eedb54dd1c60ddc0f12cd8e09be","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/122643656?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salo368/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salo368/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salo368/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salo368/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/salo368","id":122643656,"login":"salo368","node_id":"U_kgDOB09kyA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salo368/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salo368/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salo368/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salo368/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salo368/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/salo368","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/salo368/Software-Inge-frontend/commit/4f4a39bd2b551eedb54dd1c60ddc0f12cd8e09be","node_id":"C_kwDOUiz2UtoAKDRmNGEzOWJkMmI1NTFlZWRiNTRkZDFjNjBkZGMwZjEyY2Q4ZTA5YmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/salo368/Software-Inge-frontend/commit/95c43f540db6c8752ed8f58ce0ead60a9f4b4c17","sha":"95c43f540db6c8752ed8f58ce0ead60a9f4b4c17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/salo368/Software-Inge-frontend/commits/95c43f540db6c8752ed8f58ce0ead60a9f4b4c17"}],"sha":"4f4a39bd2b551eedb54dd1c60ddc0f12cd8e09be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/salo368/Software-Inge-frontend/commits/4f4a39bd2b551eedb54dd1c60ddc0f12cd8e09be"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/122643656?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salo368/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salo368/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salo368/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salo368/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/salo368","id":122643656,"login":"salo368","node_id":"U_kgDOB09kyA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salo368/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salo368/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salo368/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salo368/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salo368/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/salo368","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/salo368/Software-Inge-frontend/commits/95c43f540db6c8752ed8f58ce0ead60a9f4b4c17/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T12:36:18Z","email":"salomonsaenzg368@gmail.com","name":"salomon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T12:36:18Z","email":"salomonsaenzg368@gmail.com","name":"salomon"},"message":"fix(db): commit the search_path so the pool cannot roll it back\n\nThe connect listener issues SET search_path, but pg8000 runs it inside an\nimplicit transaction. SQLAlchemy rolls back when a connection returns to the\npool, and PostgreSQL undoes a SET made in a rolled-back transaction, so the\nconnection fell back to the default search_path (pro). Reads then missed rows\nanother schema had written -- a token issued by auth looked absent to\nprocesses, which surfaced as random invalid_or_expired_token responses.\n\nIt only looked intermittent because the session used to hold its connection\nfor the life of the container; closing the session per invocation made every\nreused connection hit it.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"84a14cb6e108a5ce526b42add7a0e39b498c9d01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/salo368/Software-Inge-frontend/git/trees/84a14cb6e108a5ce526b42add7a0e39b498c9d01"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/salo368/Software-Inge-frontend/git/commits/95c43f540db6c8752ed8f58ce0ead60a9f4b4c17","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/122643656?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salo368/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salo368/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salo368/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salo368/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/salo368","id":122643656,"login":"salo368","node_id"