om/users/salo368","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/salo368/Software-Inge-frontend/commits/ae41f30482deed4f83692d3e3c8c208a4196adfe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T12:16:51Z","email":"salomonsaenzg368@gmail.com","name":"salomon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T12:16:51Z","email":"salomonsaenzg368@gmail.com","name":"salomon"},"message":"fix(ui): keep original filenames and align auth pages with the design system\n\nUploaded documents showed their uuid key instead of the name the user picked,\nbecause the key is the only thing the S3 trigger could read. get_upload_url\nnow signs an original-name metadata entry into the presigned URL and returns\nthe exact headers the client must echo, so the worker can recover the real\nname. Values are percent-encoded to survive accents and spaces in an HTTP\nheader.\n\nThe login and register screens still used the pre-Bootstrap markup with their\nown stylesheet, so they rendered with a blue button and plain inputs while the\nrest of the app was purple. They now use the shared design system and\nauth-form.css is gone.\n\nDisabled primary buttons inherited Bootstrap''s 0.65 opacity, which faded the\ngradient to near-white and made the loading label unreadable.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"1885cdbbfa61edcf145e5a5091b12174aee218ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/salo368/Software-Inge-frontend/git/trees/1885cdbbfa61edcf145e5a5091b12174aee218ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/salo368/Software-Inge-frontend/git/commits/ae41f30482deed4f83692d3e3c8c208a4196adfe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/122643656?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salo368/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salo368/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/use