min":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salo368/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/salo368/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/salo368","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/salo368/Software-Inge-frontend/commits/9b817c128fee52b9bbc3a245c9d9e214a555877b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T11:49:54Z","email":"salomonsaenzg368@gmail.com","name":"salomon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T11:49:54Z","email":"salomonsaenzg368@gmail.com","name":"salomon"},"message":"fix(process): register all ORM models and restore wizard styles\n\nThe process wizard was broken in two independent ways.\n\nBackend: Processes declares ForeignKey(\"banks.id\") but the advance, get and\nlist_mine handlers never imported Banks, so the table was missing from\nBase.metadata and configure_mappers() raised NoReferencedTableError on the\nfirst query. Only create imported Banks, which is why opening a CDT worked\nand advancing it did not. libs/orm/__init__.py now imports every model, so\nimporting any of them registers the full metadata.\n\nMove hash_password/verify_password to libs/utils/passwords.py. bcrypt is a\ncompiled extension and auth.py is imported by every service through\nrequire_auth, which forced files/forms/processes to ship a native wheel they\nnever used.\n\nFrontend: styles.css was ported from the legacy MVP before the wizard\nexisted, so .stepper, .step-dot, .step-line, .bank-logo-sm and .upload-box\nwere missing and the stepper rendered as a plain vertical list. Also fix the\nupload polling, which checked the files @Input synchronously right after\nasking the parent to refresh, and move the \"view document\" button out of the\n<label> so it stops reopening the file picker.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"b77a9562fca46e89c1884c321d812707a951333d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/salo368/Software-Ing