ar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial","id":29709447,"login":"bcashofficial","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NzA5NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commits/560cc80c05b3a93abb50de115be7e52eea8676e0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T20:18:24Z","email":"bryan.cash@programitcash.com","name":"Bryan Cash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T20:18:24Z","email":"bryan.cash@programitcash.com","name":"Bryan Cash"},"message":"Add SETUP.md and the root .env skeleton: everything a team needs to run the platform\n\nSETUP.md is the long form of the README''s Run it: the tools and the ports,\nthe two models to pull (or the bundled-Ollama profile), every environment\nvariable — the optional root .env, whose skeleton is .env.example, and the\ncommitted per-service .env.development files — what make dev prints, what\nfills in on which schedule, how to write the document now, how to verify,\nstop and reset, what to do when something''s off, and the optional rig.\nThe Makefile passes a root .env to compose when one exists; the README\npoints to SETUP.md.","tree":{"sha":"bf8ae95907955704aa7351ebc0b45755f39408de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/git/trees/bf8ae95907955704aa7351ebc0b45755f39408de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/git/commits/560cc80c05b3a93abb50de115be7e52eea8676e0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false