//api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commits/921ecf02e01826ef1bac53542da7b862802e8bc6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T18:31:40Z","email":"bryan.cash@programitcash.com","name":"Bryan Cash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T18:31:40Z","email":"bryan.cash@programitcash.com","name":"Bryan Cash"},"message":"Report each batch of executed generations as a pipeline run, so the app''s pipelines section shows the generator''s last run\n\nThe generate pipeline in voices-de only requests runs, so nothing\nrecorded that the generator had actually run and the pipelines section\nshowed generate with no last run. run_generations now records a\nPipelineRun for the generate pipeline per batch it executes — the host\nit ran on (--host, local by default, rig when pointed there), exit 0\nunless a run failed, and counts of runs, succeeded, failed and\nretrievals — the same rows every other pipeline reports through. A test\ncovers the record.","tree":{"sha":"ddcbb03645283046a6b001d785526082826e9236","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/git/trees/ddcbb03645283046a6b001d785526082826e9236"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/git/commits/921ecf02e01826ef1bac53542da7b862802e8bc6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29709447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcash