e":"2026-09-20T18:28:43Z","email":"bryan.cash@programitcash.com","name":"Bryan Cash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T18:28:43Z","email":"bryan.cash@programitcash.com","name":"Bryan Cash"},"message":"Read the map''s points as plain rows: no vectors, no whole voices, the text clipped in SQL\n\nThe map read pulled every projected embedding with its 384-dimension\nvector and its whole voice (body and all) and built four ORM objects per\npoint — seven seconds for a week. It now selects only what the map\ndraws — the id, x, y, the retrieval count, the topic''s label, the title\nand the opening of the body cut to the map''s length in SQL — as plain\nrows, and the most-retrieved list defers its vectors too. The same week\nreads in under half a second.","tree":{"sha":"ac9adb90d0247f90185f94fcb887e128f3b0f0bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/git/trees/ac9adb90d0247f90185f94fcb887e128f3b0f0bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/git/commits/7be23c1152cf1cdbbaa9b1d2016dc7b6af5cfca1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29709447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial","id":29709447,"login":"bcashofficial","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NzA5NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commit/7be23c1152cf1cdbbaa9b1d2016dc7b6af5cfca1","node_id":"C_kwDOUi30JNoAKDdiZTIzYzExNTJjZjFjZGJiYWE5YjFkMjAxNmRjN2I2YWY1Y2ZjYTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commit/49a537f78e49177814d939989c9b6a06ae1601cf","sha":"49a537f78e49177814d939989c9b6a06ae1601cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commits/49a537f78e49177814d939989c9b6a06ae1601cf"}],"sha":"7be23c1152cf1cdbbaa9b1d2016dc7b6af5cfca1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commits/7be23c1152cf1cdbbaa9b1d2016dc7b6af5cfca1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29709447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial","id":29709447,"login":"bcashofficial","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NzA5NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commits/49a537f78e49177814d939989c9b6a06ae1601cf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T18:17:03Z","email":"bryan.cash@programitcash.com","name":"Bryan Cash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T18:17:03Z","email":"bryan.cash@programitcash.com","name":"Bryan Cash"},"message":"Restyle the Dropdown''s field as a pill in the ground''s opposite; mark only the chosen option\n\nClosed, the field is now a pill — ink on the light ground, mist on the\ndark (--sv-ink-solid), the choice in the ground color at 600, a gold\nchevron — carrying the card shadow and lifting a pixel on hover and while\nopen, the town-square field turned inside out for this ground. Sizes stay\nsm and md, a little taller for the pill. The gold square that marked\nevery option now marks only the chosen one: the rule that set every\nmark''s opacity to one was a stray, and the redundant count rule with it.","tree":{"sha":"7f59f401e24f411c1cfd992b7d41d1b2dc481960","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/git/trees/7f59f401e24f411c1cfd992b7d41d1b2dc481960"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/git/commits/49a537f78e49177814d939989c9b6a06ae1601cf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29709447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial","id":29709447,"login":"bcashofficial","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NzA5NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/use