 them. The test opens it,\ncounts the five options, reads Map''s 4,212 and picks Pipelines. The plate\n(05.3) shows it with the sheet''s counts, and the Masthead plate now\ncarries it in the right slot beside the ThemeSwitch.","tree":{"sha":"bc16f2b323bc9d9fbe9e52f90eaaa624131b884c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/git/trees/bc16f2b323bc9d9fbe9e52f90eaaa624131b884c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/git/commits/79c97ae309ce9ebd39d4163ae9c08890178e7a52","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29709447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial","id":29709447,"login":"bcashofficial","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NzA5NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commit/79c97ae309ce9ebd39d4163ae9c08890178e7a52","node_id":"C_kwDOUi30JNoAKDc5Yzk3YWUzMDljZTllYmQzOWQ0MTYzYWU5YzA4ODkwMTc4ZTdhNTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commit/5a7a2b5261c0d498b347404cd3dbfc49780667cf","sha":"5a7a2b5261c0d498b347404cd3dbfc49780667cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commits/5a7a2b5261c0d498b347404cd3dbfc49780667cf"}],"sha":"79c97ae309ce9ebd39d4163ae9c08890178e7a52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commits/79c97ae309ce9ebd39d4163ae9c08890178e7a52"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29709447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial","id":29709447,"login":"bcashofficial","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NzA5NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commits/5a7a2b5261c0d498b347404cd3dbfc49780667cf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T10:43:04Z","email":"bryan.cash@programitcash.com","name":"Bryan Cash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T10:43:04Z","email":"bryan.cash@programitcash.com","name":"Bryan Cash"},"message":"Add Masthead: the name in Anton 46 with the gold offset, the Football beside it, a 3px ink rule under the line\n\nMasthead is the board''s head: an h1 in the display face at the masthead\nsize from the type scale with the 3px gold offset, the Football at its\nfoot (its click passed through onFootball), and a right slot for the\nchrome — the SectionMenu and the ThemeSwitch — that wraps under the name\non a narrow board. The 3px ink rule under the whole line is drawn as its\nown row rather than a border. The title defaults to the product name from\nthe vocabulary. The plate (05.1) shows the line with the ThemeSwitch in\nthe slot; the SectionMenu joins it when it lands.","tree":{"sha":"04f938cf94a8517f08532350aa2e5cbc6c053451","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/git/trees/04f938cf94a8517f08532350aa2e5cbc6c053451"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/git/commits/5a7a2b5261c0d498b347404cd3dbfc49780667cf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29709447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial","id":29709447,"login":"bcashofficial","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NzA5NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commit/5a7a2b5261c0d498b347404cd3dbfc49780667cf","node_id":"C_kwDOUi30JNoAKDVhN2EyYjUyNjFjMGQ0OThiMzQ3NDA0Y2QzZGJmYzQ5NzgwNjY3Y2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commit/deea16f5704975e7d9f04a88724676ea00c9d638","sha":"deea16f5704975e7d9f04a88724676ea00c9d638","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commits/deea16f5704975e7d9f04a88724676ea00c9d638"}],"sha":"5a7a2b5261c0d498b347404cd3dbfc49780667cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commits/5a7a2b5261c0d498b347404cd3dbfc49780667cf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29709447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial","id":29709447,"login":"bcashofficial","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NzA5NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commits/deea16f5704975e7d9f04a88724676ea00c9d638/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T10:41:34Z","email":"bryan.cash@programitcash.com","name":"Bryan Cash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T10:41:34Z","email":"bryan.cash@programitcash.com","name":"Bryan Cash"},"message":"Add ThemeSwitch: one icon, a moon in light and a sun in dark, that swaps the theme\n\nThemeSwitch is the second icon control. It reads the mode from the\nprovider and shows the sheet''s moon in light or its sun in dark, at 20px\nin the theme''s ink; a click calls the provider''s toggle, which stamps the\ndocument root and remembers the choice. Its accessible name says which\nway it will switch (Switch to dark / Switch to light, from the\nvocabulary). On hover it takes the hover tint on an 8px radius; there is\nno box otherwise. The test flips it and checks the name, the mode and the\ndata-theme attribute follow. The plate (05.4) shows the icon.","tree":{"sha":"7b0ab686375235c108872665cad4480586efe6a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/git/trees/7b0ab686375235c108872665cad4480586efe6a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/git/commits/deea16f5704975e7d9f04a88724676ea00c9d638","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29709447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial","id":29709447,"login":"bcashofficial","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NzA5NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commit/deea16f5704975e7d9f04a88724676ea00c9d638","node_id":"C_kwDOUi30JNoAKGRlZWExNmY1NzA0OTc1ZTdkOWYwNGE4ODcyNDY3NmVhMD