"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29709447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial","id":29709447,"login":"bcashofficial","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NzA5NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commits/d936df0795e6a88453a3c7f310804f9607d7e43c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T10:39:53Z","email":"bryan.cash@programitcash.com","name":"Bryan Cash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T10:40:38Z","email":"bryan.cash@programitcash.com","name":"Bryan Cash"},"message":"Add Football: the ink ball with gold seams and laces that tilts on hover and reopens the flyer\n\nFootball is one of the platform''s two icon controls. It draws the sheet''s\nball — an ellipse in the theme''s solid ink with a 2px gold stroke, two\nfaint gold seams and a laced center — at 34×22 by default, with a size\nprop that keeps the ratio. It is a button with no box and no fill, named\nby its label (Open this week''s flyer, from the vocabulary), and its SVG\ntilts 8° on hover with a 200ms ease only when motion is welcome. The\nplate (05.2) shows it at three sizes.","tree":{"sha":"b72f4a0302a493ca57c09b9e310b2f0b875f8d5c","url":"http