ts{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial","id":29709447,"login":"bcashofficial","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NzA5NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commits/4c804b964ddb3ef3d630580125a88a6e9b9f356b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T10:34:04Z","email":"bryan.cash@programitcash.com","name":"Bryan Cash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T10:34:04Z","email":"bryan.cash@programitcash.com","name":"Bryan Cash"},"message":"Build part 03 of the design system: TextLink, Avatar, VoiceMessage, Pane, GroupTabs, SubjectRow\n\nTextLink is the one control: an anchor with an href or a button with an\nonClick, a 3px gold underline drawing in from the left on hover and focus,\nkept — with the text at full ink and 600 — when current or selected; it\ncarries tab and menu ARIA so GroupTabs and the section menu are built from\nit. Avatar is a square with the handle''s initial in Anton on gold, blue,\nolive or ink chosen by a stable hash of the handle (avatarTone.ts), so a\nfan keeps their color across the board. VoiceMessage is one voice in the\nthread, Discord-style — avatar, handle, time, points drawn in the stencil\ndigits, the OP tag, a title for a post, the body, its pulse — with a reply\nindented under a rounded connector, and hover or focus reporting the\nreading upward for the scoreboard. Pane lifts when looked at (transparent\nat rest, surface and the big shadow on hover or focus-within, no border),\nwith PaneBar as its title line: a gold caret, the name, a drawn count in\nthe corner. GroupTabs is the three groupings from the vocab as text tabs.\nSubjectRow is a subject, its drawn count and its MoodMix; pressed rows\ncarry a 3px gold bar.\n\nTwo defects surfaced while wiring them and are fixed here. The token\nconverter emitted ink2 and ink3 as --sv-ink2 / --sv-ink3 while every\nprimitive and the sheet read --sv-ink-2 / --sv-ink-3, so muted text had\nbeen falling back to full ink; letters are now split from digits. And\nStencilNumber set its stroke as an SVG attribute, which cannot hold a\nvar(), so a themed color drew nothing; the stroke is a CSS property now.\n\nEach primitive is a plate in BoardPlates.tsx from real voices on the\nsheet; the VoiceMessage plate runs the JPJ thread under a Scoreboard that\nplays whichever voice is hovered. Nine new tests.","tree":{"sha":"8a823b0b70bf594da450aab7978c6e34ea426983","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/git/trees/8a823b0b70bf594da450aab7978c6e34ea426983"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/git/commits/4c804b964ddb3ef3d630580125a88a6e9b9f356b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29709447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial","id":29709447,"login":"bcashofficial","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NzA5NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commit/4c804b964ddb3ef3d630580125a88a6e9b9f356b","node_id":"C_kwDOUi30JNoAKDRjODA0Yjk2NGRkYjNlZjNkNjMwNTgwMTI1YTg4YTZlOWI5ZjM1NmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commit/f2366a1a49a6616b12e49b72a76f579a9559d10f","sha":"f2366a1a49a6616b12e49b72a76f579a9559d10f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commits/f2366a1a49a6616b12e49b72a76f579a9559d10f"}],"sha":"4c804b964ddb3ef3d630580125a88a6e9b9f356b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commits/4c804b964ddb3ef3d630580125a88a6e9b9f356b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29709447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial","id":29709447,"login":"bcashofficial","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NzA5NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commits/f2366a1a49a6616b12e49b72a76f579a9559d10f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T10:32:02Z","email":"bryan.cash@programitcash.com","name":"Bryan Cash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T10:32:02Z","email":"bryan.cash@programitcash.com","name":"Bryan Cash"},"message":"Add Masonry: the rail''s wall of cards on CSS columns; land the PostCard and Masonry plates\n\nMasonry lays its children out in CSS columns 200px wide (layout.masonryColumn)\nwith a 12px gutter, each child kept whole with break-inside: avoid and 14px\nbeneath it, as the sheet''s rail does. Below the board''s stacking width\n(layout.stackBelow, 980px) the sheet narrows the columns to 180px rather\nthan dropping to one — the rail is full width there — so this does the\nsame. A column prop overrides the width for another wall. The style mounts\nonce through mountStyle.\n\nThe plates for the rail land together here, since the Masonry plate is\nmade of PostCards: 04.1 PostCard shows three of the week''s posts from the\nsheet (Photo, none, Link, the first selected) and one with an image under\nthe halftone; 04.2 Masonry shows all seven in the rail''s order and heights\ninside a 412px column, clicking to select. The catalog flips both entries\nfrom planned to built. That completes part 04, The rail.","tree":{"sha":"1c256943f40ca0669037a30ccb954baee7f18175","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/git/trees/1c256943f40ca0669037a30ccb954baee7f18175"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/git/commits/f2366a1a49a6616b12e49b72a76f579a9559d10f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29709447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial","id":29709447,"login":"bcashofficial","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NzA5NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commit/f2366a1a49a6616b12e49b72a76f579a9559d10f","node_id":"C_kwDOUi30JNoAKGYyMzY2YTFhNDlhNjYxNmIxMmU0OWI3MmE3NmY1NzlhOTU1OWQxMGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commit/02bd6af7d9ea5222f65dd612a6601a4d3ba4e28e","sha":"02bd6af7d9ea5222f65dd612a6601a4d3ba4e28e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commits/02bd6af7d9ea5222f65dd612a6601a4d3ba4e28e"}],"sha":"f2366a1a49a6616b12e49b72a76f579a9559d10f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commits/f2366a1a49a6616b12e49b72a76f579a9559d10f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29709447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial","id":29709447,"login":"bcashofficial","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NzA5NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commits/02bd6af7d9ea5222f65dd612a6601a4d3ba4e28e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T10:31:10Z","email":"bryan.cash@programitcash.com","name":"Bryan Cash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T10:31:10Z","email":"bryan.cash@programitcash.com","name":"Bryan Cash"},"message":"Add PostCard: the rail''s card — a mood-plated cover with the count drawn, the halftone, the tag, the lanes, then the title with its dot\n\nPostCard is the town-square property card tailored to a thread. The cover\nruns edge to edge at whatever height the consumer gives it (the rail\nvaries it card to card, 84–132 on the sheet). It is a plate in the\ngradient of the thread''s loudest mood — the largest share of the mix,\nfound by loudestMood() in loudest.ts and exported with it — with the\ncomment count set in the stencil digits at 44px over it, a halftone screen\nof ink dots fading down it, a Photo or Link tag top-left when the post has\nmedia, and the thread''s MoodMix as a lane strip along the bottom. When the\npost has an image it sits under the halftone in place of the plate.\n\nThe digits follow the plate: ink on a light plate with the offset in mist,\nmist on a dark plate with the offset in gold, always mist over an image.\nThe offset is a second StencilNumber beneath, hidden from assistive tech,\nso StencilNumber''s props stay as they are.\n\nBelow the cover: the title at 600 with a StatusDot for the loudest mood on\nits baseline, then the handle in ink2 and the time in ink3. No border —\nthe card carries the card shadow, lifts and rises 2px on hover, and wears\na 2px ink ring when selected (aria-current). It is focusable; click, Enter\nand Space call onSelect. Transitions drop under reduced motion.\n\nTests cover the count, the tag words, the loudest mood on both the card and\nits dot, selection by pointer and keyboard, and the image under the\nhalftone. The plate (04.1) shows three of the sheet''s cards — Photo, none,\nLink — with the first selected, and one with an image.","tree":{"sha":"93779fc7e550e784408aed926b93cd75928575f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/git/trees/93779fc7e550e784408aed926b93cd75928575f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/git/commits/02bd6af7d9ea5222f65dd612a6601a4d3ba4e28e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29709447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial","id":29709447,"login":"bcashofficial","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NzA5NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commit/02bd6af7d9ea5222f65dd612a6601a4d3ba4e28e","node_id":"C_kwDOUi30JNoAKDAyYmQ2YWY3ZDllYTUyMjJmNjVkZDYxMmE2NjAxYTRkM2JhNGUyOGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commit/6120c6b27851586ca9b84d8db4527821eb3c4520","sha":"6120c6b27851586ca9b84d8db4527821eb3c4520","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commits/6120c6b27851586ca9b84d8db4527821eb3c4520"}],"sha":"02bd6af7d9ea5222f65dd612a6601a4d3ba4e28e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commits/02bd6af7d9ea5222f65dd612a6601a4d3ba4e28e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29709447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial","id":29709447,"login":"bcashofficial","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NzA5NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commits/6120c6b27851586ca9b84d8db4527821eb3c4520/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T10:26:37Z","email":"bryan.cash@programitcash.com","name":"Bryan Cash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T10:26:37Z","email":"bryan.cash@programitcash.com","name":"Bryan Cash"},"message":"Take part 04, The rail; add StatusDot: the mood as an 8px dot with an ink ring\n\nStatusDot is the first primitive of the rail. It is an 8px circle in the\nmood''s from-stop (through --sv-mood-<key>-from, so it follows the theme),\nringed by 1px of ink drawn as a box-shadow rather than a border, and sized\nby a prop for the odd larger case. It is role=img named by the mood word,\nor by a label when the consumer has more to say — on a post card that will\nbe the thread''s loudest mood.\n\nThe plate (04.3) sits the seven moods beside their words on one baseline,\nthe way the dot will sit beside a card title. Plates for this part live in\nplates/RailPlates.tsx; the barrel gains its export at the end.","tree":{"sha":"f12a518c8949b9bd4d9b359b292dbd8c7bf1466b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/git/trees/f12a518c8949b9bd4d9b359b292dbd8c7bf1466b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/git/commits/6120c6b27851586ca9b84d8db4527821eb3c4520","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29709447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial","id":29709447,"login":"bcashofficial","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NzA5NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.git