repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commits/7b45ccf29da36cfd4150e4f76ebb30b1c648270b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T10:21:20Z","email":"bryan.cash@programitcash.com","name":"Bryan Cash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T10:21:20Z","email":"bryan.cash@programitcash.com","name":"Bryan Cash"},"message":"Write the primitive workflow and the parallel-work rules into the design system''s CLAUDE.md\n\nThe rules gain the drawn-numbers, tokens-only and no-scrim-blur decisions\nand the no-explanatory-copy rule. A numbered workflow takes a primitive\nfrom its planned plate to a commit — component file, barrel export, tests,\nplate, the five checks, the container rebuild and the hard refresh — and\nnames the files to copy from. A parallel-work section assigns whole parts\nto sessions, one plate file per part, append-only barrel edits, and\nrebase-before-commit, and marks tokens, vocab, DESIGN.md and existing\nprops as shared contracts.","tree":{"sha":"1bb80d425198394fa8b8ce7eca31418ba2e1c93f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/git/trees/1bb80d425198394fa8b8ce7eca31418ba2e1c93f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/git/commits/7b45ccf29da36cfd4150e4f76ebb30b1c648270b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29709447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial","id":29709447,"login":"bcashofficial","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NzA5NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commit/7b45ccf29da36cfd4150e4f76ebb30b1c648270b","node_id":"C_kwDOUi30JNoAKDdiNDVjY2YyOWRhMzZjZmQ0MTUwZTRmNzZlYmIzMGIxYzY0ODI3MGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commit/8e895a700a29c448bdf07fcc53d79cea48c6781f","sha":"8e895a700a29c448bdf07fcc53d79cea48c6781f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commits/8e895a700a29c448bdf07fcc53d79cea48c6781f"}],"sha":"7b45ccf29da36cfd4150e4f76ebb30b1c648270b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commits/7b45ccf29da36cfd4150e4f76ebb30b1c648270b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29709447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial","id":29709447,"login":"bcashofficial","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NzA5NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commits/8e895a700a29c448bdf07fcc53d79cea48c6781f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T10:20:39Z","email":"bryan.cash@programitcash.com","name":"Bryan Cash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T10:20:39Z","email":"bryan.cash@programitcash.com","name":"Bryan Cash"},"message":"Make MoodSwatch a small color chip in a row; drop the chips modal\n\nThe swatch itself is now the chip: a 74 × 46 card in the mood''s gradient\nwith the product name top-left and the mood word bottom-left, text in ink\nor mist by the chip''s luminance, resolved for the current theme. Seven in\na row are the legend; the one that is on rises two pixels and wears an ink\nring. It is not a control. MoodChips, its modal, and the two accessible\nnames it needed are removed; the Scoreboard and the MoodSwatch plate show\nthe row. DESIGN.md follows.","tree":{"sha":"c57e24d302f0cfc3438a323eefb4a01a5f368fd8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/git/trees/c57e24d302f0cfc3438a323eefb4a01a5f368fd8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/git/commits/8e895a700a29c448bdf07fcc53d79cea48c6781f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29709447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://a