l/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial","id":29709447,"login":"bcashofficial","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NzA5NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commits/fa3d9cb9a458c9ff4823a9474310c2e8bb406b85/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T09:27:47Z","email":"bryan.cash@programitcash.com","name":"Bryan Cash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T09:27:47Z","email":"bryan.cash@programitcash.com","name":"Bryan Cash"},"message":"Seed the seven moods in voices-be, mirroring the design system''s vocab\n\nlookups/vocab.py now carries the mood taxonomy approved on the board sheet\n— Hyped, Hopeful, Proud, Level, Uneasy, Frustrated, Heated — each with the\ndesign-system mood key that paints its pulse bar, so seed_lookups writes\nseven LKMoods rows and the batch tagger has its closed vocabulary. Section\nkinds stay empty until their words are chosen. The seed test asserts the\ncount.","tree":{"sha":"7c89acfa99ee47b2f3230c3901018555e04482b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/git/trees/7c89acfa99ee47b2f3230c3901018555e04482b0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/git/commits/fa3d9cb9a458c9ff4823a9474310c2e8bb406b85","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29709447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial","id":29709447,"login":"bcashofficial","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NzA5NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commit/fa3d9cb9a458c9ff4823a9474310c2e8bb406b85","node_id":"C_kwDOUi30JNoAKGZhM2Q5Y2I5YTQ1OGM5ZmY0ODIzYTk0NzQzMTBjMmU4YmI0MDZiODU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commit/29fb061755998e7ad82341558ab3ed49cad7ddff","sha":"29fb061755998e7ad82341558ab3ed49cad7ddff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commits/29fb061755998e7ad82341558ab3ed49cad7ddff"}],"sha":"fa3d9cb9a458c9ff4823a9474310c2e8bb406b85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commits/fa3d9cb9a458c9ff4823a9474310c2e8bb406b85"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29709447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial","id":29709447,"login":"bcashofficial","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NzA5NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commits/29fb061755998e7ad82341558ab3ed49cad7ddff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T09:27:27Z","email":"bryan.cash@programitcash.com","name":"Bryan Cash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T09:27:27Z","email":"bryan.cash@programitcash.com","name":"Bryan Cash"},"message":"Add voices-design-system: the Module Federation remote''s core and DESIGN.md\n\nA pure remote named design_system exposing one barrel, ./theme, on port\n5301 — the same shape as the platform''s other design systems: Vite 6, React\n19 as the only shared singletons, Vitest + Testing Library on jsdom, ESLint\nand Prettier, a standalone Preview on the remote''s own URL, no remotes\nblock, no heavyweight runtime dependencies.\n\nWhat the barrel exports so far is the foundation every primitive will read:\n\n  tokens.ts        the five-color palette, both themes as semantic roles\n                   (pure white ground in light, the ink as ground in dark,\n                   three alpha steps of ink, two shadows, the grain and\n                   leather opacities), the two faces and their scale, the\n                   gold display offset, spacing, radius, motion, the board''s\n                   proportions\n  vocab.ts         the words — seven moods each with its gradient stops,\n                   the three groupings, the five sections, the labels —\n                   mirrored from voices-be lookups/vocab.py\n  fonts.ts         Anton and Archivo self-hosted as latin woff2 subsets with\n                   their OFL licences, resolved against this module''s origin\n                   so a federated consumer never fetches them cross-bundle\n  ground.ts        the pebbled leather tile drawn from a seeded generator\n                   and the grain film, mounted once as fixed layers under\n                   and over the page\n  cssVariables.ts  every token as an --sv-* custom property, one block per\n                   theme keyed by data-theme on the document root\n  VoicesTheme.tsx  the provider: mounts fonts, variables and grounds exactly\n                   once, owns light/dark (storage, then the OS), stamps the\n                   root, remembers the choice; useVoicesTheme() for consumers\n\nDESIGN.md is written from the approved board sheet and type sheet, both\ncopied into docs/ as the canonical references: the game-program-on-a-football\nmetaphor, the palette and two themes, the two faces and the offset, the\nno-borders/lift rule, text-only controls with the gold underline, the pulse\nbar and its seven gradients, the scoreboard, the board''s composition, the\nflyer, and the component inventory to be built one primitive at a time.\n\nSeven tests cover the theme tokens, the base CSS for both themes, the\ndeterministic leather tile, and the provider''s mounting and toggling. The\ntest setup installs an in-memory Storage because Node 22+ ships a\nlocalStorage global that shadows jsdom''s.","tree":{"sha":"83f7c452b91fb43d1aa15a995bc31d56ad286f06","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/git/trees/83f7c452b91fb43d1aa15a995bc31d56ad286f06"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/git/commits/29fb061755998e7ad82341558ab3ed49cad7ddff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29709447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial","id":29709447,"login":"bcashofficial","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NzA5NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commit/29fb061755998e7ad82341558ab3ed49cad7ddff","node_id":"C_kwDOUi30JNoAKDI5ZmIwNjE3NTU5OThlN2FkODIzNDE1NThhYjNlZDQ5Y2FkN2RkZmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commit/f678144beb8dc4d4b2201c62589d4a422b83dad2","sha":"f678144beb8dc4d4b2201c62589d4a422b83dad2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commits/f678144beb8dc4d4b2201c62589d4a422b83dad2"}],"sha":"29fb061755998e7ad82341558ab3ed49cad7ddff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commits/29fb061755998e7ad82341558ab3ed49cad7ddff"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29709447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial","id":29709447,"login":"bcashofficial","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NzA5NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commits/f678144beb8dc4d4b2201c62589d4a422b83dad2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T08:48:32Z","email":"bryan.cash@programitcash.com","name":"Bryan Cash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T08:48:32Z","email":"bryan.cash@programitcash.com","name":"Bryan Cash"},"message":"Add voices-be: the data model, migrations, seed command and first tests\n\nA Django 5.2 service (project package steeler_voices, port 8300) holding\nsix apps that together are the whole model agreed for the platform:\n\n  lookups     LKSources, LKVoiceTypes, LKMoods, LKTargets, LKSectionKinds,\n              LKArms, LKExperimentKinds, LKMetrics, LKPipelines — controlled\n              vocabularies with singular <table>_id UUID keys, seeded\n              idempotently by `manage.py seed_lookups` from lookups/vocab.py.\n              Moods and section kinds are deliberately empty: their words are\n              a design decision still to be made, and the tagging prompt and\n              document template will read them from the table.\n  voices      Voice (post or comment; a comment carries both its thread root\n              and its parent), Author, Week (Tuesday-to-Monday, Pittsburgh\n              time — weeks.py is the only place that arithmetic lives), Game,\n              Embedding (pgvector 384-d with an HNSW cosine index, plus the\n              2-D projection and topic), Reading (the batch tagger''s output,\n              kept as history per run, with a unit-interval check on\n              intensity and a subjects array replacing any roster), Topic.\n  documents   GenerationRun, Document (one published per week and arm,\n              enforced by a partial unique constraint), Section with its\n              structured claims, Citation, RetrievalEvent.\n  experiments Experiment, Variant, Assignment (one per subject per\n              experiment), Outcome keyed by LKMetrics.\n  pipelines   PipelineRun — every voices-de run reports here with its counts.\n  shared      base models, the voices_api_view / voices_internal_api_view\n              decorators with a uniform 500 envelope, pagination.\n\nRun references between apps are real foreign keys: the no-FK rule is a\ncross-service rule and this is one service. The first voices migration\ncreates the vector extension. Settings read every variable from the\nenvironment (a committed .env.development, overridable by .env) and fail at\nimport when one is missing.\n\ninfra/docker-compose.yml brings up pgvector/pgvector:pg16 and the backend;\nOllama defaults to the host''s own instance (the GPU path on a Mac) with a\nbundled-ollama profile for machines that have none. Postgres listens on\n5445 because 5443 was already taken locally. The root Makefile wraps it:\nmake dev / infra / stop / test-be / doctor.\n\nTwenty tests pass against the compose Postgres: the decorators, the week\nboundary in four time-zone cases, uniqueness and threading of voices, a\nvector round trip through pgvector, the intensity bound, assignment\nuniqueness, and the one-published-document rule.","tree":{"sha":"f4238e59b18c28c6cb75a10575cfb1da78c9921d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/git/trees/f4238e59b18c28c6cb75a10575cfb1da78c9921d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/git/commits/f678144beb8dc4d4b2201c62589d4a422b83dad2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29709447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial","id":29709447,"login":"bcashofficial","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NzA5NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commit/f678144beb8dc4d4b2201c62589d4a422b83dad2","node_id":"C_kwDOUi30JNoAKGY2NzgxNDRiZWI4ZGM0ZDRiMjIwMWM2MjU4OWQ0YTQyMmI4M2RhZDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commit/268d478d629f506752490cdf30e8e1253ba337d9","sha":"268d478d629f506752490cdf30e8e1253ba337d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commits/268d478d629f506752490cdf30e8e1253ba337d9"}],"sha":"f678144beb8dc4d4b2201c62589d4a422b83dad2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commits/f678144beb8dc4d4b2201c62589d4a422b83dad2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29709447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial","id":29709447,"login":"bcashofficial","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NzA5NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commits/268d478d629f506752490cdf30e8e1253ba337d9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T08:39:39Z","email":"bryan.cash@programitcash.com","name":"Bryan Cash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T08:39:39Z","email":"bryan.cash@programitcash.com","name":"Bryan Cash"},"message":"Add the seed collector: r/steelers into raw JSONL from the Arctic Shift archive\n\nvoices-de/seed/collect.py captures every post and comment from Tuesday\n2026-08-11 onward — five full Tuesday-to-Monday weeks plus the current\nPatriots week — into raw/posts.jsonl and raw/comments.jsonl, one verbatim\nReddit object per line, deduplicated by id. It backfills page by page (100\nrows, one request per second, exponential backoff on any failure), records\nthe newest created_utc per kind in raw/cursor.json so a restart resumes\ninstead of refetching, then keeps following the archive every ten minutes.\n\nArctic Shift was chosen after probing the alternatives: reddit.com''s JSON\nendpoints answer 403 without OAuth, its RSS feeds answer but only carry the\nnewest 25 posts / 100 comments and start returning 429 on the third rapid\nhit, and Bluesky''s public API is unreachable from here. The archive needs no\ncredentials, lags live by about thirty seconds, and returns the full Reddit\nshape (score, parent_id, link_id, permalink), which the RSS feeds strip.\n\nRaw captures, the cursor and the log are ignored; the curated seed that\nships with the repo will be produced from them by the seed pipeline.","tree":{"sha":"7a8e02855e4e7b7020308c9e0d002aaf169dfdd8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/git/trees/7a8e02855e4e7b7020308c9e0d002aaf169dfdd8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/git/commits/268d478d629f506752490cdf30e8e1253ba337d9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29709447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial","id":29709447,"login":"bcashofficial","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NzA5NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commit/268d478d629f506752490cdf30e8e1253ba337d9","node_id":"C_kwDOUi30JNoAKDI2OGQ0NzhkNjI5ZjUwNjc1MjQ5MGNkZjMwZThlMTI1M2JhMzM3ZDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commit/f0680aa56d4b22ea046d72462b4a31a7f3b392b3","sha":"f0680aa56d4b22ea046d72462b4a31a7f3b392b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commits/f0680aa56d4b22ea046d72462b4a31a7f3b392b3"}],"sha":"268d478d629f506752490cdf30e8e1253ba337d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commits/268d478d629f506752490cdf30e8e1253ba337d9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29709447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial","id":29709447,"login":"bcashofficial","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NzA5NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/commits/f0680aa56d4b22ea046d72462b4a31a7f3b392b3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T08:26:00Z","email":"bryan.cash@programitcash.com","name":"Bryan Cash"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T08:26:00Z","email":"bryan.cash@programitcash.com","name":"Bryan Cash"},"message":"Initialize the platform: layout, ports, and the locked decisions\n\nOne repository laid out as a platform folder: voices-be (Django, the only\ndatabase writer), voices-de (scheduled pipelines that POST to the backend),\nvoices-design-system (a pure Module Federation remote), voices-fe (the host)\nand infra (compose, the rig, the remote-schedule sketch).\n\nPLATFORM_ARCHITECTURE.md records the decisions taken before any code:\nr/steelers via its credential-free RSS feeds as the community, fantasy\nfootball as a grouping lens rather than a second source, fastembed\nbge-small-en-v1.5 into pgvector, Ollama as the only LLM, batch tagging in\nthe DE layer, one LangGraph graph whose baseline arm simply disables the\nretrieval nodes, a single experiments app for both generation arms and UI\nvariants, PCA/t-SNE for the flattened embedding view, minimum Module\nFederation depth with chart libraries kept out of the remote, and a port\nblock (83xx / 53xx / 5443) that does not collide with other local stacks.\n\nThe .gitignore keeps model caches, node_modules, build output and real .env\nfiles out of the tree; each service will ship a committed .env.development.","tree":{"sha":"25b0d5cefed999d22816dd9e57b2a36d10501a8a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/git/trees/25b0d5cefed999d22816dd9e57b2a36d10501a8a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bcashofficial/steeler-voices/git/commits/f0680aa56d4b22ea046d72462b4a31a7f3b392b3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29709447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bcashofficial/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bcashofficial","id":29709447,"login":"bcashofficial"